Page 9 ء ث م: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|he|א־ש־ם|tr=ʾ-š-m}} and {{cog|uga|𐎀𐎘𐎎|t=to be in debt for}}. The origin, beyond its mere presence during {{w|Central Semitic}} unity, is unknown. A relation with {{ar-root|و ث م|nocat=1}}, which refers to some basic idea of compaction, comminution and paucity, is possible: compare the root relation of {{m|ar|إِبِل}}.

