#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 906|author=ar:الناشئ الأكبر<tr:[[w:ar:الناشئ الأكبر|an-nāšiʾ al-ʾakbar]]>|url=https://www.aldiwan.net/poem71190.html|title=ar:كأنما الآل باعوا لها<qq:first line>|passage=كأنما '''الآل''' باعوا لها … سوائمٌ قد غابَ راعيها<br/>تتلع أحياناً أكمها … ثم تهاوى في مهاويها|t=As though '''the family''' sold her … cattle of which the herder dashes<br/>Their hills at times can hold them … Then into their pits she crashes.}}
# {{senseid|ar|vapor}}{{C|ar|Atmospheric phenomena}}{{lb|ar|obsolete}} a [[vapor]] or [[exhalation]] that becomes visible in the [[desert]] in the [[morn]] or [[eve]] distinct from a {{m|ar|سَرَاب}} by not reflecting
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=c. 700|author=ar:أُميَّةُ بن أَبي عائِذٍ الهُذَليّ<tr:[https://almerja.com/reading.php?ida=575&id=556&idm=30879 Umayya ibn ʾabī ʿāʾiḏ] ([[w:Banu Hudhayl|al-huḏalīy]])>|title=[[w:ar:ديوان الهذليين|Dīwān al-Huḏalīyīn]]|trans-title=Diwan Hodsailitarum  / Hudsailian poems / Huḏaylitendiwan|page=201 verse 38 in [[w:de:Gottfried Kosegarten (Orientalist)|Kosegarten]]’s edition<!--and a recent Arabic edition https://books.google.com/books?id=B8A_AQAAIAAJ&q="طرفة"+"الآل"+"سراب"&dq="طرفة"+"الآل"+"سراب"-->|passage=وَفِي غَمْرَةِ '''الْآلِ''' خِلْتُ الصُّوَى … عُرُوكًا عَلَى رَائِس يَقْسِمُونَا|t=In the overabundance of '''fogs''' I fancied the barrows … the mariners onto the valleyhead, dividing us}}

