*: {{desc|ckb|ئان|bor=1}}, {{l|ckb|عان}}
*: {{desc|sdh|ئان|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|آن|tr=ân|bor=1|t=moment}}
*: {{desc|ug|ئان|bor=1|t=moment, instant}}
* {{desc|tr|an|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
See above.

