===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|pal||tr=ʾp̄zʾl|sc=Phlv}}, {{m|pal||tr=ʾp̄cʾl|ts=abzār, abčār|sc=Phlv|t=instrument, tool; spice}}, in {{cog|fa-cls|افزار|tr=afzâr}}, {{m|fa|اوزار|tr=avzâr}}, {{m|fa|ابزار|tr=abzâr|t=tool}}, also in the sense of a marinade {{m|fa|آچار||tr=âčâr}}, which serves another borrowing into the Arabic culinary regiolects as {{m|afb|اچار|أَچَار|tr=ačār}} ~ {{doublet|ar|عُشَّار|t1=pickles|id1=pickles|notext=1}}.<br/>
Conflated with {{m|ar|بِزْر|t=seed}}, as if denoting seeds used for seasoning.

