|translation=There has come to you enlightenment from your Lord. So whoever will '''see''' does so for his soul, and whoever is blind against it. And say, "I am not a guardian over you."
|subst=فَمَنْ/فَ-مَنْ,فَلِنَفْسِهِ/فَ-لِ-نَفْسِهِ,وَمَنْ/وَ-مَنْ,فَعَلَيْهَا/فَ-عَلَيْهَا,وَمَا/وَ-مَا}}

