# {{senseid|ar|number}} [[one]]
#: {{ux|ar|[[أَحَدٌ وَعِشْرُونَ]]|tr=ʾaḥadun wa-ʿišrūna|twenty-one|lit=one and twenty|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|ar|[[إِحْدَى وَعِشْرُونَ]]|tr=ʾiḥdā wa-ʿišrūna|twenty-one|lit=one and twenty|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|ar|[[أَحَدَ عَشَرَ]]|eleven|inline=1}}
