# {{lb|ar|negative polarity item}} a [[person]]; [[somebody]], [[someone]]; [[anybody]], [[anyone]]
#* '''7th century''', The Quran
#*: {{quote|ar|قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّٰهُ أَحَدٌ / ٱللَّٰهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ / لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ / وَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَهُ كُفُوًا '''أَحَدٌ'''|subst=لهُ/لَهُو|t=Say: He, Allah, is one. / Allah is He on Whom all depend. / He begets not, nor is He begotten; / And not '''anyone''' is like Him.}}

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj|أَحَد}}

# [[one]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=|title=''The Quran''|edition=|year=7th century {{CE}}|url=https://ar.wikisource.org/wiki/القرآن_الكريم/سورة_الإخلاص|text={{lang|ar|قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّٰهُ '''أَحَدٌ''' / ٱللَّٰهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ / لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ / وَلَمْ يَكُنْ لَهُ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌ}}|transliteration=qul huwa llāhu '''ʾaḥadun''' / llāhu ṣ-ṣamadu / lam yalid wa-lam yūlad / wa-lam yakun lahū kufuwan ʾaḥadun|translation=Say: He, Allah, is '''one'''. / Allah is He on Whom all depend. / He begets not, nor is He begotten; / And not anyone is like Him.}}

