{{ar-verb|II.III:ي.pass.vn:+,أَدَاء}}

# to [[bring]], to [[convey]], to [[deliver]]
# {{qualifier|debt}} to [[pay]], to [[discharge]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|2|283|passage=فَإِنْ أَمِنَ بَعْضُكُمْ بَعْضًا '''فَلْيُؤَدِّ''' ٱلَّذِي ٱؤْتُمِنَ أَمَانَتَهُ}}
# to [[perform]], to [[fulfill]], to [[accomplish]]
# to [[cause]], to [[produce]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=1377 {{C.E.}}|author=w:en:Ibn Khaldun|title=تاريخ ابن خلدون|publisher=Dar Al-Fikr|location=Beirut|edition=1st|year_published=1981|volume=1|page=386|passage=وَٱنْصِبْ لِمَرْضَى الْمُسْلِمِين دُورًا تَأْوِيهِمْ وَقُوَّامًا يَرْفِقُونَ بِهِمْ وَأَطِبَّاءَ يُعَالِجُونَ أَسْقَامَهُمْ وَأَسْعِفْهُمْ بِشَهَوَاتِهِمْ مَا لَمْ '''يُؤَدِّ''' ذٰلِكَ إِلَى إِسْرَافٍ فِي بَيْتِ الْمَالِ.|translation=Set up houses for Muslims who are ill, to shelter them. (Appoint) attendants in these houses who will handle them kindly, and (appoint) physicians who will treat their diseases. Comply with their desires so long as it does not '''lead''' to waste in the treasury.}}
# to [[lead]], to [[direct]], to [[guide]] {{+obj|ar|acc/:بِ<someone/something> + :إِلَى<to something>}}
# to [[contribute]], to [[lead]], to [[tend]] {{+obj|ar|:إِلَى<to a result>}}
# to [[take]] (a test, an oath)
# {{misconstruction of|ar|أَوْدَى}}

