Page 451 أذن الفأر: -------- begin text --------
{{swp|lang=ar|أذن الفأر}}
[[File:20160429Myosotis stricta1.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|أُذن الْفَأْر}} – {{taxlink|Myosotis stricta|species}}|upright=1.15]]
[[File:Anagallis arvensis (8754231935).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|أُذن الْفَأْر}} – {{taxfmt|Anagallis arvensis|species}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
Literally “ear of the mouse”, {{clq|ar|grc|μυοσωτίς|lit=[[mouse-ear]]|nocap=1}}, probably via its calque {{clq|ar|syc|ܐܹܕܢܲܝ  ܥܘ݂ܩܒܪ̈ܐ|tr=ʾeḏnay ʿuqbǝrē|notext=1|lit=[[mouse-ear]]|g=p}} which is also transmitted corruptly as an alleged {{m|ar||**عَنْقَر}}, which should be corrected to {{m|ar||عُقْبَر}}; pursuant to which this Arabic is also often posited in the plural.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|أُذْن الْفَأْر}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|[[أُذْن]] [[ال]][[فَأْر]]|f|pl=آذَان الْفَأْر}}

# {{&lit|ar|أُذْن|فَأْر|nodot=1}}
# [[forget-me-not]], [[scorpion grass|scorpion-grass]] ({{taxfmt|Myosotis|genus}} gen. et spp., especially the {{vern|blue forget-me-not}}, {{vern|small-flowered forget-me-not}} ({{taxlink|Myosotis stricta|species}}))
# [[pimpernel]] ({{taxfmt|Anagallis|genus}} gen. et spp.)
#: {{syn|ar|حَبَق الْفَتَى|أَنَاغَالِس|حَبَق الْفِيل}}<!--alleged عَنْقَر looks like تصحيف for عَبْقَر but is probably corrupt from the Syriac ܐܸܕܢܲܝ  ܥܘ݂ܩܒܪܹ̈ܐ and thus عُقْبَر, and perhaps not used like that either. Alleged ریحان داود I am not sure whether it is supposed to be Arabic or Persian, maybe also corrupt for ریحان دارو-->

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|أُذْن|mod=فَأْر|idafa=def|pl=آذَان}}

{{C|ar|Borage family plants|Primrose family plants}}
-------- end text --------
