Seemingly a {{back-formation|ar|أَرْجُوَان|nocap=1|t=redbud}}; however the presumable mutilation of the phytonym could have originated in colloquial {{bor|ar|pal|-}}, taking inspiration from the suffix {{m|pal||-īg}}, {{der|ar|ira-pro|*-ikah}}, from {{der|ar|ine-pro|*-kos}}; the suffix’s earlier state {{m|pal||-īk}} can be seen in {{m|ar|زَمْزَرِيق|t=redbud}}.

