===Etymology===
Apparently {{clq|ar|syc|ܐܪܝܐ ܕܓܘܡܐ|tr=ʾaryā də-gūmā|nocap=1|t=broomrape|lit=lion of the bean}}, {{cog|syc|ܐܪܝܐ|tr=ʾaryā|t=lion}} being fitter for transferred use and also encountered in other plant names.

