#: {{ux|ar|'''أَسْفَرَتِ''' ٱلْحَرْبُ عَنْ مَقْتَلِ ٱلْعَدِيدِ مِنَ ٱلْأَطْفَالِ.|The war '''led''' to numerous deaths of children.}}
#* {{quote-journal|1=ar|url=https://www.libyaakhbar.com/libya-news/469181.html|title=ar:السلطات اللبنانية: تحرير ثلاثة مواطنين خطفوا في بغداد|date=Oct 29 2017|work=Libya Akhbar|accessdate=29 October 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171029161632/https://www.libyaakhbar.com/libya-news/469181.html|archivedate=29 October 2017
|passage=و'''أسفرت''' العملية التي نفذتها المخابرات العراقية وفق البيان عن «اعتقال بعض الخاطفين وقتل أحدهم خلالها، وتتم ملاحقة بقية أفراد العصابة».
|translation=And the operation which the Iraqi intelligence carried out, '''led''', according to the statement, to “the arrest of a deal of the kidnappers and to the killing of one of them during the course of it, and the pursuit of the rest of the individuals of the gang is proceeding.”}}

