|passage=لَيْسَ لَهُمْ طَعَامٌ إِلَّا مِنْ ضَرِيعٍ ۝ لَا '''يُسْمِنُ''' وَلَا يُغْنِي مِنْ جُوعٍ
|translation=No food is for them, only from a moisture-less thistle, not causing nourishment, nor causing satisfaction from hunger.
|subst=ضَرِيعٍ ۝ لَا/ضَرِيعٍ &#47; لَا}}
