Page 727 أشق: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{nonlemma}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb-form|أَشُقْ|I}}

# {{inflection of|ar|شَاقَ||1|s|non-past|actv|jussive}}

