* {{desc|ML.|alasach|alt=alaſach|bor=1}} {{q|Spain, emended from ''aſaſach''}}<ref name="Steiger">{{R:Steiger-Voces|page=56}}</ref>
* {{desc|bor=1|osp|alguaxaque|aluaxaque|aluahasaque|aluasaque|alguaxac|arguaxaque}}
* {{desc|bor=1|syc|ܐܘܫܩ|tr=ʾawšāq}}<ref name="Henning"/><ref name="Löw"/><ref>{{R:CAL|)w%24q|N}}</ref>

