# to [[drive]], to [[goad]], to [[prod]], to [[propel]] ''(livestock)''
# to [[lame]], to [[paralyze]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|IV}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ar-color/defect adjective}} from the root {{ar-root|ش ل ل}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَشَلّ}}

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj|أَشَلّ|f=شَلَّاء|cpl=شُلّ}}

