# {{n-g|a name for various [[tubuliflorous]] [[composite]]s of [[ligulate]] [[flower head]]s}}
## {{taxfmt|Chrysanthemum|genus}} in a wide sense also including species otherwise sorted under {{taxlink|Glebionis|genus}}, {{taxlink|Coleostephus|genus}}
## {{taxfmt|Anthemis|genus}}, {{taxfmt|Matricaria|genus}}, {{taxlink|Chamaemelum|genus}} spp.
