# to cause [[camels]] to [[travel]] at [[night]] with [[intention]] of [[bringing]] them [[closer]] to a [[water]]-[[source]] so that they may [[attain]] a [[drink]] by the [[morning]], to [[travel]] at [[night]] toward [[water]], to be a [[people]] whose [[camels]] are [[undertaking]] the night [[journey]] for such a purpose
# to be the [[distance]] of one night's travel before [[reaching]] [[water]]

