===Etymology 1.1===
From the root {{ar-root|ء|ق|ط}}, related to {{ar-root|ق|ط|ط}} in the sense of "contracted", as the liquid compacts into solid pieces; cognate with {{cog|akk|𒂵𒄯|tr=eqīdu|t=cheese}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَقِط}}

====Noun====
