* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|page=45}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=1|page=42}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=70}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|قط|page=2539-2541}}
* {{R:sux:ePSD|eqīdu}}

