# to [[affirm]], to [[maintain]] (a belief, idea, etc.)
# to [[emphasize]], to [[stress]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<something>/:أَنَّ<that ...>}}
# to [[bind]] [[firmly]] (a [[horse]]'s or [[camel]]'s [[saddle]])

=====Usage notes=====
According to Lane, the more correct verb to use in place of this one is {{m|ar|وَكَّدَ}}, with similar meanings.

