Page 1117 ألفباء: -------- begin text --------
[[Image:Arabischesalphabet.svg|thumb|right|400 px|Arabic alphabet.]]

===Etymology===
From the first two letters of the Arabic alphabet arranged in the modern style. This is the standard alphabetical order used for sorting words:

{{lang|ar|أ ب ت ث ج ح خ د ذ ر ز س ش ص ض ط ظ ع غ ف ق ك ل م ن ه و ي}}

Attested since at least 1435, in [[w:Ahmad ibn Arabshah|Ahmad ibn Arabshah]]'s work ''Aja'ib al-Maqdur fi Nawa'ib al-Taymur''<ref>[https://www.google.com/books/edition/Ahmedis_Arabsiadae_Vitae_rerum_gestarum/iVxkAAAAcAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=%D8%A3%D9%84%D9%81%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%A1+before:1650&pg=PP295&printsec=frontcover ]</ref>

