From {{m|ar|أَلْمَانِيَا|gloss=[[Germany]]}}, with the first quadriliteral conjugation implying the bestowing of a particular quality. Compare {{m|ar|أَمْرَكَ|gloss=to [[Americanize]], to make [[American]]}}، {{m|ar|فَرْنَسَ|gloss=to [[gallicize|Gallicize]], to make [[French]]}}, {{m|ar|عَرَّبَ|gloss=to [[Arabize]], to make [[Arab]]}}, {{m|ar|تَرَّكَ|gloss=to [[Turkify]], to make [[Turkish]]}}, {{m|ar|هَوَّدَ|gloss=to [[Judaize]], to make [[Jewish]]}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# To [[Germanize]], to make [[German]]

