** {{desc|ms|alwah|alwat|bor=1}}
* {{desc|zh|蘆薈|tr=lúhuì|bor=1|unc=1}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ar-rootbox|ء ل و}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَلْوَة|أُلْوَة}}

