* {{desc|ml|bor=1|ഉമ്മ}}

===Etymology 2===
{{univerbation|ar}} of the interrogative particle {{m|ar|أَ}} and the conjunction {{m|ar|إِن|*ٱِم}}. Compare {{m|ar|إِمَّا}} for disjunction.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَمْ}}

====Conjunction====
{{ar-con|أَمْ}}

# {{lb|ar|chiefly after interrogatives}} {{non-gloss definition|indicates an '''exclusive''' disjunction introduced with {{m|ar|أَ}}, as in alternative questions}}
#: {{ux|ar|أَمِنَ الْعِراقِ أَنْتَ '''أَمْ''' مِنْ مِصْرَ؟|t=Are you from Iraq '''or''' Egypt?}}
#: {{ux|ar|لَا أَدْرِي أَشَقِيٌّ صَاحِبُكَ '''أَمْ''' سَعِيدٌ.|t=I do not know whether your friend is happy '''or''' downhearted.}}
#: {{ux|ar|أَمُحَمَّدٌ أَوْ إِبْرَاهِيمُ أَفْضَلُ '''أَمْ''' سَمِيرٌ؟|t=Is Muhammad or Ibrahim better [than Samir] '''or''' is Samir better [than either of them]?}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|21:109
|passage=فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا فَقُلْ آذَنْتُكُمْ عَلَى سَوَاءٍ وَإِنْ أَدْرِي أَقَرِيبٌ '''أَم''' بَعِيدٌ مَّا تُوعَدُونَ
|translation=But if they turn away, then say, “I have announced to [all of] you equally. And I know not whether near '''or''' far is that which you are promised.”
|subst=فَ/فَ-,وَإِنْ/وَ-إِنْ,أَقَرِيبٌ/أَ-قَرِيبٌ}}
#* {{quote-web|1=ar|url=http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509816374044405500/|work=Al-Quds|date=Nov 4 2017|title=ar:مستشار في حملة ترامب يعترف باجراء اتصالات مع مسؤولين روس|accessdate=4 November 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171104193144/http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509816374044405500/|archivedate=4 November 2017
|passage=كان قد نفى او تجنب الاجابة في مقابلات سابقة مع الصحيفة حول ما اذا كان قد التقى مسؤولين روسا ام لا.
|translation=He had denied or avoided answering in previous interviews with the paper regarding whether he had met Russian officials or not.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|indicates an '''inclusive''' disjunction introduced with {{m|ar|أَ}} that denotes sameness, indistinguishability, unimportance, insignificance, or indifference}}
#: {{ux|ar|أَنَا أُحِبُّكَ سَوَاءٌ (أَ)أَحْبَبْتَنِي '''أَمْ''' لَمْ تُحِبَّنِي.|t=I love you, no matter whether you love me '''or''' whether you do not love me.}}
#: {{ux|ar|سَأَفُوزُ سَوَاءٌ (أَ)شِئْتَ '''أَمْ''' أَبَيْتَ|I will win whether you like it '''or''' not.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|63|6|passage=سَوَاءٌ عَلَيْهِمْ أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ لَهُمْ '''أَمْ''' لَمْ تَسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ لَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللّٰهُ لَهُمْ|t=It is the same for them whether you pray for their forgiveness '''or''' whether you do not: Allah will not forgive them.}}

