Page 1175 أمام: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ء|م|م}} meaning "to head in a direction", "to lead".

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|أَمَامَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-أمام.ogg}}

===Preposition===
{{ar-prep|أَمَامَ}}

# [[before]], [[in front of]], in the [[presence]] of
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|75|5-6|passage=بَلۡ یُرِیدُ ٱلۡإِنسَـٰنُ لِیَفۡجُرَ  '''أَمَامَهُۥ'''. ٦. یَسۡـَٔلُ "أَیَّانَ یَوۡمُ ٱلۡقِیَـٰمَةِ؟"|t=But man would fain deny what is '''before him'''. 6. He asketh: "When will be this Day of Resurrection?"}}
# [[against]] the [[encroachment]] of something
#* {{quote-web|1=ar|passage=وأصدر خليفة حفتر بحسب كتابه إلى رئيس مجلس إدارة الهيئة العامة للمواصلات والنقل بالحكومة الموقتة بالبيضاء، أمرا بقفل ميناء طبرق البحري في شرق البلاد '''أمام''' الملاحة الدولية.|translation=The debuty of Ḥaftar has, as per his writing to the head of the governing group of the public organization for transport and traffic in the provisional government of [[w:Bayda, Libya|Bayḍāʾ]], issued an order to close the sea port of [[w:Tobruk|Ṭubruq]] in the east of the country for international shipping.|url=https://www.libyaakhbar.com/libya-news/456461.html|title=حفتر يقفل ميناء طبرق '''أمام''' الملاحة الدولية ويستبدل مسار السفن إلى ميناء بنغازي|date=13-10-2017|work=LibyaAkhbar.com|accessdate=13 October 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171013223248/https://www.libyaakhbar.com/libya-news/456461.html|archivedate=13 October 2017}}
# [[in the face of]]

