Page 1203 أمسى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|مَسَاء|t=[[evening]]}}. Sense of “become” resembles other verbs of similar meaning derived from different times of day; compare {{m|ar|أَصْبَحَ}}, {{m|ar|بَاتَ}}, {{m|ar|أَضْحَى}}, all meaning "become."

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|IV.III:و}}

# {{lb|ar|copulative}} to [[become]]
#: {{syn|ar|Thesaurus:صار}}
# to be or become in the evening
# to begin the evening
# to spend the evening

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|IV.III:و}}
-------- end text --------
