* {{desc|afb|آنا|tr=āna}}
* {{desc|mt|jien|alts=1}}
* {{desc|ary|آنا|tr=ʔāna|alts=1}}
* {{desc|ajp|أنا|tr=ʔana}}
* {{desc|aeb|آنا|tr=ʔāna}}

=====See also=====
{{ar-personal pronouns}}

