{{wp|lang=ar|منجا (فاكهة)|أَنْبَج}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|عَنْبَة|عَنْبَا|ענבא|tr3=ʕanbā||later}}

===Etymology===
Via {{bor|ar|pal|tr=ʾmbk'|ts=ambag|t=*mango; a preserve, conserve}}. The alternative form {{m|ar|عَنْبَة}} / {{m|ar|عَْنْبَا}} is from Neo-{{bor|ar|fa|انبه|tr=anba}} as well as directly via [[Apabhramsha|Apabhraṃśa]] from {{der|ar|sa|आम्र|t=mango}}. Later again borrowed from modern {{cog|inc|-}} languages into the dialects, as from {{cog|mr|-}} the {{cog|acm|عَمْبَة|t=mango pickle mash|tr=ʕamba}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|أَمْبَج|أَمْبِج}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|أَنْبَج|m|head2=أَنْبِج}}

# {{C|ar|Sumac family plants}} [[mango]] (tree and fruit)
#: {{syn|ar|مَنْجَا|tr1=mangā}}
#*;: {{l|ar||أَنْبَج}}
