#*;: {{l|ar||عَنْبَة}}
#* {{RQ:Ibn Batoutah|volume=III|page=125|line=2 a fine|lang=ar}}
#* {{RQ:Ibn Batoutah|volume=IV|page=229|line=1|lang=ar}}
#*;: {{l|ar|ענבא|tr=ʕanbā}}
#* {{R:ar:Lambourn-AL|instead=1|lang=ar|page=256 line 22|passage=נהׄ גחאל ענבא|tr=5 giḥāl ʕanbā|translation=5 waterskins of mango}}
