Page 1282 أنثى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʔanθ-at-}}. Related to the verb {{m|ar|أَنُثَ||to be [[feminine]]}}. Has the form of a feminine {{ar-elative|lc=1|nocat=1}}. Cognate with {{cog|uga|𐎀𐎘𐎚||wife}}, {{cog|akk|aššatum|𒁮|tr=aššatum|t=wife}}, {{cog|arc|אִנְתְּתָא|tr=ʾintəṯā}}, {{m|arc|אִיתְּתָא|tr=ʾittəṯā}}, {{cog|he|אישה|אִשָּׁה|tr=ʾiššâ}} and {{cog|syc|ܐܢܬܬܐ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|أُنْثَى}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-أنثى.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|أُنْثَى|f|d=أُنْثَيَانِ|pl=إِنَاث|pl2=أَنَاثَى|pl3=أُنُث}}

# a [[female]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|49|13|passage=يَا أَيُّهَا النَّاسُ إِنَّا خَلَقْنَاكُم مِن ذَكَرٍ وَ'''أُنْثَى''' وَجَعَلْنَاكُمْ شُعُوبًا وَقَبَائِلَ لِتَعَارَفُوا|t=O mankind! Indeed, We created you from a male and a '''female''' and made you nations and tribes that you may be well acquainted with one another.|subst=وَ/وَ-,لِتَعَارَفُوا/لِ-تَعَارَفُوا}}
# {{lb|ar|in the dual|obsolete}} [[testicles]]

====Declension====
