===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|grc|ἄγκῡρα}}, possibly via {{bor|ar|fa-cls|لنگر|tr=langar}} with {{rebracketing|ar|nocap=1}}. However, other Greek nautical terms reached Arabic directly.

===Noun===
