# [[anchor]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|أَنْجَر:tri|pl=أَنَاجِر}}<!--That this is a triptote is a guess, based on أَرْنَب and borrowed Persian word أَبْزَن. Found in Steingass, which doesn't indicate diptote status. Not in Wehr or Lane, which do. Elatives of this same form are diptotes.-->

