===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ن ز ل}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَنْزَلَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|IV}}

# to make go down, to get down
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|22:5
|passage=وَتَرَى ٱلْأَرْضَ هَامِدَةً فَإِذَا '''أَنْزَلْنَا''' عَلَيْهَا ٱلْمَاءَ ٱهْتَزَّتْ وَرَبَتْ وَأَنْبَتَتْ مِنْ كُلِّ زَوْجٍ بَهِيجٍ
|translation=And you see the earth barren, but when '''We send down''' upon it rain, it quivers and swells and grows [something] of every beautiful kind.
|subst=وَ/وَ-,فَ/فَ-}}
# to [[reveal]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|4:61
|passage=وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا إِلَى مَا '''أَنْزَلَ''' اللّٰهُ وَإِلَى الرَّسُولِ رَأَيْتَ الْمُنَافِقِينَ يَصُدُّونَ عَنْكَ صُدُودًا
|translation=And when it is said to them “come to what Allah has '''revealed''' and to the Messenger” you see the hypocrites turning away in aversion from you.
|subst=وَ/وَ-}}

