===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|و ف ر}}
{{ar-elative}} of {{m|ar|وَفِير||[[abundant]]}} and {{m|ar|وَافِر||[[abundant]], [[profuse]]}} and {{m|ar|وَفْر||[[abundant]], [[general]]}}. Unusually, declined as if a {{ar-color/defect adjective|lc=1|nocat=1}} (according to Steingass and Almaany; see below). Also compare {{m|ar|وَفَّرَ||to [[save]], to [[economize]]}}.

