Page 1501 أي: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʔayy-}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَيّ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-أي.ogg}}

====Pronoun====
{{ar-pron|أَيّ|m|g2=f}}

# [[which]] ...? [[what]] ...? [[what]] [[kind]] of ...? {{qualifier|followed by a noun in the genitive or a personal suffix}}
#: {{ux|ar|مِنْ '''أَيِّ''' بَلَدٍ أَنْتَ؟|t=From '''which''' country are you?}}
#: {{ux|ar|'''أَيًّا''' مِنْ هٰذِهِ الْأَلْعَابِ تُفَضِّلُ؟|t='''Which''' of these games do you prefer?}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|31|34|passage=وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ مَاذَا تَكْسِبُ غَدًا وَمَا تَدْرِي نَفْسٌ بِ'''أَيِّ''' أَرْضٍ تَمُوتُ|subst=وَمَا/وَ-مَا,بِ'''أَيِّ'''/بِ-'''أَيِّ'''|t=[...] and no soul perceives '''in what''' land it will die.}}
# [[whichever]]
#: {{ux|ar|'''أَيَّ''' كِتَابٍ تَقْرَأْ يُفِدْكَ|t='''Whichever''' book you read, it'll benefit you.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|17|110|passage='''أَيًّا''' مَا تَدْعُوا فَلَهُ ٱلْأَسْمَاءُ ٱلْحُسْنَى|subst=فَلَهُ/فَ-لَهُ|t=[... by] '''whatever''' [name] you call upon [Him], to Him belongs the best names.}}
# [[any]]
#: {{ux|ar|زُرْنِي فِي '''أَيِّ''' وَقْتٍ|t=Visit me at '''any''' time.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* While {{m|ar|أَيّ}} can be used with masculine as well as feminine nouns, the form {{m|ar|أَيَّة}} is exclusively used with feminine nouns.

=====Declension=====
