Page 1532 أين: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From the root {{ar-root|ء ي ن}}, meaning “to come or approach”, “to become or happen”, “to draw near to a place or time”; related to {{ar-root|ء|ي|ي|nocat=1}} and {{m|ar|آن}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|أَيْنَ}}
* {{ar-IPA|أَيْن}}

====Adverb====
{{ar-adv|أَيْنَ}}

# {{lb|ar|interrogative}} [[where]], [[at]] [[which]] [[place]], [[whence]]
#: {{uxi|ar|'''أَيْنَ''' أَنْتَ؟|'''Where''' are you?}}
#: {{uxi|ar|إِلَى '''أَيْنَ''' أَنْتَ ذَاهِبٌ؟|(To) '''where''' are you going?}}
#: {{uxi|ar|مِنْ '''أَيْنَ''' لَكَ هَٰذَا؟|From '''where''' did you get that?}}
# {{lb|ar|conditional}} [[wherever]]
# {{lb|ar|interrogative}} {{+obj|ar|noun/pronoun<how is it different> + :مِن(noun/pronoun)<from something else>}} {{q|usually implying there is no relationship}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أَيْنَ هٰذَا مِن ذَاكَ؟|What does this have to do with that? / What comparison is there between them?!}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أَيْنَ الثَّرَى مِنَ الثُّرَيَّا!|How far is the soil from the Pleiades!|q=a saying or pun}}
# {{lb|ar|nonstandard|rare}} {{synonym of|ar|حَيْثُ}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|url=https://arabic.euronews.com/2014/11/24/turning-the-tide-in-the-war-against-aids|work=[[w:Euronews|Euronews Arabic]]|date=2014-11-24|title=ar: الايدز: لقاحات جديدة لتفعيل الاستجابة المناعية
|passage=الحملات العامة تجلب الناس المحاذين للخطر إلى مراكز مثل مركز المراقبة بي.سي.أن ، أين{{sic}} يمكنهم إجراء إختبار{{sic}} على فيروس فقدان المناعة بطريقة سريعة ومجهولة}}

=====Derived terms=====
