This spelling is used in most of the [[Qur'an]], alongside {{m|ar|إبرهم|إِبْرَٰهِـۧم|tr=ʔibrāhīm}}; see there for more on their usage.

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|إِبْرَٰهِيمُ|state=ind-def}}
