Page 1565 إبريز: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|la|obryzum|t=pure gold}}, from {{der|ar|grc|ὄβρυζον}}, from {{m|grc|ὄβρυζος|t=pure}}, from {{m|grc|ὄβρυζα|t=assaying of gold}}, ultimately from {{der|ar|xhu|𒂁𒄷𒌋𒌒𒊒𒍑𒄭|tr=DUG.ḫu-u-ub-ru-uš-ḫi|ts=ḫubrušḫi|t=crucible, smelter, melting-pot}}, likely via the route of {{der|ar|hit|𒄷𒌒𒊒𒍑𒄭|tr=ḫu-up-ru-uš-ḫi|ts=ḫuprušḫi-}}. Borrowings also attested in {{cog|arc-jla|אובריזין|tr=ʾaḇrōzōn}}, {{cog|akk|𒄷𒌒𒊒𒍑𒄷|tr=ḫu-up-ru-uš-ḫu|ts=ḫuprušḫu|t=earthen, metal, precious, container}}, and {{cog|uga|𐎃𐎁𐎗𐎘|t=stew-pot}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِبْرِيز}}

===Noun===
