===Etymology===
From {{der|ar|pal|-}} or {{der|ar|xpr||*ābrēk}} possibly via {{bor|ar|syc|ܐܒܪܝܩܐ|tr=ʾaḇrēqā}}, attested as {{cog|fa-cls|آبریز|tr=ābrēz}} from {{m|fa|آب|tr=âb|t=water}} + the present stem of the verb {{m|fa|ریختن|tr=rêxtan|t=to pour}}.

