Page 1579 إبليز: -------- begin text --------
{{was fwotd|ar|2019|August|17}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|grc|πηλός|t=clay}}, or {{m|grc|ἰλύς|t=mud, slime}} with the {{bor|ar|cop|ⲡⲓ-}} masculine singular definite article, though {{m|grc|ἰλύς|t=mud, slime}} is feminine and would require {{m|cop|ϯ-}}; originally this word was applied particularly to the alluvial deposit of the [[Nile]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِبْلِيز}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|إِبْلِيز|m}}

# the [[sludge]] left behind by a [[river]] that has [[retreat]]ed, [[alluvium]]
#: {{syn|ar|طَمْي|غَرِين}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=1203|author=ar:عبد اللطيف بن يوسف البغدادي<t:{{w|Abd al-Latif al-Baghdadi|ʿAbd-al-Laṭīf Ibn Yūsuf al-Baġdādīy}}>|title=Compendium memorabilium Aegypti|editor={{w|Joseph White (orientalist)|Joseph White}}|year_published=1789 [https://books.google.com/books?id=pOPJpWszrAoC&pg=PA3#v=onepage&q&f=false <sup>GB</sup>] and 1800 [https://archive.org/details/in.ernet.dli.2015.358151/page/n53 <sup>Archive</sup>]|url=https://archive.org/details/bub_gb_g5jbaLFi5mIC/page/n3|section=[https://archive.org/details/bub_gb_g5jbaLFi5mIC/page/n14 page 3] 1789, [https://digi.ub.uni-heidelberg.de/diglit/white1800/0060 page 6] 1800|passage=إن أرض مصر رملية لا تصلح للزراعة، لكنه يأتيها طين أسود علك فيه دسومة كثيرة يسمى '''الإيليز'''؛ يأتيها من بلاد السودان مختلطًا بماء النيل عند مده، فيستقر الطين، وينضب الماء، فيحرث ويزرع. وكل سنة يأتيها طين جديد، ولهذا يزرع جميع أراضيها ولا يراح شيء منها، كما يفعل في العراق والشام.|t=The land of Egypt is sandy and unsuitable for agriculture, but to it comes a black viscose mud of much richness called ''iblīz''; it comes from the lands of the Sudan mingled with Nile water at rising tide, and the mud having settled and the water having drained one can plough and sow. And every year new mud comes to it and most of the regions of Egypt are sown by this, and it wanes by no jot, unlike it does in Iraq or Syria.}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|work=ar:الرياض|date=2011-09-16|url=http://www.alriyadh.com/667644|title=ar:«المخصيون».. جنس بشري منقطع النسل خدموا «نساء البلاط» وقصور السلاطين|passage=ويدهنون مكان الجرح بعجينة من الطين '''الإبليز''' والزيت.|tr=wa yudahhinūna makāna al-gurḥi bi ʿajīnatin min aṭ-ṭīni, al-ʾiblīzi, wa az-zayti.|t=And they anoint the place of the wound with a paste of clay, sludge, and oil.}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|إِبْلِيز}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|page=152}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=248}}
* {{R:ar:Vollers-Beitr.|part=III|page=294}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=3}}

