* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=139}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=3|pages=235–240}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Pflanzen|page=208}}
* {{R:akk:Thompson-Botany|pages=93, 307}}

