Page 1802 إشتيام: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|arc|אִישְׁתְּיָאמָא|tr=ʾištyāmā}} / {{m|syc|ܐܸܫܬܝܵܡܵܐ|tr=ʾeštyāmā|t=captain}}, assumed to be from {{der|ar|akk|𒊮𒌓|tr=ŠA₃.TAM|ts=šatammu|t=administrator, chief accountant}}, from {{der|ar|sux|𒊮𒌓|tr=ŠA₃.TAM|ts=šatam|t=auditor, administration official}}, having passed into Aramaic as ''*/šətammā/'' → ''*/šətēmā/'' → ''/ištēmā/'', then misvocalized and spoken instead of {{m|arc|אִשְׁתֵּימָא|tr=ʾištēmā}} as {{m|arc|אִשְׁתְּיָמָא|tr=ʾištyāmā}} and written plene {{m|arc|אִישְׁתְּיָאמָא|tr=ʾištyāmā}}.

