Page 1820 إصبع: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ص ب ع}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʔiṣbaʕ-}}. Akin to {{cog|he|אצבע }}, {{cog|arc|אֶצְבְּעָא|tr=ʾeṣbəʿā}}, {{cog|syc|ܨܒܥܐ|tr=ṣeḇʿā}}, {{cog|ti|ኣጻብዕ}}, {{cog|cop|ⲧⲏⲃ}}, {{cog|uga|𐎜𐎕𐎁𐎓}}, {{cog|egy|ḏbꜥ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِصْبَع}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-إصبع.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|إِصْبَع|f|g2=m|pl=أَصَابِع}}

# [[finger]], [[toe]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|2|19|text=أَوْ كَصَيِّبٍ مِنَ السَّمَاءِ فِيهِ ظُلُمَاتٌ وَرَعْدٌ وَبَرْقٌ يَجْعَلُونَ '''أَصَابِعَهُمْ''' فِي آذَانِهِم مِنَ الصَّوَاعِقِ حَذَرَ الْمَوْتِ|t=Or like a rainstorm from the sky, wherein is darkness, thunder and the flash of lightning. They thrust their '''fingers''' in their ears by reason of the thunder-claps, for fear of death.}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|author={{lang|ar|{{w|lang=ar|وجدي الأهدل|وَجْدِيّ الْأَهْدَل}}}}|title=ar:أرض المؤامرات السعيدة|year=2018|isbn=978-614-469-069-7|publisher=Nawfal / Hachette Antoine|location=Bayrūt|page=47|passage=كان هناك ولد صغير يتكلّم ويحاول أن يشبّ على '''أصابع'''ه لينظر من النافذة.|t=There was a small boy talking and trying to rear on his '''toes''' to look through the window.}}
# [[piano]] [[key]]
# [[popsicle]]
# [[lollipop]]

====Usage notes====
Generally feminine.

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|إِصْبَع|pl=أَصَابِع}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|صَبَعَ|t=to point with the finger}}
* {{l|ar|صَبَّعَ|t=to finger}}
* {{l|ar|صَبِيع|t=carbuncle}}
* {{l|ar|تَصَبَّعَ|t=to digitate, to form finger-like structures or carbuncles}}

===References===
