===Etymology 1===
* Lengthened from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʾila|t=towards, nigh}}, displaying some attachment of {{der|ar|sem-pro|*la|t=for}} used in Literary {{cog|ar|لَ|t=for}} only before pronominal suffixes, having stood in some variation with {{der|ar|sem-pro|*li|t=for}} from which {{cog|ar|لِ|t=for}}. Compare {{m|ar|عَلَى}}.
* Related to the root {{ar-root|ء و ل}} in the sense of “returning” and to the root {{ar-root|ء ل و}} in the sense of “striving towards but failing”.

