===Etymology===
From {{der|ar|sem-pro|-}}. Compare {{cog|he|אֳנִיָּה|tr=ʾŏnīyá|t=ship}}, {{cog|arc|מָאנָא|tr=mānā|t=vessel, container}}, {{cog|uga|𐎀𐎐𐎊𐎚|t=ship}}, {{cog|akk|𒃻𒄘𒈾|ts=unūtu, anūtu|t=household, palace; ship; utensils, instruments, tools, wares, gear}}, {{cog|gez|ንዋይ|t=vessel, utensil, instrument; goods, possessions, property, wealth, estate}}. It is generally assumed that there has been an accumulation of dissimilations in all these forms.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِنَاء}}

