Page 2027 إنجيل: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
Most likely from {{der|ar|grc|εὐαγγέλιον}}, probably through {{der|ar|syc|ܐܘܢܓܠܝܘܢ|tr=ʾewwangellīōn}} or a variant thereof, though also {{bor|ar|gez|ወንጌል}} or unattested {{bor|ar|sem-srb|-}} have been suggested as the immediate source. A {{glossary|phono-semantic matching}} after the root {{ar-root|ن ج ل}}, as with {{m+|ar|إِبْلِيس|t=devil}} after {{ar-root|ب|ل|س|nocat=1}}, can be maintained.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِنْجِيل}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|إِنْجِيل|m|pl=أَنَاجِيل}}

