Borrowed from {{der|ar|arc|אֲוׇוזָּא|tr=ʾăwazzā}}, from {{der|ar|akk|ūsum|alt=𒊻𒄷|tr=ūsum|t=duck}}, related to {{cog|sux|𒊻𒄷|tr=uz|t=wild duck, waterfowl}} with uncertain mutual borrowing direction, likely all {{onomatopoeic|ar|nocap=1}} in origin; cognates with {{cog|he|אווז|אֲוָז|tr=ʾăwāz}} and {{cog|syc|ܘܰܙܳܐ|tr=wazzā}}, {{cog|uga|𐎜𐎇}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|إِوَزّ}}

