#: {{uxi|ar|[[اِبْنُ آدَمَ]]|human|lit=son of Adam}}
# [[descendant]], [[scion]]
# [[offspring]], [[son]] of the fatherland
# [[member]] (of a [[group]] or [[set]] of [[people]] or [[things]])

