===Verb===
{{ar-verb|VIII.ipass?}}

# to [[lift]], to [[rise]], to [[ascend]], to go [[higher]]
# to [[mount up]], to [[climb]], to [[soar]], to [[skyrocket]], to [[tower]]
# to [[grow]], to [[increase]]
# to [[ring out]], to be or become [[loud]]
# to [[rear]], to [[recede]], to be [[remove]]d, to go [[away]] or [[off]] something after having been [[put]] there
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|instead=1|lang=ar|page=374 ''m''–''u''|section=web [http://islamport.com/w/bld/Web/451/136.htm 1/136]|passage=وأما أرمينية فإنها كورة جليلة رسمها أرميني بن كنظر بن يافث بن نوح ومنها '''ترتفع''' الستور والزَلاليُّ الرفيعة كثيرة الخصائص قصبتها دَبِيل ومن مدنها: بَدْلِيس، خِلَاط، أَرْجِيش، بَرْكَرِي، خُوَيُّ، سَلَمَاس، أُرْمِيَة، دَاخَرَّقَان، مَرَاغَة، أَهْرُ، مَرَنْد، سِنْجَان، قالِيقَلَا، قندرية، قَلْعَة يُونُس، نورين.|t=As for Armenia, she is a majestic expanse, originally sketched and contoured by ʾArmīnī, the son of {{w|Ashkenaz#Armenian_tradition|Ashkenaz}}, himself a descendant of {{w|Japheth}}, one of the sons of {{w|Noah}}. In Armenia, curtains, draperies, and rugs multifarious and fine '''hang down''', the {{w|Curtain rod|rod}} being {{w|Dwin|Dabīl}}. Among her localities are {{w|Bitlis|Badlīs}} [Baghesh], {{w|Ahlat|Ḵilāṭ}} [Xlat], {{w|Erciş|ʾArjīš}} [Arjesh], [the small town of] {{w|Muradiye|Barkarī}} [east of Ḵilāṭ], {{w|Khoy|Ḵuway}} [Xoy], {{w|Salmas|Salamās}} [Salamas], {{w|Urmia|ʾUrmiyah}} [Urmia], {{w|Azarshahr|Dāḵarraqān}}, {{w|Maragheh|Marāḡah}}, {{w|Ahar|ʾAhr}}, {{w|Marand|Marand}}, Sinjān, {{w|Erzurum|Qālīqalā}}, {{w|Qandariyah|Qandariyyah}}, Qalʿat Yūnus, Nūrīn.}}
# to [[pass away]], to be [[eliminated]], to [[disappear]]
# {{lb|ar|grammar}} to take an ''-u'' ending
#: {{usex|ar|يَرْتَفِعُ الْفَاعِلُ وَيَنْتَصِبُ الْمَفْعُولُ|The subject takes an ''-u'' ending and the object an ''-a'' one.}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=794 {{CE}}|author=ʾAbū Zayd al-ʾAnṣāriyy|title=كتاب النّوادر في اللّغة|editor=Muḥammad ʿAbd al-Qādir ʾAḥmad|publisher=Dar El-Shorouk|edition=1st|year_published=1981|page=158|passage=وَقَوْلُهُ: «مُجَرَّحَاتٌ بِأَجْرَاحٍ وَمَقْتُولُ» ٱرْتَفَعَ؛ لِأَنَّ التَّقْدِيرَ فِيهَا أَنْ يَقُولَ: مِنْهَا مُجَرَّحَاتُ، وَمِنْهَا مَقْتُولٌ}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|VIII.ipass?}}

====Derived terms====
