Page 2602 استحمار: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Morphologically, from the root {{ar-root|ح|م|ر}} (related to donkeys).

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|اِسْتِحْمَار|m|pl=اِسْتِحْمَارَات}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|اِسْتَحْمَرَ|form=X}}
# {{lb|ar|neologism}} likening someone to a [[donkey]], describing someone as fool or slow, describing someone as (easily) [[manipulated]].
#* {{quote-journal
|ar
|date=2016-11-23
|journal=إضاءات
|trans-journal=ida2at
|author=عصام حمزة<t:ʿIṣām Ḥamza>
|title=5 كتب للمفكر «علي شريعتي» تفتح لك آفاقًا فكرية جديدة
|trans-title='Five Books by Intellectual Ali Shari'ati that opens to you new intellectual depths
|url=https://www.ida2at.com/ali-shariati-five-books-open-your-mind/
|passage=يَبْرُزُ هُنَا مُصْطَلَحُ «'''ٱلِٱسْتِحْمَارِ'''» كَمُضَادٍّ لِلنَّبَاهَةِ وَٱلْأَصَالَةِ وَٱلْإِبْدَاعِ، وَهِيَ ٱلصِّفَاتُ ٱلَّتِي تُكَوِّنُ ٱلذَّاتَ ٱلْفَاعِلَةَ فِي ٱلْمُجْتَمَعِ وَتَجْعَلُهُ كِيَانًا مُسْتَعْصِيًا عَلَى ٱلِٱسْتِبْدَادِ وَٱلِٱسْتِعْمَارِ، حِينَ تَخْتَفِي هَذِهِ ٱلصِّفَاتُ يَبْرُزُ ٱلِٱسْتِحْمَارُ كَضِدٍّ مُنَاسِبٍ لِنُشُوءِ ٱلِٱسْتِبْدَادِ.
|translation=Here arises the term «'''''istiḥmār'''''» as opposite to [[wokeness]] and originality and creativity, which are the characters that construct the effective self in the society and make it an entity hard and defiant to oppression and colonialism, when these characters disappear ''donkeying'' arise as and appropriate opposite to the formation of oppression.
|subst=لِلنَّبَاهَةِ/لِنَّبَاهَةِ}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|اِسْتِحْمَارٌ|pl=}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ar|اِسْتِغْبَاء}}

-------- end text --------
