Page 2916 استوى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From root {{ar-root|س|و|ي}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|הִשְׁתַּוָּה|tr=hishtawwā}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|VIII.III:ي.pass}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive|reciprocal}} to be or become [[equal]] or [[equivalent]]
#: {{syn|ar|تَسَاوَى}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|41|34|text=وَلَا '''تَسْتَوِي''' ٱلْحَسَنَةُ وَلَا ٱلسَّيِّئَةُ ۚ ٱدْفَعْ بِٱلَّتِي هِيَ أَحْسَنُ فَإِذَا ٱلَّذِي بَيْنَكَ وَبَيْنَهُ عَدَاوَةٌ كَأَنَّهُ وَلِيٌّ حَمِيمٌ|subst=ٱلسَّيِّئَةُ ۚ ٱدْفَعْ/ٱلسَّيِّئَةُ. اِدْفَعْ,وَلَا/وَ-لَا,فَإِذَا/فَ-إِذَا,وَبَيْنَهُ/وَ-بَيْنَهُ|t=And the good deed '''does not equal''' the bad: repel by that which is better, whereupon he who is inimical to you will be as if he were a devoted friend.}}
# {{lb|ar|construed with {{m|ar|بِ}} or {{m|ar|وَ}}}} to be or become [[equal]], [[uniform]], [[even]], [[level]] {{
# to be or become [[flat]] or [[level]]
#: {{uxi|ar|'''اِسْتَوَتِ''' ٱلطَّرِيقُ.|The road '''flattened out'''.}}
# to be or become [[ripe]] {{q|of food, fruit, etc.}}
# to [[take]] [[control]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<of something>}}
# to [[stand]] [[upright]]
# to [[reach]] [[maturity]]
# to [[become]] [[barren]] {{q|of land}}
# to [[ascend]], to [[mount]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى/:فَوْقَ<on something>}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|25|59|text=ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَا فِي سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٖ ثُمَّ '''ٱسۡتَوَىٰ''' عَلَى ٱلۡعَرۡشِۖ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ فَسۡـَٔلۡ بِهِۦ خَبِيرٗا|t=Who created the heavens and the Earth and all that is between them in six Days, then He '''mounted''' the Throne. The Beneficent! Ask anyone informed concerning Him!}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|VIII.III:ي.pass}}

====References====
* {{R:ar:Lane}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4}} <!-- only for transitive construal of be "equal", meaning "equivalent" -->
* {{R:ar:Almaany}}

