Page 3135 اقتاد: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ق و د}} in the sense of the result of one being led away; alternatively from the related root {{ar-root|ق ي د}}, the result of one being shackled, taken as a prisoner.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|اِقْتَادَ}}

