Page 3204 الأبناء: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|اَلْ}} + {{m|ar|أَبْنَاء}}, plural of {{m|ar|اِبْن|t=son}}.

The second sense may be a short form of the phrase {{m|ar|أَبْنَاء الْدَوْلَة|lit=sons of the state, i.e. the {{w|Abbasid Caliphate}}}}.

===Proper noun===
{{ar-proper noun|الْأَبْنَاء|p}}

