===Etymology===
From {{der|ar|grc|Ἀλεξάνδρεια}}, full name {{m|grc|Ἀλεξάνδρεια ἡ κατ’ Αἴγυπτον||[[Alexandria]] in [[Egypt]]}}, with initial {{m|grc||Ἀλ-}} reanalyzed as the Arabic definite article, [[metathesis]] of ''ξ'' {{IPAchar|/ks/}} to {{IPAchar|/sk/}} and the ending {{m|grc||-εια}} (pronounced {{IPAchar|/ia/}} in {{cog|grc-koi|-}}) assimilated to the common Arabic feminine adjectival ending {{m|ar|ـِيَّة}}.

===Pronunciation===
