Probably from {{bor|ar|pal|bʾlk'|ts=bārag|t=horse}}. However, medieval Arab Muslim scholars associated this word with the root of {{m|ar|بَرْق|t=lightning}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|البُرَاق}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|البُرَاق|m}}

# {{lb|ar|Islam|mythological creature}} [[Buraq]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|بُرَاق|state=def}}
-------- end text --------
