{{uncertain|ar}} but probably from modification of {{der|ar|gkm|Βενετικός||[[Venetian]]}} and {{m|gkm|Βενέτζια||[[Venice]]}} and/or {{der|ar|vec|venedego}} under influence from {{m|ar|بُنْدُق||[[pebble]], [[bullet]], [[hazelnut]]}} and {{m|ar|ـِيَّة||[[-ia]]}}, a variant of {{der|ar|grc|Ἐνετικός||[[Venetian]], [[Venetic]], [[Enetic]]}} under influence from {{der|ar|la|veneticus||[[Venetic]], [[Venetian]]}}, both of uncertain origin but generally assumed to derive from a {{der|ar|xve|-}} endonym.

