Literally “the Eastern calendar”, as opposed to {{m|ar|اَلتَّقْوِيم اَلْغَرْبِيّ||the Western, i.e. Gregorian, calendar}}, due to its being used by the [[Eastern Orthodox]] churches and despite its being western, namely Roman, in origin.

