Page 3402 السلام عليكم: -------- begin text --------
{{phrasebook|ar}}
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ}}
* {{audio|ar|السلام عليكم.ogg}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-السلام عليكم.oga}}

===Interjection===
{{ar-interj|[[سلام|السَّلَامُ]] [[على|عَلَيْكُمْ]]}}

# {{l|en|[[peace]] be [[upon]] [[you]]; [[good day]]; [[hello]]; [[hail]], [[salaam alaikum]], [[assalamu alaikum]]}}
#: {{ux|ar|السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ — وَعَلَيْكُمُ ٱلسَّلَامُ|t=Peace be upon you. — And upon you, too.|subst=وَعَلَيْكُمُ/وَ-عَلَيْكُمُ}}

====Usage notes====
* Though grammatically plural, this form of the greeting is predominantly also used towards one person.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|ar|السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكاتُهُ|t=Peace be upon you as well as Allah's mercy and blessings.|tr=as-salāmu ʕalaykum wa-raḥmatu llāhi wa-barakātuhu}}
