===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ش|ء|م}}, a variant of {{ar-root|ش|م|ل|nocat=1}}; contrasted with {{m|ar|اليَمَن}} from {{m|sem-pro|*yamīn-|t=right-hand side; southward}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|שְׂמֹאל|t=left|tr=s'mól}}, {{cog|akk|šumēlum|𒆏|tr=šumēlum|t=left side}}, {{cog|arc|סְמָלָא}} / {{m|syc|ܣܡܠܐ|tr=semālā|t=left side}}, {{cog|uga|𐎌𐎎𐎀𐎍}}. The northern sense derives from the left-hand side oriented with the sunrise, also attested in {{cog|sem-srb|𐩦𐩱𐩣|t=North}}.

