|t=The house is ours, and '''Jerusalem''' is ours.<br/>And by our hands we will restore '''Jerusalem'''’s splendor.<br/>By our hands to '''Jerusalem''' peace is coming.
|url=https://youtu.be/XryCNk6q4KM}}<!---translation based on Stone, Christopher (2008), "Fayruz, the Rahbani Brothers, Jerusalem, and the Leba-stinian song" in Jerusalem: Idea and Reality Mayer & Mourad (eds.), p. 159-160--->

