* {{l|ar|أَسْتَغْفِرُ ٱللّٰهَ|t=I seek forgiveness from God}}
* {{l|ar|اَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّٰهِ|t=all praise is for God}}
* {{l|ar|آيَةُ الله|t=[[Ayatollah]], sign of God}}
* {{l|ar|اللَّٰهُمَّ|t=[[God]]; [[O]] [[God]]}}

