Page 3537 المار ذكره: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Literally "the (thing) passing by, its mention", composed of {{m|ar|مارّ||[[passing]], [[going]] [[past]]}} + {{m|ar|ذِكْر||[[mention]]}} + {{m|ar||ـهُ|its}}.

===Adjective===
