===Etymology 2===
{{ar-rootbox|ب ي ت}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~i.ipass?.vn:مَبِيت,بَيَات}}

# to [[spend]] the [[night]], to stay [[overnight]]
#* {{RQ:Sunna|ibnmajah|30|62|passage= " إِنْ كَانَ عِنْدَكَ مَاءٌ '''بَاتَ''' فِي شَنٍّ فَٱسْقِنَا وَإِلَّا كَرَعْنَا " . قَالَ عِنْدِي مَاءٌ '''بَاتَ''' فِي شَنٍّ . فَٱنْطَلَقَ وَٱنْطَلَقْنَا مَعَهُ إِلَى ٱلْعَرِيشِ فَحَلَبَ لَهُ شَاةً عَلَى مَاءٍ '''بَاتَ''' فِي شَنٍّ فَشَرِبَ ثُمَّ فَعَلَ مِثْلَ ذَٰلِكَ بِصَاحِبِهِ ٱلَّذِي مَعَهُ .|t=‘If you have any water '''that has been kept overnight''' in a water skin, then give us some to drink, otherwise we will drink by putting out mouths in the basin.’ He said: ‘I have water '''that has been kept''' in a water skin. So he went and we went with him, to the shelter, where he milked a sheep for him and (mixed it with) the water '''that had been kept overnight''' in a water skin. He drank from it, then he did likewise for his Companion who was with him.”}}
# {{lb|ar|copulative}} to [[become]], to have gotten into
#: {{syn|ar|Thesaurus:صار}}
#* {{quote-web|date=2023-03-13|ar|url=https://nooralldeen.com/bakara/959|title=ar:مخففات الصيام|work=ar:نور الدين|text=رَمَضَانُ بَاتَ عَلَى الْأَبْوَابِ وَيَفْصِلُنَا عَنْهُ أَيّامٌ مَعْدُودَةٌ|subst=عَنْهُ/عَنْهُو|t=Ramadan is about to happen and what separates us from it are a few days.}}
# to continue doing, keep doing, stick to {{+obj|ar|:مِن}} {{rfex|ar}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~i.ipass?.vn:مَبِيت,بَيَات}}

