Believed in the Middle Ages to be the native Arabic word in opposition to synonymous Persianate {{m|ar|سِبِيدَاج}}, but of an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} shape, so probably from the same source word as {{doublet|notext=1|ar|بَرْوَق|t1=asphodel}}, more likely than akin to Persianate {{m|ar|بَوْرَق|t=borax}}.

