Page 4045 باسم الآب والابن والروح القدس الإله الواحد: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Literally: “In the name of the Father, and the Son, and the Holy Spirit, the one God”. The last part is commonly added by Arabic-speaking Christians in order to counter the Islamic accusation of polytheism.

===Phrase===
{{head|ar|phrase|head=بِاسْمِ الْآبِ وَالِابْنِ وَالرُّوحِ الْقُدُسِ الْإِلٰهِ الْوَاحِدِ|tr=bi-smi l-ʾābi wa-l-ibni wa-r-rūḥi l-qudusi l-ʾilāhi l-wāḥidi}}

# {{alternative form of|ar|باسم الأب والابن والروح القدس}}
-------- end text --------
