* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=73}}
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=171}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|page=133}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=222}}

{{C|ar|Vessels|Wine}}
