===Etymology===
Composed of {{af|ar|بِـ|ال|فِعْل|t1=in, with|pos2=definite article|t3=deed, act, action}}. Compare {{noncog|en|[[indeed]], [[in fact]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|بِٱلْفِعْلِ}}

===Adverb===
{{ar-adv|بِٱلْفِعْلِ}}

# [[truly]], [[actually]], [[as of now]], being [[already]] [[effective]]
#: {{syn|ar|فِعْلًا|حَقًّا}}
#: {{uxi|ar|'''بِٱلْفِعْلِ''' أَنَا مُحْتَارٌ.|t=I am '''truly''' confused.}}
#: {{uxi|ar|هٰذَا ٱلْاِسْمُ مُسْتَخْدَمٌ '''بِٱلْفِعْلِ'''.|t='''Indeed''' this name is '''already''' in use.}}

