* {{desc|az|bamiyə|bor=1}}
* {{desc|de|Bamia|bor=1}}
* {{desc|he|בַּמְיָה|bor=1|tr=bamyā}}
* {{desctree|ota|بامیه|tr=bamya|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|بامیه|tr=bâmiye|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|bamia|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tig|ባምየት|bor=1}}

===References===
