* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=2|page=233–234, 243}}
* {{R:ar:Nasrallah:2007|page=782–783}}
* {{R:akk:Thompson-Herbal|page=39}}

{{C|ar|Mallow subfamily plants}}

