===Etymology 2===
{{ar-rootbox|ب ن ي}}
{{ar-active participle}} of {{m|ar|بَنَى||to [[build]], to [[erect]], to [[construct]]}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|بَانٍ|m|d=بَانِيَانِ|pl=بَانُونَ|pl2=بُنَاة|cons=بَانِي|f=بَانِيَة}}

