Page 4138 بجل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ب ج ل}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.vn:بَجَالَة,بُجُول}}

# to become [[rever]]ed, to become [[honour]]ed, to become [[glorify|glorified]], to become [[worship]]ped, to become [[commend]]ed, to become [[dignify|dignified]], to become [[venerate]]d
# to be in a state of [[abundance]], to [[miss]] no [[convenience]]s

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.vn:بَجَالَة,بُجُول}}

====Verb====
