|passage=فَبَعَثَ اللَّهُ غُرَابًا يَبْحَثُ فِي الْأَرْضِ
|translation=Then Allah sent a crow searching in the ground...}}
# to [[look for]], to [[search]] for, to [[seek]] {{gloss|{{m|ar|عَن}} something}}
