# to [[investigate]], to [[examine]], to [[study]], to [[explore]], to [[look]] into
# to [[discuss]]
#: {{ux|ar|الْعَبَادِي يَبْحَثُ "الْحَرْبَ عَلَى الْإِرْهَابِ" مَعَ مَلِكِ الْأُرْدُنِّ.|Al-Abadi discusses the "war on terror" with the king of Jordan.}}

