#* {{RQ:Qur'an|26|3|passage=لَعَلَّكَ بَاخِعٌ نَّفْسَكَ أَلَّا يَكُونُوا مُؤْمِنِينَ|t=It may be that thou, Muḥammad, reckon yourself buffeted, by reason that they believe not.}}

