===Etymology 1===
{{rfe|ar}} Augmentative from the root {{ar-root|ب ر ع}}? Or from {{bor|ar|arc|-}}? Compare {{m|ar|بَرْغَز|t=young of a cow}}, {{m|ar|بَرْغَش|t=gnat}}, {{m|ar|بَزْر|t=seed}}.

