===Etymology===
A {{bor|ar|trk|-}} borrowing, likely from {{bor|ar|ota|بورغو|tr=burɣu|t=screw, auger}}. Cognate with {{cog|tr|burgu|t=screw, auger}}, {{cog|az|burğu|t=screw, drill, auger}}, {{cog|chg|بورغو|tr=burğu|t=screw, drill, auger}}, {{cog|kk|бұрғы|t=drill bit, auger}} and others, a derivative of the stem in {{cog|ota|بورمق|tr=burmak|t=to twist}} / {{cog|tr|burmak|t=to twist}}, {{cog|uz|бурамоқ|t=to twist}}, {{cog|kk|бұрау|t=drill, auger; to twist}}, {{cog|ba|бырау|t=drill, auger}} etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|بُرْغِيّ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|بُرْغِيّ|m|pl=بَرَاغِيّ}}

# [[screw]], [[bolt]], a [[threaded]] [[metal]] [[fastener]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَلَاوُوظ}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|بُرْغِيّ|m|pl=بَرَاغِيّ}}

