* {{R:ar:Steingass}}

===Etymology 2===
For meaning "make kneel", causative of {{m|ar|بَرَكَ||to [[kneel]] down}}. For meaning "invoke a blessing", denominal verb from {{m|ar|بَرَكَة||[[blessing]]}}.

