# {{vern|kingspear}} ({{taxfmt|Asphodelus|genus}}, especially {{taxlink|Asphodelus tenuifolius|species}})
#: {{syn|ar|سِرِيش}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|بَرْوَق}}

