** {{desc|sc-sro|orbaci|bor=1|unc=1|qq=either via Old Italian or directly from Arabic}}
*** {{desc|it|orbace|bor=1}}
** {{desc|sc-src|arvatze|bor=1|unc=1|qq=either via Old Italian or directly from Arabic}}
** {{desc|sc-nuo|orbace|bor=1|unc=1|qq=either via Old Italian or directly from Arabic}}

