===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|כִּזְרָא|tr=bizrā}} / {{m|syc|ܒܙܪܐ|tr=bazrā|t=seed}}, from {{m|arc|בַר זַרְעָא}} / {{m|syc|ܒܪ ܙܪܥܐ|tr=bar zarʿāʾ|t=seed}}, from {{m|arc|בַר}} / {{m|syc|ܒܪ|tr=bar|t=son of}} + {{m|arc|זַרְעָא}} / {{m|syc|ܙܪܥܐ||tr=zarʿāʾ|t=a seed}}.<br/>
The vocalization with /i/ is deemed more classical in Arabic.

===Noun===
