*: {{desc|kmr|petêx}}
* {{desc|bor=1|ML.|botefles|buteflez|budusta|batheca}}
* {{desc|ms|betik|bor=1}}
** {{desc|id|betik}}
* {{desc|ml|വത്തയ്ക്ക|bor=1}}
* {{desc|roa-opt|albudeca|albudieca|batecha|bor=1}}
** {{desc|gl|botefa|alts=1}}
** {{desc|pt|pateca}}
*** {{desc|fr|pastèque|bor=1}}
**** {{desc|it|pasteca|bor=1|lb=Liguria}}
**** {{desc|lij|pateca|bor=1}}
