Page 4521 بعر: -------- begin text --------
[[File:What a whole lot of bullshit..... (15343355517).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|بَعْر}}|upright=1.6]]

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|بَعِير|t=camel}}, or compare {{m|ar|جَعْر|t=dung}}, {{m|ar|جَعَرَ|t=to [[void]] one’s [[dung]]}}. The only parallel form in {{cog|sem}} is {{cog|syc|ܒܥܘܿܪܴܐ|tr=bəʿōrā|t=dried dung}}, while the animal term is widely attested in Semitic, so unlikely the reverse happened that from the name of dung came the animal name – as Hommel suggested –, which is also comparatively a generally less likely direction.

===Pronunciation===
* {{q|verb}} {{ar-IPA|بَعَرَ}}
* {{q|noun}} {{ar-IPA|بَعْر}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~a.pass.vn:بَعْر}}

# to [[void]] [[dung]], to [[evacuate]], to [[throw out]] [[ordure]] (said of a [[cloven-hoofed]] beast)

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~a.pass.vn:بَعْر}}

===Noun===
{{ar-coll-noun|بَعْر|sing=بَعْرَة|pl=أَبْعَار}}

# [[dung]], [[ordure]] (of a cloven-hoofed beast)
#* {{RQ:Sunna|abudawud|1|38
|passage=نَهَانَا رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ أَنْ نَتَمَسَّحَ بِعَظْمٍ أَوْ بَعْرٍ.
|translation=The Prophet (PBUH) forbade us to wipe ourselves with bone or dung.}}
#* {{RQ:Sunna|bukhari|68|81
|passage=وَقَدْ كَانَتْ إِحْدَاكُنَّ فِي الْجَاهِلِيَّةِ تَرْمِي بِالْبَعَرَةِ عَلَى رَأْسِ الْحَوْلِ.
|translation=In the pre-Islamic time one of your kind (a widow) used to cast a globe of dung when a year has elapsed.}}
#* {{RQ:Sunna|muslim|-1|87
|passage=فَلَمَّا رَأَيْتُهُ كَانَتْ بَعْرَةٌ أَحَبَّ إِلَىَّ مِنْهُ
|translation=When I saw him a globe of dung would have been more preferred to me than him.}}
#* {{quote-journal|ar|author=Šākir Maḥmūd|passage=راجعنا مقالاتهم في أنواع السرقين والمفاضلة بين ذرق الحمام وأرواث الخيل والبغال والحمير، وأخثاء البقر والجواميس وأبعار الغنم والضأن والماعز، […]|title=[[s:ar:مجلة الرسالة/العدد 946/السرقين والسماد في الزراعة قديما|{{lang|ar|السرقين والسماد في الزراعة قديما}}]]|date=1951-08-20|work=ar:مجلة الرسالة|t=We have reviewed their articles on the types of manure and the differences between pigeon droppings, dung of horses and mules and asses, and sharn of cows and buffalos and sheep and goats, […]}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|بَعْر|pl=أَبْعَار}}

