====Usage notes====
* The above example shows the formally correct use of {{m|ar||بَعْض|t=each other}} with a preposition. Note, however, that in contemporary Arabic one will frequently hear and read the same sentence as: {{m|ar||نَظَرُوا إلَى بَعْضِهِمُ البَعْض}}.

