Page 4569 بقشة: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar|بقجة|mul=البقشة اليمنية}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|بُقْجَة|بُقْچَة}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|trk|-}} languages, in consequence of the {{w|Mongol invasions of the Levant|Mongol pressure}} and again after the {{w|Ottoman–Mamluk War (1485–1491)|Ottoman}} {{w|Battle of Chaldiran|territory}} {{w|Ottoman–Mamluk War (1516–1517)|gains}} from {{bor|ar|ota|بوغچه|tr=boğça, {{m|tr|bohça}}}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|بُقْشَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|بُقْشَة|f|pl=بُقَش}}

# {{C|ar|Containers}}[[bundle]], a [[cloth]] [[tie up|tied up]] for [[carry]]ing things other than [[cloths]]
#* {{RQ:Ibn Batoutah|IV|page=231 line 1 a fine–232 line 3|passage=ثُمَّ جَاءَ أَحَدُ ٱلْفِتْيَانِ بِ'''بُقْشَةٍ''' […] وَهِيَ ٱلسَنَبِيَّةُ فَأَخَذَهَا ٱلنَّائِبُ بِيَدِهِ وَأَخَذَ بِيَدِي وَأَدْخَلَنِي إِلَى دُوَيْرَةٍ يُسَمُّونَهَا فَرْدْخَانَةً […]|subst=بِيَدِهِ/بِ-يَدِ-هِي,بِيَدِي/بِ-يَدِي|t=Then came one of the boys with a '''bundle''' […] this is an envelope […] and the lieutenant took it with his hand and took me by the hand and made enter into a maisonette they call recovery room […]}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|title=ar:بقشة'''.. وقفّة ومهفة'''|date=2009-11-01|work=Al-Bayān|url=https://www.albayan.ae/our-homes/2009-11-01-1.486612}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|date=2014-04-02|work=eSyria|title=ar:حفظ الثياب… بدأت بـ”ال'''بقجة'''“ وانتهت بـ“السكرتون“|url=http://esyria.sy/sites/code/index.php?site=deiralzor&p=stories&category=misc&filename=201404020654462}}
# {{C|ar|Cakes and pastries}}[[fry|fried]] [[pastry]] in such a form
#* {{quote-web|ar|date=2017-01-10|title=ar:طريقة عمل حلى ال'''بقشة''' على اصوله|url=https://www.tareekaa.com/حلويات/35845-حلى-البقشة|work=Ṭarīqa}}
# {{C|ar|Neckwear}} a kind of [[square]] [[shawl]] often used for [[wrap]]ping [[bundle]]s
# {{C|ar|Coins}}{{lb|ar|Yemen|until [[decimalisation]] in 1974}} a sub unit of the {{w|North Yemeni rial|riyal}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|بُقْشَة|pl=بُقَش}}

