* {{desc|cop|ⲡⲟⲛ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gu|બૂંદ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|har|ቡን|bor=1|tr=bunn}}
* {{desc|tig|ቡን|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ti|ቡን|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ota|بن|bor=1|tr=bünn}}
