Page 4748 بهرج: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|pal|-}} equalling {{cog|fa|بهره|tr=bahra|t=profit, advantage, fortune, happiness, prosperity}} and {{denominal verb|nocap=1|ar}}, resulting from {{clipping|ar|نَبَهْرَج|t=phoney|nocap=1}}; less likely augmented from {{ar-root|ب ه ر}} / {{m|ar|بَهَرَ|t=to allure; to shine; to illuminate}}; perhaps a Persian stem and this Arabic root mutually interfered semantically in either language.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|بَهْرَج}}

