===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}. Obviously of foreign origin, as its synonyms, maybe a deformation of an “elm” word reconstructible for {{cog|ira-pro|-}} and {{cog|ine-bsl-pro|-}}, {{cog|lv|vīksna}}, {{cog|ckb|-}} inter alia {{m|ckb|ووزم}}, {{m|ckb|بووز}}, which vocalism could have been reinterpreted as {{m|ar|أَب|بُو|t=father of}} of often occurrence in Arabic organism names.

===Noun===
