* {{desc|hy|պավլ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ba|бәүел|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|بول|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tt|бәвел|bor=1}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[urinate]]
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[cause]] to [[urinate]]

