===Preposition===
{{ar-prep|بَيْدَ}}

# [[for the sake of]], [[because of]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=7th century C.E.|title=Kašf al-Ḵafaʾ wa-Muzīl al-Ilbās, Hadith|text=أَنَا أَفْصَحُ العَرَبِ '''بَيْدَ أَنِّي''' مِنْ قُرَيْشٍ وَنَشَأْتُ فِي بَنِي سَعْدٍ|t=My speech is the most clear among Arabs, '''for I'm''' from Quraysh and I grew up in Bani Sa'd.}}
# [[even though]], [[but]], [[except]]
#: {{synonyms|ar|عَلَى}}
#* {{quote|ar|هُوَ كَثِيرُ المَالِ بَيْدَ أَنَّهُ بَخِيلٌ|He's wealthy, but miserly.}}
#* {{RQ:Sunna|muslim|7|28|passage=نَحْنُ الآخِرُونَ السَّابِقُونَ يَوْمَ القِيَامَةِ '''بَيْدَ أَنَّهُمْ''' أُوتُوا الكِتَابَ مِنْ قَبْلِنَا وَأُوتِينَاهُ مِنْ بَعْدِهِمْ|translation=We are the latter, but the day of resurrection we will be first, '''even though they''' received the Scripture before us, and we received it after them.}}

====Usage notes====
