# to be [[confirmed]], to [[prove]] to be [[true]]
# to be [[undeniable]], to be [[urgent]] {{q|of a need}}
# to be [[strengthened]], to be [[fortified]]
# to be or become [[convinced]] or [[certain]] or [[sure]] {{+obj|ar|:مِن<of something>}}
#: {{uxi|ar|كيف تتأكد أن وعود الكتاب المقدس ستتحقَّق؟‏|How can you be sure that the promises of the Bible will be fulfilled?}}
# to [[ascertain]] {{+obj|ar|:مِن<something>}}
#: {{uxi|ar|كيف نتأكد من ذلك؟‏|How can we ascertain that?}}

