===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|تَابُوه||extinct Anṣār dialect}}
* {{alter|ar|تَاوْبُوت||extinct Quraysh dialect}}

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|ar|تَوَبُوت}} or {{m|ar|تَاوْبُوَّة}}, from {{bor|ar|syc|ܬܝܒܘܬܐ|tr=tēḇūṯā}} or {{bor|ar|gez|ታቦት}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|תיבה|tr=tevá}}.
<div>Ultimately from a merger of {{der|ar|egy|ḏbꜣt|<hiero>DbA-b-t:pr</hiero>|tr=[[ḏbꜣt]]|sarcophagus, coffin}} and {{m|egy|dbt|<hiero>d-b-t:xt</hiero>|tr=[[dbt]]|chest, box}}; compare {{cog|egx-dem|tbyt||sarcophagus, shrine, chest}}, {{m|egx-dem|dbt}}, and {{m|egx-dem|tbt||chest}} and {{cog|cop|ⲧⲁⲓⲃⲉ||chest, coffin}}.</div>

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|تَابُوت}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|تَابُوت|m|pl=تَوَابِيت}}

# [[box]], [[case]], [[chest]], [[coffer]], [[ark]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|20|39|passage=أَنِ ٱقْذِفِيهِ فِي '''ٱلتَّابُوتِ''' فَٱقْذِفِيهِ فِي ٱلْيَمِّ فَلْيُلْقِهِ ٱلْيَمُّ بِٱلسَّاحِلِ|subst=فِي '''ٱلتَّابُوتِ'''/فِ '''ٱلتَّابُوتِ''',فَٱقْذِفِيهِ/فَ-ٱقْذِفِيهِ,فِي ٱلْيَمِّ/فِ ٱلْيَمِّ,فَلْيُلْقِهِ/فَ-لْيُلْقِهِ|t=Cast him into the chest and cast it into the river, and the river will throw it onto the bank.}}
# [[coffin]], [[casket]], [[sarcophagus]]
#: {{ux|ar|مَاذَا وَرَاءَ حِكَايَةِ ٱكْتِشَافِ '''تَابُوتِ''' ٱلْمَسِيحِ فِي ٱلْقُدْسِ؟|subst=فِي ٱلْقُدْسِ/فِ ٱلْقُدْسِ|t=What's behind the story of the discovery of the coffin of Christ in Jerusalem?}}

