Page 5004 تاريخ: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Likely a borrowing from (the broken plural of) a corresponding {{ar-form|II|nocap=1}} verbal noun formation of {{bor|ar|sem-srb|𐩥𐩧𐩭|ts=warḫ|t=month; date}} from {{der|ar|sem-pro|*warḫ-|t=moon; month}} not retained in Arabic.

Less common {{m|ar|أَرَّخَ|t=to [[date]], to write the [[date]]}} and its verbal noun {{m|ar|تَأْرِيخ}} were then formed secondarily.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|تَارِيخ}}
