===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ت ر ج م}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|תִּרְגֵּם|tr=tirgém}} and {{cog|arc|תַּרְגֵּם|tr=targēm}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|تَرْجَمَ}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# to [[translate]]
#: {{ux|ar|'''تَرْجَمَتِ''' ٱلْكِتَابَ مِنَ ٱلْفَرَنْسِيَّةِ إِلَى ٱلْعَرَبِيَّةِ.|She '''translated''' the book '''from''' French '''into''' Arabic.}}
# to [[interpret]]
# to [[expound]], to [[treat]] by way of explanation
# to give [[biographical]] information on {{+obj|ar|:لِ}}
#: {{ux|ar|هٰذَا ٱلْكِتَابُ '''يُتَرْجِمُ''' لِأَهَمِّ ٱلشُّعَرَاءِ ٱلْعَرَبِ.|This book '''outlines the biographies of''' the most important Arab poets.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|Iq}}

-------- end text --------
