===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|ar|syc|ܬܫܪܝܢ|tr=tišrīn|t=[[autumn]] [[month]]}}, ultimately from {{derived|ar|akk|𒌚𒇯|tr=tišritum}}, and cognate with {{cognate|1=he|2=תִּשְׁרֵי|tr=tišrei|4=[[w|Tishrei]], the seventh month of the [[w|Hebrew lunisolar calendar]]}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|تِشْرِين}}

====Proper noun====
{{ar-proper noun|تِشْرِين|m}}

# {{lb|ar|Mashreq|especially|Syria|Lebanon|Palestine|Jordan|Iraq}}  [[October]] {{gloss|tenth month of the Gregorian and Julian calendars}}
## {{only used in|ar|تِشْرِين الْأَوَّل||October}} {{ng|or in [[ellipsis|ellipses]] thereof}}
##: {{uxi|ar|حَرْب '''تِشْرِين'''|the {{w|October War}}}}
## {{only used in|ar|تِشْرِين الثَّانِي||November}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desctree|ota|تشرین|tr=teşrin|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|تِشرین|tr=tešrin|bor=1}}

