Page 5657 تشرين الأول: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|تِشْرِين}}, from {{bor|ar|syc|ܬܫܪܝܢ|tr=tešrīn|t=[[autumn]] [[month]]}}, ultimately from {{derived|ar|akk|𒌚𒇯|tr=tišritum}}, and cognate with {{cognate|1=he|2=תִּשְׁרֵי|tr=tišrei|4=[[w|Tishrei]], the seventh month of the [[w|Hebrew lunisolar calendar]]}} + {{m|ar|أَوَّل|الْأَوَّل|t=the first}}, as this month is considered the first month of autumn.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|تِشْرِين الْأَوَّل}}

===Proper noun===
{{ar-proper noun|تِشْرِين الْأَوَّل|m}}

# {{lb|ar|Mashreq|especially|Syria|Lebanon|Palestine|Jordan|Iraq}} [[October]] {{gloss|tenth month of the Gregorian and Julian calendars}}
#: {{syn|ar|أُكْتُوبَر}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|تِشْرِينُ|mod=أَوَّل|state=ind-def}}

====Descendants====
* {{desctree|ota|تشرین اول|tr=teşrin-i evvel|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|تِشرینِ اوّل|tr=tešrin-e avval|bor=1}}

====See also====
* {{sense|month}} Previous: {{l|ar|أَيْلُول}}. Next: {{l|ar|تِشْرِين الثَّانِي}}
* {{l|ar|شَوَّال}}

[[Category:ar:Syrian Christian months]]

