===Etymology===
According to Fraenkel, a borrowing from {{bor|ar|arc|-}}, but the putative etymon is not unambiguously attested in Aramaic.<!--twpḥ in Frahang-i-Pahlavig perhaps due to Arabic influence--> More prominent in {{cognate|he|תַּפּוּחַ|tr=tappū́aḥ}}, {{cog|uga|𐎚𐎔𐎈}}, {{cog|xpu|*𐤕𐤐𐤇|ts=tappūḥ}} and Semitic-borrowed {{cog|egy-lat|ḏpḥ}} up to {{cog|cop|ϫⲙⲡⲉϩ}} etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|تُفَّاح}}

