{{ar-decl-noun|تَنَوُّر}}

===Etymology 3===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|תנורא}} or {{bor|ar|syc|ܬܰܢܽܘܪܳܐ|tr=tannūrā}}, from {{der|ar|pal|tr=tnwl|ts=tanūr|t=oven}} from which also {{cog|he|תַּנּוּר|tr=tanúr|t=oven}}, from {{der|ar|akk|𒋾𒂟|tr=tinūru}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|تَنُّور}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|تَنُّور|m|pl=تَنَانِير}}

# [[tandoor]]
# [[oven]], [[furnace]], [[kiln]]
# cook [[stove]]

