* {{R:xaa:Corriente-Additions|page=41}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|page=203a}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=320–321}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=146a}}

-------- end text --------
