{{wp|lang=ar|تولا (وحدة)}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|تُولَة|tr1=tōla}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|hi|तोला}}/{{bor|ar|ur|تولا|tr=tola}}. The weight corresponds to the weight of an [[Indian]] [[silver]] [[rupee]] during the whole [[Mughal Empire]].

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|تُولَا|m|pl=تُولَات|tr=tōlā|pltr=tōlāt}} {{tlb|ar|Gulf|Oman|Yemen|Zanzibar}}

# a [[weight measure]] for especially [[silver]] and [[gold]] of about 11.6 [[gram]]s

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|تُولَا/tōlā|pl=تُولَات/tōlāt}}

{{C|ar|Units of measure|Silver|Gold}}

-------- end text --------
