===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ث ر و}}
{{ar-diminutive}} of {{m|ar|ثَرِيّ|t=many, numerous, abundant}} from the root {{ar-root|ث|ر|و}} meaning "to be great in number or quantity", "to be numerous", "to be abundant", "to possess much"; literally "the little one possessing many" or "the dear abundant one".

====Proper noun====
{{ar-proper noun|الثُّرَيَّا|f}}

# {{senseid|ar|stars}} the [[Pleiades]]
# a high place in the sky

