** {{desc|tr|Süreyya}}
* {{desc|fa|ثریا|tr=sorayyâ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|thurea|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tg|Сурайё|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ur|ثریا|bor=1}}

