Page 6678 ثقل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ث ق ل}}
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ṯql||to weigh; burden, weight}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|שקל }} and {{cog|arc|תקל}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|ثَقُلَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.ipass.vn:ثِقَل,ثَقَالَة}}

# to be [[heavy]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|101|6-11|passage=فَأَمَّا مَن '''ثَقُلَتْ''' مَوَازِينُهُ &#1757; فَهُوَ فِي عِيشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ &#1757; وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَازِينُهُ &#1757; فَأُمُّهُ هَاوِيَةٌ &#1757; وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا هِيَهْ &#1757; نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌ}}
# to be or become [[pregnant]]
# to become [[severe]] {{q|of an illness}}
# to [[deteriorate]] {{q|of one's hearing, etc.}}
# to be [[slur]]red {{q|of speech}}
# to be [[burdensome]], to be [[oppressive]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<to someone>}}
# to be [[difficult]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<for someone>}}
# to be [[sluggish]], to be [[dull-witted]]
# to be too [[sluggish]], to be [[slow]] {{+obj|ar|:عَن<for something/to do something>}}
#: {{uxi|ar|ثَقُلُوا عَنْ حَاجَّتِنَا.|They are slow to do what we need.}}
# to be too [[dull-witted]] {{+obj|ar|:عَن<for something/to do something>}}
# to [[load]], to [[burden]], to [[make]] [[heavy]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ<something> + :عَلَى<for someone>}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.ipass.vn:ثِقَل,ثَقَالَة}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|ar|خَفَّ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:ثَقْل}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[weigh]]; to determine the [[weight]] of an object
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to be [[heavier]] than, to [[outweigh]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:ثَقْل}}

=====References=====
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4}}

===Etymology 2===
