===Etymology 1===
{{root|ar|ine-pro|*kʷey-}}
From {{der|ar|grc|τίμημα}}, from {{m|grc|τιμή}}, from {{m|grc|τῑ́ω}}, leveled to the root {{ar-root|ث م ن}}; ultimately from {{der|ar|ine-pro|*kʷey-|t=value, honor}}. Compare {{cog|syc|ܛܝܼܡܵܐ|tr=ṭīmā|t=price, value}} and {{cog|arc-jla|תמא|tr=tmˀ|t=duty, tax, fee}}; for more see {{m|el|τιμή}} and {{m|grc|τῑμάω}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|ثَمَن}}
** {{IPA|ary|/ta.man/|a=Moroccan}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-ثمن.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|ثَمَن|m|pl=أَثْمَان|pl2=أَثْمِنَة|pl3=أَثْمُن}}

# {{lb|ar|countable}} a [[price]]
#: {{synonyms|ar|سِعْر|قِيمَة}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|12|20|passage=وَشَرَوْهُ بِثَمَنٍ بَخْسٍ دَرَاهِمَ مَعْدُودَةٍ|t=And they sold him for cheap, [merely] a few pennies.}}

