#* {{RQ:Qur'an|69|11|passage=إِنَّا لَمَّا طَغَى الْمَاءُ حَمَلْنَاكُمْ فِي '''الْجَارِيَةِ'''|t=Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried your ancestors in '''the sailing ship'''.}}

