# {{lb|ar|proper noun|Islam}} [[Jann]], the forefather of the race of [[jinn]]
#* {{quote-text|ar|year=1445-1505|author=Jalāl al-Dīn al-Suyūṭī|title=Al-Dur al-Manthur|page=Surah 2:30|passage=وقد كان فيها قبل أن يخلق بألفي عام الجن بنو الجان، ففسدوا في الأرض.|translation=Two thousand years before [Adam] He [God] created the jinn, the sons of al-Jann, on earth, and they spread corruption and shed blood therein.}}
# {{lb|ar|in the singular|common noun|rare|or|classical}} one of the [[jinn]]; a [[genie]], a [[jann]].
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|55|74|passage=لَمْ يَطْمِثْهُنَّ إِنْسٌ قَبْلَهُمْ وَلَا '''جَانٌّ'''|t=touched them has not mankind before them nor '''a jinni'''.}}
