{{ar-rootbox|ج د د}}
Cognate with {{cog|arc|[[גידא]] / [[גודא]]}}, a length, a strip, a row, or patch; hence a strip of land by the sea, a tract near a body of water.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|جُدَّة|f|pl=جُدَد}}

# [[streak]], [[tract]], [[path]], [[stria]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|35|27|passage=وَمِنَ الْجِبَالِ '''جُدَدٌ''' بِيضٌ وَحُمْرٌ مُّخْتَلِفٌ أَلْوَانُهَا وَغَرَابِيبُ سُودٌ|subst=وَمِنَ/وَ-مِنَ,وَحُمْرٌ/وَ-حُمْرٌ,وَغَرَابِيبُ/وَ-غَرَابِيبُ|translation=And in the barrows there are '''streaks''' of bright white, of reds of sundry shades, and of raven’s black.}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|جُدَّة|pl=جُدَد}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|جِدَّة|f|head2=جُدَّة}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# {{senseid|ar|bank}} [[bank]], [[side]], [[edge]] of a [[water body]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|جِدَّةُ|head2=جُدَّة}}

