Page 6935 جذر: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1.1===
A phonetic variant of the root {{ar-root|ج|د|ر}}, which is related to things being separated, set apart, distinguishing themselves, hence a root or a stub cut off, whereafter metaphoric denominals related to roots.<ref>{{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=254}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|جَذَرَ}}

====Verb====
