Page 6946 جراب: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{unknown|ar}}, a culture-word interrelated with {{cog|fa|جوراب|tr=jôrâb|t=sock}} with a disputed direction of borrowings. Cognate to {{cog|arc|גְּרַב|tr=gəraḇ}}, {{m|arc|גַּרְבָּא|tr=garbā}}, {{cog|syc|ܓܪܳܒܳܐ|tr=gərāḇā|t=skin bottle}}, {{cog|akk-lbb|𒄖𒊏𒁍|ts=gurābu|t=bag; bag around a jug}}, {{cog|gez|ግራብ|t=skin bottle}}, {{cog|am|ጊርባ|t=container for water or honey made from skin}}. Arabic has the word in other shapes {{m|ar|قِرْبَة}} and {{m|ar|قِرَاب}}; see also {{m|ar|جَوْرَب|tr=}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|جِرَاب|m|pl=جُرُب|pl2=أَجْرِبَة}}

# [[pouch]], [[sack]], [[case]], [[sheath]], [[holster]], etc.
# [[pod]] (of plant-seeds)
# [[scrotum]]
# [[bursa]]
# [[omasum]], [[psalterium]], the third compartment of the stomach of a [[ruminant]]
#: {{syn|ar|أُمّ التَلَافِيف}}
#: {{coordinate terms|ar|كَرِش|t1=[[rumen]]|قَلَنْسُوَة|t2=[[reticulum]]|إِنْفَحَة|t3=[[abomasum]]}}
# [[marsupial]]
#: {{syn|ar|جِرَابِيّ}}

