#* {{RQ:Qur'an|7|133|passage=فَأَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلطُّوفَانَ '''وَٱلْجَرَادَ''' وَٱلْقُمَّلَ وَٱلضَّفَادِعَ وَٱلدَّمَ آيَاتٍ مُفَصَّلَاتٍ فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا وَكَانُوا قَوْمًا مُجْرِمِينَ|t=We caused to be sent upon them destruction abounding, locusts, lice, frogs, and the blood, as signs of proof discernibly clear, but they had considered themselves of greater importance and had been a people who caused wrongdoing to be encouraged.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|54|7|passage=خُشَّعًا أَبْصَارُهُمْ يَخْرُجُونَ مِنَ ٱلْأَجْدَاثِ كَأَنَّهُمْ '''جَرَادٌ''' مُّنْتَشِرٌ|t=Their eyes humbled, they will emerge from the graves as if they were locusts spreading.}}
