{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# to [[drag]] [[along]], to [[haul]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=p. 700|author=a forger of {{w|Imru' al-Qais|Imruʾ al-Qays}}|title=[[s:ar:سما لكَ شوقٌ بعدما كان أقصر|{{lang|ar|سما لكَ شوقٌ بعدما كان أقصر }}]] <sup>[https://www.aldiwan.net/poem53.html] [http://al-hakawati.la.utexas.edu/2013/02/05/%D8%B3%D9%85%D8%A7-%D9%84%D9%83%D9%8E-%D8%B4%D9%88%D9%82%D9%8C-%D8%A8%D8%B9%D8%AF%D9%85%D8%A7-%D9%83%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%A3%D9%82%D8%B5%D8%B1/]</sup>|passage=وَإِنِّي زَعِيمٌ <small>({{var}} أَذِينٌ)</small> إِنْ رَجِعْتُ مُمَلَّكٌ / بِسَيْرٍ تَرَى مِنْهُ الفُرَانِقَ أَزْوَرَا<br/>عَلَى لَاحِبٍ لَا يَهْتَدِي بِمَنَارِهِ / إِذَا سَافَهُ الْعَوْدُ النُّبَاطِيُّ <small>({{var}} دِيَافِيُّ)</small> جَرْجَرَا<br/>عَلَى كُلِّ مَقْصُوصِ الذُنَابَى مُعَاوِدٍ / بَرِيدَ السَرَى بِاللَيْلِ مِن خَيْلِ بَرْبَرَا|subst=سَافَهُ/سَافَ-هُو,وَإِنِّي/وَ-إِنِّي,بِسَيْرٍ/بِ-سَيْرٍ,بِمَنَارِهِ/بِ-مَنَارِ-هِي|t=And when I am the leader, back in the kingly rights, I trip so fast that you but see asquint the courier<br/>on an open road guided by no waymark, when it is smelled by the Nabataean camel dragging forward<br/>on every clipped bird-tail returning nocturnal journey’s mail by night from a horse that whinnied.}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|work=RT Arabic|title=ar:روحاني «يجرجر» واشنطن إلى المحاكم الدولية|trans-title=Rowhâni “drags” Washington to international courts|date=2016-05-11|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160512102251/https://arabic.rt.com/news/822707-%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%86%D9%8A-%D9%8A%D8%B3%D8%AD%D8%A8-%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%B4%D9%86%D8%B7%D9%86-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%83%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D9%88%D9%84%D9%8A%D8%A9/|archivedate=2016-05-12}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|work=Al-Yawm 24|title=ar:الرميد يجرجر سفيرا سابقا إلى المحكمة|trans-title=Ar-Ramīd drags a former ambassador to court|date=2019-01-30|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20190130190247/http://www.alyaoum24.com/1204884.html|archivedate=2019-01-30}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|Iq}}

===Etymology 2===
{{onomatopoeic|ar}} in origin.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# to [[gargle]], to [[gurgle]], to drink with such a sound, to [[quaff]]
#* {{RQ:Sunna|muslim|37|1}} = {{RQ:Sunna|bukhari|74|60}}
#*: {{quote|ar|الَّذِي يَشْرَبُ فِي آنِيَةِ الْفِضَّةِ إِنَّمَا يُجَرْجِرُ فِي بَطْنِهِ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ|He who drinks from silver vessels quaffs the fire of hell.|subst=بَطْنِهِ/بَطْنِ-هِي}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|Iq}}

