===Etymology===
Possibly applying the pattern {{m|ar||فِعْلَلّ}} to the root {{ar-root|ج د ل}}, with later augment ({{m|ar|إِلْحَاق}}) of {{m|ar|ح}} and {{m|ar|ر}} for dissimilation ({{m|ar|إِدْغَام}}), as it would otherwise be {{m|ar||*جِدْلَلّ}}, that invites first {{m|ar||*جِرْدَلّ}} and then {{m|ar||جِرْدَحْل}}.

