Page 7072 جفنة: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}
{{ar-rootbox|ج ف ن}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|ar|جَفْن|ـَة}}, cognate to {{cog|he|גֶּפֶן|tr=gefen|t=vine}}, {{cog|syc|ܓܦܢܬܐ|tr=gəp̄entā}}, {{m|syc|ܓܦܬܐ|tr=gəp̄ettā|t=vine}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|جَفْنَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|جَفْنَة|f|pl=جِفَان|pl2=جَفَنَات|pl3=جَفْنَات|pl4=جِفَن}}

# [[bowl]], [[tub]]
#* {{RQ:Quran|34|13|passage=يَعْمَلُونَ لَهُۥ مَا يَشَاءُ مِنْ مَحَٰرِيبَ وَتَمَٰثِيلَ '''وَجِفَانٍ''' كَٱلْجَوَابِ وَقُدُورٍ رَاسِيَٰتٍ  ٱعْمَلُوا ءَالَ دَاوُۥدَ شُكْرًا وَقَلِيلٌ مِنْ عِبَادِيَ ٱلشَّكُورُ|t=They made for him what he willed of elevated chambers, statues, '''bowls''' like reservoirs, and stationary kettles. [We said], "Work, O family of David, in gratitude." And few of My servants are grateful.}}
# [[grapevine]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|جَفْنَة|pl=جِفَان|pl2=جَفَنَات|pl3=sfp|pl4=جِفَن}}

{{C|ar|Grapevines}}
