===Etymology===
From the {{bor|ar|pal|-}} ancestor of {{cog|fa-cls|جولاهک|tr=jūlāhak}}.{{dercat|ar|sa}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|جُلَاهِق|جَلَاهِق}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|جُلَاهِق|m|head2=جَلَاهِق|pl=جُلَاهِقَات|pl2=جَلَاهِقَات}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# a [[reel]] or [[ball]] of [[thread]]
#* {{quote-book|year=622|ar|title=an occurrence reported inter alia by the [https://www.google.de/books/edition/تفسير_الماوردي_النكت/71R7DwAAQBAJ?hl=de&gbpv=1&dq=%22لعب+الحمام+والجلاهق%22&pg=PT271&printsec=frontcover Tafsīr] of {{w|al-Mawardi|al-Māwardīy}} and [https://www.google.de/books/edition/Theology_Ethics_and_Metaphysics/BQcSBAAAQBAJ?hl=de&gbpv=1&dq=%22jal%C4%81hiq%22&pg=PT112&printsec=frontcover that] of {{w|Ibn Abi al-Dunya|Ibn Abī ad-Dunyā}} to Qurʔān [https://qurano.com/ar/29-al-ankabut/aya-29/ 29:29] ({{w|Al-Ankabut|Al-ʕAnkabūt}})|passage=ولعب الحمام وال'''جلاهق''' والسحاق وحل أزرار القباء|t=And one played with pigeons, '''threads''', rubbing and unfastening buttons from the cloak}}
# [[bullet]]s for [[shoot]]ing by means of a [[sling]] or [[crossbow]], [[projectile]]s
#: {{syn|ar|رَصَاص|كلة|alt2=كُلَل|بُنْدُق}}
# {{ellipsis of|ar|قَوْس جُلَاهِق|nodot=1|nocap=1}}, [[crossbow]]

