Page 7126 جماهيرية: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ج م ه ر}}
{{wikipedia|Jamahiriya}}

===Etymology===
The adjective is the usual feminine form of {{m|ar|جَمَاهِيرِيّ}}, the [[نسبة|nisba]] adjective of {{m|ar|جَمَاهِير}}.


The noun is a neologism coined by {{w|Muammar Gaddafi}} in 1977 based on {{m|ar|جُمْهُورِيَّة||republic}}, by changing the first element, {{m|ar|جُمْهُور||public}}, to its plural form, {{m|ar|جَمَاهِير||the masses}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|جَمَاهِيرِيَّة|f}}

# "state of the masses", [[People's Republic]], [[Jamahiriya]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|جَمَاهِيرِيَّة}}

===Adjective===
