Page 7138 جمع: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ج م ع}}
Compare {{cog|hss|tr=egtōma}}, {{cog|gdq|عَتمَأ|tr=gatmaʾ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|جَمَعَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-جمع.ogg}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~a.pass.vn:جَمْع}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[gather]], [[assemble]], [[keep]] [[together]], to [[collect]]
#* {{quote-journal|ar|work=The Baghdad Post|title=ar:التايمز تكشف عن مخبأ الآلاف من إرهابيي داعش الأجانب|date=28-12-2017|url=http://s.thebaghdadpost.com/ar/74040
|passage=ويشار بحسب المجلة، بان اعداد إرهابيي داعش الأجانب ما زال كبيرا جدا على الرغم من التقديرات التي ترجح مقتل الآلاف منهم، حيث تظهر البيانات المجموعة من 33 دولة لها مواطنين يقاتلون مع عصابات داعش الإرهابية، ان ما يزيد عن 6000 منهم قد تمكنوا من العودة الى بلدانهم، فيما تصل اعداد الغائبين إلى الآلاف المضاعفة.
|translation=It is shown by the magazine that the number of foreign ISIS terrorists has not ceased to be very large in spite of assessments that affirm the death of thousands of them as likely, whereas the data gathered from 33 states to which citizens fighting for terrorist ISIS groups belong reveals that more than 6000 of them have had the opportunity of returning to their homelands, while the number of absentees has reached several thousands.}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[unite]], to [[reconcile]]
# to [[collect]] oneself, to [[recollect]]
# {{lb|ar|construed with {{m|ar|بِ}}}} to [[lie with]]
# to [[add]]
# {{lb|ar|grammar}} to [[form]] the [[plural]]
# to [[contain]]
# to be [[full-grown]]
# to have two or more negative [[attribute]]s at the same time; to have a negative attribute on top of another negative attribute
#: {{uxi|ar|جَمَعَ بَيْنَ اﳉَﻬْﻞ وَﺳُﻮء اﳋُﻠُﻖ|Not only was he ignorant but also ill-mannered}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~a.pass.vn:جَمْع}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{l|ar|فَرَّقَ}}

===Etymology 2===
Intensive of {{m|ar|جَمَعَ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|جَمَّعَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.pass}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[assemble]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.pass}}

===Etymology 3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|جَمْع}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|جَمْع|m|pl=جُمُوع}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|جَمَعَ|form=I}}
# [[gathering]], [[collecting]]
#: {{uxi|ar|جَمْعُ المَال|'''raising''' money; '''collecting''' money}}
# [[crowd]], [[throng]], [[mass]], [[legion]]
#: {{uxi|ar|جَمْعٌ مِنَ النَاس|a '''gathering''' of people}}
# {{lb|ar|military}} a [[military]] force
# {{lb|ar|grammar}} [[plural]], a form of a noun denoting [[multiple]]s by its sense
#: {{ant|ar|مُفْرَد}}
#: {{uxi|ar|جَمْع رُوح أَرْوَاح|the '''plural''' of "rūḥ" is "arwāḥ"}}
# {{lb|ar|arithmetic}} [[addition]]
#: {{ant|ar|طَرْح}}
#: {{uxi|ar|الجَمْع وَالطَرْح|'''addition''' and subtraction}}
# [[lumping]] [[together]], putting subjects in the same category
#: {{ant|ar|تَفْرِيق}}
# {{lb|ar|islam}} a proposition in which a general and a particular subject are included in one category or judgement through a common attribute
# {{lb|ar|logic}} [[distribution]] of a term

