===Etymology===
{{ar-rootbox|ج م ع}}
From {{m|ar|جَمَعَ|t=to gather, to assemble}}, although the details who where and how assembled originally why, on this weekday instituted as the day of “{{w|Friday prayer|congregational prayer}}” in Islam, are uncertain. {{displaced|ar|sl=1|عَرُوبَة}}.

===Pronunciation===
