Page 7361 ح د ج: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Recalls {{ar-root|ه د ج|nocat=1}} where {{m|ar|هَدَجَ|t=to walk in a trembling fashion}} (considering that one does that when carrying heavy loads, as well as when one has eaten colocynths: {{m|ar|حَظِلَ}} related to {{m|ar|حَنْظَل|t=colocynth}} means exactly walking lamely especially after having eaten colocynths) and {{m|ar|هَوْدَج|t=litter for carrying}}. Seemingly just extended from {{ar-root|د ج ج|nocat=1}} where {{m|ar|دَجَّ|t=to walk along gently}}, though parallelled by {{cog|uga|𐎈𐎄𐎂|t=litter or chair for a woman}}. According to Dillmann {{cog|gez|አድግ|t=ass, donkey}} also belongs here.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

