* {{l|ar|يَحْبُور|t=young of a bustard}}
* {{l|ar|آخِرُ الزَمَانِ الْحُبَارَى تَصِيرُ شَاهِين|pos=proverb|lit=At the end of the time a bustard will become a falcon|t=it is against nature, it is impossible}}

