Page 7537 حبذا: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ح ب ذ}}

===Etymology===
{{univerbation|ar|حَبَّ|ذَا|t1=to like|t2=this}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَبَّذَا}}

===Verb===
{{head|ar|verb|head=حَبَّذَا}} {{tlb|ar|inconjugable}}

# how [[good]] is...! how [[lovely]] is...!
#: {{syn|ar|نِعْمَ}}
#: {{ant|ar|بِئْسَ|سَاءَ}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=c. 12th century {{CE}}|author='Arqala al-Kalbi|text=رَصَّعَ الشَّيْبُ لِمَّتِي يَا خَلِيلِي // بِنُجُومٍ طُلُوعُهُنَّ أُفُولِي<br>كَانَ شَعْرِي كَمُقْلَتَيْكَ فَأَضْحَى // كَثَنَايَاكَ '''حَبَّذَا''' مِن بَدِيلِ|t=The greyness has embroidered my locks, oh my dear, // with the stars, their rise is my dusk.<br>My hair was the colour of your eyes, and now // it became the colour of your teeth, '''what a wonderful''' change!}}
# [[preferably]], [[rather]], [[better]]
#* {{quote-web|ar|date=15 July 2002|author=[[United Nations]]|work=A/57/PV.9|url=https://undocs.org/pdf?symbol=ar/A/57/PV.9|text=وَسَوْفَ تَسْعَى حُكُومَتِي جَاهِدَةً إِلَى تَحْقِيقِ ٱخْتِتَامِ المُفَاوَضَاتِ فِي هَٰذَا ٱلصَّدَدِ فِي وَقْتٍ مُنَاسِب، '''حَبَّذَا''' يَكُونُ قَبْلَ نِهَايَةِ عَامِ ٢٠٠٣.|subst=٢٠٠٣/أَلْفَيْنِ وَثَلَاثَة|t=My Government will strive for the timely conclusion of negotiations in this regard, '''preferably''' before the end of 2003.}}

