* {{desc|ca|alfàbrega|alts=1|bor=1}}
* {{desc|es|alhábega|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gl|alfábega|bor=1}}
* {{desc|lad|alhabaca|bor=1}}
* {{desc|pt|alfavaca|alts=1|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|osp|albafaca|bor=1}}

