Page 7596 حدس: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{blend|ar|حَدَّ}} with {{unc|ar|nocap=1}} second element, ''Dictionnaire du faisceau dialectal arabe andalou'' suggests {{m|ar|أَسَاس|t=foundation}}, another intuition opts instead for {{m|ar|حَسَّ|t=to feel}}. In the same fashion, following Lane’s comparisons, {{m|ar|هَجَسَ|t=to come to mind, to occur}} is apparently from {{m|ar|هَجَّ}}, whereas in view of {{m|ar|عَدَسَ|t=to journey through; to tread hard}} (both verbs like the present with [[damma|ḍamma]] and [[kasra]] in the non-past) these two senses perhaps instead relate to {{m|ar|دَاسَ|t=to tread}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~i,u.vn:حَدْس}}

# to [[conjecture]], to [[ween]], to [[intuit]], to [[foreknow]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[spring to mind]], to [[occur]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[roam]] without [[direction]], to [[journey]] without [[guidance]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[rush]], to [[hurry]] [[through]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[tread down]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[shoot]], to [[cast]], to [[throw]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to [[aim at]], to [[intend]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i,u.vn:حَدْس}}

===Noun===
