Page 7600 حدوتة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed into Standard Arabic from the dialects. Ultimately from the root {{ar-root|ح د ث}}, with ''ṯ'' replaced by ''t'', which is a typical feature of Levantine and Egyptian Arabic, as well as some Peninsular and Maghrebi dialects.

