Page 7609 حذار: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ح|ذ|ر}} on the {{m|ar||فَعَالِ}} scale used to form a special group of words known in Arabic as {{l|ar|أَسْمَاء أَفْعَال}}. Compare {{l|ar|شَتَّانَ}} and {{l|ar|سُرْعَان}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَذَارِ}}

===Verb===
{{head|ar|verb|head=حَذَارِ}}

# {{lb|ar|defective|transitive|intransitive}} [[watch out]]! [[beware]]!
#* {{quote-book|1=ar|year=a. 965 {{CE}}|author=w:Al-Mutanabbi|title={{link|ar||بِأَبِي الشُّمُوسُ الجَانِحَاتُ غَوَارِبَا}}|passage=سَلْ عَنْ شَجَاعَتِهِ وَزُرْهُ مُسَالِمًا <br> وَ'''حَذَارِ''' ثُمَّ '''حَذَارِ''' مِنْهُ مُحَارِبَا|subst=شَجَاعَتِهِ/شَجَاعَتِهِي,وَ/وَ-|t=Ask of his bravery and visit him peacefully<br>And '''beware''', then '''beware''' of him as a fighter}}

====Usage notes====
The verb is [[defective]] and does not conjugate or receive case endings; it is used the same way with the same final vowels in all contexts.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|حِذَار|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|حَاذَرَ|form=III}}
#* {{quote-book|1=ar|year=a. 965 {{CE}}|author=w:Al-Mutanabbi|title={{link|ar||سِرْبٌ مَحَاسِنُهُ حُرِمْتُ ذَوَاتِهَا}}|passage=هِبْتُ النِّكَاحَ '''حِذَارَ''' نَسْلٍ مِثْلِهَا <br> حَتَّى وَفَرْتُ عَلَى النِّسَاءِ بَنَاتِهَا|subst=وَ/وَ-}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|حِذَار}}

