===Etymology 4===
{{wikipedia|lang=ar|حذف شتوي (طائر)}}
From the root {{ar-root|ح|ذ|ف}} in the sense of "trimming (especially laterally)", from the {{m|ar|تَحْذِيفُ الشَّعَر|tr=|t={{m|en|undercut}} hairstyle}}; so called for the distinctive teal-colored side patches on the bird's head.

