Page 7677 حريم: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ح ر م}}

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ح|ر|م}} meaning "to be restricted", "to be respected", "to be inviolable".

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَرِيم}}
* {{rhymes|ar|iːm}}

