Literally: “the party of God”, after Quran 5:56: {{m|ar||فَإنَّ حِزْبَ اللهِ هُمُ الْغالِبُون|t=the party of God [i.e. those who side with God] are victorious}}. [[Shiites]] interpret this verse as referring to the Twelve Imams and those who support them.

