Page 7690 حزر: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Augmented from {{m|ar|حَزَى}}, {{m|ar|حَزَا|t=to compute by conjecture (fruits on a palm etc.)}}, a variant of {{ar-root|ح ص ي}}, {{ar-root|ح ص و}}, ultimately derivatives of {{m|ar|حَصًى|t=pebbles}} which can be traced to {{der|ar|sem-pro|-}}. Both roots are ascribed plant names: That {{m|ar|حَزَاء|t=rue}}, this {{m|ar|حَزْرَة|t=bitter or salty tree or fruit}}, a meaning shared with {{m|ar|مَقْر}}, {{m|ar|خَمْط}}, {{m|ar|صَبْر}}, perhaps reminiscing the bland tastes of pebbles.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~i,u.vn:حَزْر,مَحْزَرَة}}

# to [[guess]], to [[arread]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i,u.vn:حَزْر,مَحْزَرَة}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# {{lb|ar|uncommon}} to [[arread]] [[haphazard]]ly, to [[dare]] [[guess]]
# {{lb|ar|Egypt}} {{misconstruction of|ar|حَذَّرَ|nocap=1|nodot=1}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|title=ar:تفسير رؤية الإجهاض في المنام|date=2018-12-29|work=Al-Mrsal|url=https://www.almrsal.com/post/576903|passage=-إذا حلمت سيدة متزوجة وحامل بأنها تتعرض للإجهاض بإرادتها، فهذا الحلم تحزير لها بأنها إذا حاولت إجهاض جنينها فسوف تنقلب حياتها رأسا على عقب،|t=If a married woman is pregnant and dreaming about facing abortion willingly, then this dream is a warning to her that if she tries abortion of the fetus her life will be thrown head over heels.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|page=374b}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=1|page=419}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=203}}

-------- end text --------
