Page 7695 حزنبل: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}
[[File:20150813Achillea millefolium.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|حَزَنْبَل}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
Augmented ({{m|ar|إِلْحَاق}}) from {{m|ar|حَبْل|t=rope}}, two times to fuse a quinqueliteral from a triliteral, in reference to the astringent application of the plant. We see crosslinguistically that the habit of a [[composite]] stimulates speakers to multiply, and mnemotechny, relevant for the lexemic image of a plant, advises dichotomies and trichotomies: see {{cog|sla-pro|*devęsilъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَزَنْبَل}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|حَزَنْبَل|m}}

# [[common yarrow]] ({{taxfmt|Achillea millefolium|species}})

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|حَزَنْبَل}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|fa|حزنبل|tr=hazanbel|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tr|hazanbel|hazambel|bor=1}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ar:Baalbaki:2008|page=151}}

