===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَزِين}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-حزين.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj|حَزِين|pl=حَزِينُونَ|pl2=حُزَنَاء|pl3=حِزَان|pl4=حَزَانَى|fpl=حَزِينَات|el=أَحْزَن}}

# [[sad]], [[sorrowful]]
#: {{ant|ar|فَرِح|فَرْحَان}}
#: {{ux|ar|الْمَوْقِف الْحَزِين أَثَر بِي كَثِيْرًا.|The sad situation affected me greatly.}}

====Usage notes====
* The Arabic word is not usually employed for things that ''inspire'' sadness. For that use {{m|ar|مُحْزِن}}, e.g. {{m|ar||خَبَر مُحْزِن|t=sad news}}.

