Page 7724 حسنة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ح|س|ن}}. Compare {{l|ar|حَسُنَ||to be good}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|חסן|tr=“khōsen”, “[[wealth]], [[treasure]]”}}.

===Noun===
