====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i,u.pass.vn:حُلُول}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[dismount]]; to [[stop]], to [[halt]]
# {{lb|ar|intransitive|or|transitive}} to [[stay]], to [[settle]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ/:فِي/acc<in a place>|:عَلَى<with someone>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[visit]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<someone>}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[live]] in, to [[reside]] in (a place)
#: {{syn|ar|بَقِيَ|أَقَامَ|قَرَّ|مَكَثَ|سَكَنَa<t:to inhabit, to settle>|وَطَنَ|عَاشَ|عَمَرَ<t:to settle; to colonize>}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|13|31|passage=وَلَا يَزَالُ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا تُصِيبُهُم بِمَا صَنَعُوا قَارِعَةٌ أَوْ تَحُلُّ قَرِيبًا مِّن دَارِهِمْ حَتَّىٰ يَأْتِيَ وَعْدُ اللَّهِ}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[occupy]], to [[take]] (someone's place)
##* {{quote-book|ar|author=ar:{{w|lang=ar|وجدي الأهدل|وَجْدِيّ الْأَهْدَل}}|title=ar:أرض المؤامرات السعيدة|year=2018|isbn=978-614-469-069-7|publisher=Nawfal / Hachette Antoine|location=Bayrūt|page=83|passage=كان في أحد الأكياس تشكيلة من البسكويت القديم الذي اندثر من بقالات  صنعاء وغيرها من المدن.  هذه الأنواع من البسكويت كانت متوفرة عندما كنت صغيراً وعمري على ما أذكر 4–7 سنوات، ثمّ اختفت بالتدريج، و'''حلّت''' محلّها أصناف أخرى.|t=In one of the bags there was a pack of ancient biscuits the kind of which disappeared from most grocers of Ṣanʻāʼ and other cities. This type of biscuit was widespread when I small and my age, as I remember, 4–7, then it left sight gradually, and other kinds '''took''' its place.}}
# to [[descend]], to [[go]] [[down]]
# to [[occur]], to [[happen]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ<to someone>}}
#: {{syn|ar|حَصَلَ|حَدَثَ|جَرَى|t1=to come about; to happen|t2=to happen; to eventuate|t3=to occur}}
# to [[befall]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ/:عَلَى<someone>}} {{q|of punishment, suffering, hatred or something else negative}}
#: {{syn|ar|نَزَلَ|وَقَعَ|t1=to befall|t2=to befall}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|20|81|passage=كُلُوا مِنْ طَيِّبَاتِ مَا رَزَقْنَاكُمْ وَلَا تَطْغَوْا فِيهِ '''فَيَحِلَّ''' عَلَيْكُمْ غَضَبِي وَمَنْ '''يَحْلِلْ''' عَلَيْهِ غَضَبِي فَقَدْ هَوَىٰ|t=Eat of the good things wherewith We have provided you, and transgress not in respect thereof lest My wrath '''come''' upon you: and he on whom My wrath '''cometh''', he is lost indeed.}}
# to [[overwhelm]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<someone>}} {{q|of sleep}}
# to [[arrive]], to [[begin]] {{q|of a season or time}}
# to [[become]] [[incarnate]] {{+obj|ar|:فِي<in someone>}} {{q|of God}}

