Page 7866 حلة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|syc|ܚܠܐ|tr=ḥellā|t=dust, secretion, powdery film; veil}} stemming from the sense of a veil clouding or covering the eyes like dust or a film.

