# [[suit]], [[costume]], [[attire]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|حُلَّة|f|pl=حُلَل}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ar-rootbox|ح ل ل}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|حِلَّة|f}}

# [[mode]] of doing {{l|ar|حَلّ}} or {{l|ar|حُلُول}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|حِلَّة}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|حِلَّة|f|pl=حِلَال|pl2=أَحْلَال}}

# {{tlb|ar|Sudan|Chad|Nigeria|Mali|Mauritania}} [[alighting]]-[[place]], [[collection]] of [[tent]]s, [[douar]], [[settlement]], [[village]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَرْيَة|بَلَد|ضَيْعَة|فَرِيق|رحل|alt5=رِحَال|g5=p}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|حِلَّة|pl=حِلَال|pl2=أَحْلَال}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{bor|ar|arc|חַלְּתָא}} / {{l|syc|ܚܲܠܬ݂ܵܐ|tr=ḥalləṯā|t=basket; bucket}}, from which {{cog|akk-nbb|𒄬𒆷𒌓|tr=ḫallatu|t=wicker basket}} is likely also derived. Traditionally however it has been connected with {{ar-root|ح|ل|ل|}} in the sense of alighting, stopping, or unpacking for camp; thought as a device so named for its use at a campsite.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|حَلَّة|f|pl=حِلَل}}

# {{tlb|ar|Egypt|Sudan}} [[cooking pot]], especially made of [[copper]]
# {{tlb|ar|Iraq}} [[large]] [[basket]] or [[food]] [[bin]], especially used to [[store]] [[wheat]] or [[cereal]] [[grain]]s during [[travel]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|حَلَّة|f|pl=حِلَل}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=50}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=621}}

