Page 7883 حلم: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{ar-rootbox|ح ل م}}
Akin to {{cog|arc|חֶלְמָא|tr=ḥelmā}}, {{cog|syc|ܚܠܡܐ|tr=ḥelmā}}, {{cog|he|חֲלוֹם|tr=khalóm}}, {{cog|uga|𐎈𐎍𐎎}}. For the significations of the root in Arabic, compare {{ar-root|م|ن|ي|nocat=1}}, whence {{m|ar|أُمْنِيَة|t=a wish}} and {{m|ar|مَنِيّ|t=a fluid considered conceptive; semen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حُلْم}} or {{ar-IPA|حُلُم}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.ipass.vn:حُلْم,حُلُم}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive|transitive}} to [[dream]] (something) or about {{+obj|ar|:بِ}} (something) while [[asleep]]
#: {{syn|ar|اِحْتَلَمَ|رَأَى}}
## {{lb|ar|intransitive|transitive}} to [[muse]], [[reflect]], or [[meditate]] on {{+obj|ar|:بِ}}; to [[vision]], to [[image]]
##: {{syn|ar|تَخَيَّلَ|تَصَوَّرَ}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[experience]] the [[first]] [[seminal]] [[ejaculation]]
#: {{syn|ar|اِحْتَلَمَ}}
## {{lb|ar|intransitive|chiefly of males}} to [[mature]] [[physical]]ly or [[sexual]]ly; to [[attain]] [[puberty]]
##: {{syn|ar|بَلَغَ}}
## {{lb|ar|intransitive|law|chiefly of males|archaic}} to become a [[legal]] [[adult]] or to be [[perceive]]d as such
##: {{syn|ar|بَلَغَ|أَدْرَكَ|رَشَدَ|عَقَلَ|مَيَّزَ}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.ipass.vn:حُلْم,حُلُم}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.nopass.vn:حِلْم}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive|approving}} to [[mature]] [[mental]]ly or to be [[perceive]]d as such; to [[act]] or [[think]] like an [[adult]]
# {{lb|ar|intransitive|approving}} to be [[gentle]], [[forgiving]], [[merciful]], or [[lenient]]; to be [[mild-mannered]]
# {{lb|ar|intransitive|approving}} to [[restrain]] oneself or to be [[restrained]] or [[checked]] (especially [[emotional]]ly and [[psychological]]ly); to [[forbear]], to [[refrain]], to [[abstain]], to [[withhold]]; to be [[long-suffering]], to be [[patient]] or [[enduring]]; to [[mellow]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.nopass.vn:حِلْم}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|حُلْم|head2=حُلُم|m|pl=أَحْلَام}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|حَلَمَ|form=I}}: [[dreaming]]
# a [[dream]] {{gloss|something experienced during sleep}}; [[vision]]
#: {{syn|ar|رُؤْيَا|مَنَام}}
#: {{hypo|ar|كَابُوس|t=nightmare}}
# a [[wish]], a [[desire]], an [[aspiration]]; a [[daydream]] {{gloss|something fantasised about or desired}}
#: {{syn|ar|مُنْيَة|بُغْيَة}}
# [[utopia]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|حُلْم|head2=حُلُم|pl=أَحْلَام}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|أَضْغَاثُ أَحْلَامٍ|g=p|t=convolutions of dreams}}

===Noun===
