# to be [[attach]]ed to, to be [[affectionate]] towards {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<someone>}}
# to [[sympathize]], to [[commiserate]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<with someone>}}
# to [[care for]] one's [[child]]ren and not [[remarry]] {{q|of a widow}}
