Page 7963 حنظل: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Citrullus colocynthis1.jpg|thumb|right|حَنْظَل]]
{{slim-wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|حَظَلَ|t=to hinder in moving}}, for this toxic plant blocks the ground, and {{m|ar|حَظِلَ|t=to walk lamely}} which is what camels do after having loaded their bellies with this plant. The same motive was the namesake of {{m|ar|حَدَج|t=colocynth}}.

===Pronunciation===
