* {{cite-journal|last=Faris|first=Nabih Amin|coauthors=Glidden, Harold W.|title=The Development of the Meaning of the Koranic Ḥanīf|journal=The Journal of the Palestine Oriental Society|volume=19|year=1939|pages=1–13}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=3|page=436}}
* {{R:ar:Jeffery-Foreign|page=112–115}}
