* {{cite-journal|last=Margoliouth|first=David Samuel|title=On the Origin and Import of the Names Muslim and Ḥanīf|authorlink=David Samuel Margoliouth|journal=The Journal of the Royal Asiatic Society of Great Britain and Ireland|issue=3|year=1903|pages=467–493|doi=10.2307/25208542}}
