Page 8026 حية: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ح|و|ي}}, meaning "to wrap around", "to wiggle or twist", "to writhe", "to coil", "to circle around a location", "to draw or gather together"; related to the root {{ar-root|ح|ي|و|nocat=1}}, meaning "a living space or enclosure", "a surrounding or vicinity", "a collection of tents circling around a campsite". Cognate with {{cog|arc|חויא|tr=ḥiwyā}}, {{cog|syc|ܚܘܝܐ|tr=ḥewyā}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{ar-IPA|حَيَّة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|حَيَّة|f|pl=حَيَّات}}

# [[snake]], [[serpent]]
# [[worm]], [[wyrm]]

