<!--[[File:Vazhuthananga Brinjal flower.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|حَيْصَل}}]]
[[File:Starr-090713-2639-Solanum melongena-round yellow fruit-Lahaina-Maui (24673975280).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|حَيْصَل}}]]-->

===Etymology===
A modification of {{m|ar|حَوْصَل|t=pocket, pouch, bladder etc.}} from the root {{ar-root|ح ص ل}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|حَيْصَل}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|حَيْصَل|m}}

# {{tlb|ar|archaic|Syria|_|regional}} [[eggplant]], [[aubergine]]
#: {{syn|ar|بَاذِنْجَان|مَغْد|وَغْد|أَنَب|حَدَق}}
#* {{quote-web|1=ar|year=2014|work=Al-Waḥda|title=ar:صفر أبو وردي ...وغاباتها الغنية بالأشجار|url=http://alwehda.gov.sy/index.php/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9/7987-%D8%B5%D9%81%D8%B1-%D8%A3%D8%A8%D9%88-%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%AF%D9%8A-%D9%88%D8%BA%D8%A7%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%AA%D9%87%D8%A7-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%BA%D9%86%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D8%B4%D8%AC%D8%A7%D8%B1|passage=والتقت العروبة التربوي يوسف اليوسف الذي تحدث قائلا:تعود تسمية القرية إلى تربتها الصفراء التي تميل إلى لون الذهب والنحاس وكذلك انتشار أشجار /الحيصل / المليئة بالأزهار ذات اللون الأصفر.|t=And Al-ʾurūba met the erudite Yusūf Al-Yusūf who recounts saying: The name of the village goes back to its yellow soil that tends to the colour of gold of copper as well as to ''aubergine'' trees that are full of saffroned blossoms.|accessdate=16 December 2019|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20191216023111/http://alwehda.gov.sy/index.php/%25D8%25A7%25D9%2584%25D8%25B9%25D8%25B1%25D9%2588%25D8%25A8%25D8%25A9/7987-%25D8%25B5%25D9%2581%25D8%25B1-%25D8%25A3%25D8%25A8%25D9%2588-%25D9%2588%25D8%25B1%25D8%25AF%25D9%258A-%25D9%2588%25D8%25BA%25D8%25A7%25D8%25A8%25D8%25A7%25D8%25AA%25D9%2587%25D8%25A7-%25D8%25A7%25D9%2584%25D8%25BA%25D9%2586%25D9%258A%25D8%25A9-%25D8%25A8%25D8%25A7%25D9%2584%25D8%25A3%25D8%25B4%25D8%25AC%25D8%25A7%25D8%25B1|archivedate=16 December 2019}}

