Page 8038 حيعل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{blend|ar|حَيَّ|عَلَى}}, from the first two words in the sentence {{m|ar|حَيَّ عَلَى الصَّلَاة||hasten to the prayer}}, a part of the adhan text.

