Page 8047 حيوان: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{picdic|image=Lightmatter chimp.jpg
|detail1=
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Tiger in the water.jpg|link=ثديي}}
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Discus fish.jpg|link=سمك}}
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Notophthalmus viridescensPCCA20040816-3983A.jpg|link=برمائي}}
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Tuatara.jpg|link=زحافة}}
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Cyanocitta cristata FWS.jpg|link=طير}}
{{picdicimg|ar|image=Osmia rufa couple (aka).jpg|link=حشرة}}
}}
From the root {{ar-root|ح|ي|و}}, stemming from {{inh|ar|sem-wes-pro|*ḥayaw-|t=to live}}. Parallelly found in {{cog|he|חיה|tr=ḥayyā}}, {{cog|syc|ܚܝܘܬܐ|tr=ḥaywəṯā}} and {{cog|uga|𐎈𐎆𐎉}}.

===Pronunciation===
