#: {{ux|ar|الحَيَوَانُ الْمُفْتَرِسُ يَعِيشُ فِي الْغَابَةِ.|The predatory animal lives in the forest.}}
# {{lb|ar|collectively}} [[animals]], living [[creatures]]
# {{lb|ar|archaic}} {{verbal noun of|ar|حَيَّ}}: [[life]]; {{q|especially}} long, [[eternal]] life
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|29|64
|passage=وَمَا هَٰذِهِ ٱلْحَيَاةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا إِلَّا لَهْوٌ وَلَعِبٌ وَإِنَّ ٱلدَّارَ ٱلْآخِرَةَ لَهِيَ '''ٱلْحَيَوَانُ''' لَوْ كَانُوا يَعْلَمُونَ
|translation=And this worldly life is not but diversion and amusement. And indeed, the home of the Hereafter – that is the '''[eternal] life''', if only they knew.}}

