A {{inh|ar|sem-pro|-}} kinship term, compare {{cog|akk|ḫatanum|𒄩𒋫𒉡|ts=ḫatānu|t=in-law, son-in-law, brother-in-law or bridegroom}}, {{cog|he|חָתָן⁩|tr=ḫātān|t=bridegroom, son-in-law; the infant fit for circumcision}}, {{cog|arc|חתנה}} / {{m|arc|חַתְנָא}} / {{m|syc|ܚܲܬܼܢܵܐ|tr=ḥaṯnā|t=bridegroom; son-in-law}}, {{cog|sem-srb|𐩣𐩭𐩩𐩬|t=family}}.

