Page 8137 خاصة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From the root {{ar-root|خ ص ص}}. Sense 5 is used in the Shi'ite [[vernacular]] and derives from the people that were closer to the Shi'ite's [[Imam]]s (their "private" (people)), as opposed to the general public ({{l|ar|اَلْعَامَّة}}).

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خَاصَّة|f|pl=خَوَاصّ}}

# [[private]] [[possession]]
# [[property]], [[characteristic]]
# [[essence]], [[nature]]
# [[leading]] [[personalities]], [[elite]], the [[upper class]]
# {{lb|ar|Shi'ism|definite|collective}} people close to [[w:Ahl al-Bayt|Ahl al-Bayt]] and the Shi'ite [[Imam]]s, i.e. the [[Shia]]
#: {{syn|ar|شِيعَة}}
#: {{ant|ar|عَامَّة}}
#* {{quote-book|1=ar|author=Al-Majlisi|chapter=|editor=|editors=|title=Bihar al-Anwar|url=http://ar.lib.eshia.ir/11008/29/106/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AE%D8%A7%D8%B5%D8%A9|edition=Al-Wafa' Foundation|year=1694-1698|volume=29|page=106|text=نُزُولُ هَذِهِ الْآيَةِ فِي فَدَكَ رَوَاهُ كَثِيرٌ مِنَ الْمُفَسِّرِينَ ، وَوَرَدَتْ بِهِ الْأَخْبَارُ مِنْ طُرُقِ '''الْخَاصَّةِ''' وَالْعَامَّةِ.}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|خَاصَّة|pl=خَوَاصّ}}

===Etymology 2===
{{adverbial accusative|ar||خَاصَّة}}.

