Page 8143 خاطئة: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|خَاطِئَة}}

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|خ ط ء}}

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj-fem|خَاطِئَة}}

# {{feminine singular of|ar|خَاطِئ}}

