* {{l|ar|خَوَّان}}
* {{l|ar|خَوَّنَ}}
* {{l|ar|خَؤُون}}
* {{l|ar|خِيَانَة}}

===Etymology 3===
From earlier {{m|ar|قَان}}, derived from {{der|ar|otk|𐰴𐰣|tr=qan}} a contraction of {{m|otk|𐰴𐰍𐰣|tr=qaɣan}}; {{doublet|ar|خَاقَان|nocap=1}} an earlier form, from {{der|ar|pal|hʾkʾn'|tr=xāgān}}, from {{der|ar|otk|𐰴𐰍𐰣|tr=qaɣan}}; ultimately of unknown origin, suggested as a borrowing.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خَان|m|pl=خَوَانِين}}

# [[khan]], a ruler in Northern Asia

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|خَان|pl=خَوَانِين}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|خَانِيَّة||[[khanate]]}}

