{{ar-rootbox|خ د ر}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.nopass.vn:خَدَر}} {{tlb|ar|intransitive}}

# to be or become [[numb]] or [[insensible]]; to [[dull]]
## {{lb|ar|of a body part}} to [[tingle]] out of [[numbness]]
# {{lb|ar|by extension}} to [[drop]] [[off]] in [[vigor]], [[firmness]], [[stiffness]], [[strength]], or the like; to be or become [[limp]] or [[flaccid]]; to [[sag]]; to [[flag]]
#: {{syn|ar|فَتَرَ}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.nopass.vn:خَدَر}}

===Etymology 2===

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:خَدْر}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive|dated}} to [[screen]] [[physical]]ly with another [[object]] (such as a [[curtain]] or a [[drape]])
#: {{syn|ar|سَتَرَ}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive|dated}} to [[screen]] (a girl or a young woman) from [[drudgeries]] and [[chores]] such as [[housekeep]]ing and other [[household]] [[task]]s by [[place|placing]] her in a [[separate]] and [[seclude]]d [[space]]  (such as a [[bedchamber]] or a [[bower]]) in some [[place]] of [[residency]]
#: {{hyper|ar|حَبَسَ}}
## {{lb|ar|of a father}} to [[confine]] (a daughter) to such a [[space]] until [[dispose]]d of in [[marriage]]
## {{lb|ar|of a husband}} to [[restrict]] a (wife) to such a [[space]]
## {{lb|ar|of a master}} to [[keep]] a (female slave) in such a [[space]] so as to make her a [[concubine]] or a [[sex slave]] rather than a [[servant]] or to [[prepare]] for the [[arrangement]] of her [[marriage]]
# {{lb|ar|intransitive|dated}} to [[stay]], to [[bide]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ<in, at>}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:خَدْر}}

=====References=====
* {{R:ar:Lane}}

===Etymology 3===

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.pass}} {{tlb|ar|transitive}}

