## to [[anesthetize]]
## {{lb|ar|derogatory}} to [[deaden]] [[intellectual]]ly
# {{lb|ar|dated}} to [[shut]] [[in]] (a girl or a young woman); to [[mew]] [[up]]; to [[immure]]; to [[coop]] [[up]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.pass}}

