Page 8230 خراج: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{ar-root|خ|ر|ج|}} in the sense “to extract” or “take out”, with {{psm|ar|pal|-|nocap=1}} apparently in an unattested by-form of by-itself {{noncog|ira|-}}-origin {{m|xmn|𐫍𐫡𐫃|ts=harg}}, {{m|pal|𐫟𐫡𐫃|ts=xarg}}, {{m|pal|𐫆𐫡𐫵𐫃|tr=hrːg|ts=harg|t=tribute}} surfacing as {{cog|xcl|հարկ}} etc., an already {{der|ar|peo|-}} contamination {{m|peo|*𐏃𐎼𐎠𐎣|tr=ha-ra-a-ka|ts=*harāka|t=tribute, tax, any public charge based on land property}} on the model of {{der|ar|arc-imp|𐡄𐡋𐡊𐡀|t=tribute, tax, any public charge based on land property|ts=hălāḵā}}, itself calqued from {{der|ar|akk|𒅋𒆪|tr=il-ku|ts=ilku|t=corvée, tribute, any public charge based on land property}}. Also attested several times in {{cog|arc-bib|הֲלָכָא|ts=hălāḵā}} but otherwise missing in {{cog|arc|-}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خَرَاج|m|pl=أَخْرَاج|pl2=أَخْرِجَة}}

# [[public]] [[levy]], [[subsidy]]; [[poll tax|poll-tax]], [[tribute]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|خَرَاج|m|pl=أَخْرَاج|pl2=أَخْرِجَة}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|kharaj|bor=1}}
* {{desc|az|xərac|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fr|kharaj|bor=1}}
* {{desc|axm|խարաճ|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|ota|خراج|tr=haraç|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|خراج|tr=xarâj|bor=1}}
** {{desc|pa|ਖਰਾਜ|bor=1}}
** {{desc|ur|خراج|bor=1|tr=xarāj}}
* {{desc|pl|charadż|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ru|хара́дж|bor=1}}
* {{desc|es|jarach|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ar-rootbox|خ ر ج}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خُرَاج|m|pl=خُرَاجَات|head2=خُرَّاج|pl2=خُرَّاجَات}}

# [[abscess]], [[boil]], [[aposteme]]

