Or, perhaps from {{der|ar|pal||*xār-čōp|lit=thorn stick}}, from {{m|pal||tr=hʾl|ts=xār|t=thorn}} + {{m|pal||tr=cwp|ts=čōb, čōp}} equalling modern {{cog|fa|خار|tr=xâr}}) + {{m|fa|چوب|tr=čôb}}, {{m|fa|چوپ|tr=čôp|t=stick}}.

