Page 8351 خط: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|خ|ط|ط}}. Cognate to {{w|Nabataean Aramaic}} {{m|arc|𐢊𐢋𐢋|t=to pull out; to engrave|sc=Nbat}}, {{cog|tmr|חֲטַט|tr=ḥăṭaṭ|t=to dig out, to hollow out, to excavate}}, {{cog|syc|ܚܰܛ|t=to dig out; to excavate; to carve|tr=ḥaṭṭ}}, {{cog|akk|𒄩𒁕𒂅|tr=ḫa-ṭa-ṭu|ts=ḫaṭāṭu|t=to dig out; to dredge; to make an incision}}.

===Pronunciation===
* Verb: {{ar-IPA|خَطَّ}}
* Noun: {{ar-IPA|خَطّ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-خط.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:خَطّ}}

# to [[draw]] a [[line]]
# to [[draw]]
# to [[write]]
# to [[carve]], [[inscribe]]
# to [[outline]], [[mark]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:خَطّ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|خَطّ|m|pl=خُطُوط}}

