Page 8384 خفج: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar|Diplotaxis}}

===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}. According to '' Dictionnaire du faisceau dialectal arabe andalou'', which glosses {{C|ar|Radishes}} as [[wild radish]] ({{taxfmt|Raphanus raphanistrum|species}}), a homonymic word meaning a foot disease of camels is unrelated and the plant name is rather from {{bor|ar|fa|خفنج|tr=xafanj|t=profit, advantage; delight, blandishment}} due to a use as an appetizing snack. But this is doubtful due to the Bedouin usage.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|خَفَج}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|خَفَج|m}}

# [[wall rocket]] ({{taxlink|Diplotaxis|genus}} gen. et spp.)
# [[nipplewort]] ({{taxfmt|Lapsana|genus}} gen. et spp.)
# {{vern|spiked centaury}} ({{taxlink|Schenkia spicata|species}})

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|خَفَج}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|ars|خفجي|tr=ḵifjī}}

===References===
