{{ar-conj|I/a~i,u.pass.vn:خَفْر,خِفَارَة,خُفُور}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|خَفْر السَّواحِل|t=[[coastguard]]}}

===Etymology 1.2===

====Noun====
