# [[infinite]] [[duration]], [[endless]] [[time]], [[perpetuity]], [[eternity]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|خُلْد}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|ar|arc|חוּלְדּא}} / {{m|syc|ܚܘܠܕܐ|t=mole|tr=ḥuldā}}.<ref>{{R:Hommel-Säugethiere|page=337}}, assumed it inherited from Proto-Semitic and there formed from the verb preceding {{m|arc|חלד}} / {{m|syc|ܚܠܕ|tr=ḥlaḏ|t=to grave or crawl in}} , in spite of this verb being present only in Aramaic and {{cog|he-mis|-}}, probably not knowing that Arabic Aramaisms can contain {{m|ar|خ}}, and with respect to the antiquity of the Hebrew cognate {{m|he|חולד|חֹלֶד|tr=ḥōleḏ|t=weasel, mole, mole-rat}} that verb is likely a {{cog|sem-nwe}} extension of what is found in the Arabic root {{ar-root|خ ل ل|nocat=1}} “to perforate”, {{cog|he|חָלַל|tr=ḥālal|t=to hollow out; to perforate}}, {{cog|akk|𒄩𒆷𒈝|tr=ḫa-la-lum|ts=ḫalālu|t=to creep in, to crawl in, to move quiet or stealthily}}. {{R:sem-pro:SED|volume=2|pages=147–148 No. 108}}, follow Hommel’s assumption without reflection.</ref> Compare {{cog|he|חולד|tr=khóled}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خُلْد|m|pl=خِلْدَان|pl2=مَنَاجِذ}}<ref>{{cite-book|ar|year=8th century|title=Al-Ayn|author=Al-Ḵalīl ibn Aḥmad Al-Farāhīdiyy|volume=4|page=232|editor=Mahdiyy Al-Makhzūmi; Ibrāhim Al-Samirra’iyy|publisher=دار ومكتبة الهلال|oclc=31097893|passage=وَٱلخُلْدُ: ضَرْبٌ مِنَ ٱلجُرْذَانِ عُمْيٌ، لَمْ يُخْلَقْ لَهَا عُيُونٌ، وَاحِدَتُهَا خِلْدَةٌ، وَٱلجَمِيْعُ خِلْدَانٌ}}</ref><ref>{{R:Lisan al-Arab}}</ref><ref>{{R:ar:Qamus}}</ref><ref>{{R:ar:Lane|page=784b}}</ref>

# [[mole-rat]]
# [[mole]] (mammal, modern)
#: {{syn|ar|طُوبِين|طَوْبِين}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|خُلْد|pl=خِلْدَان}}

===Etymology 3===

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|خَلَد|m|pl=أَخْلَاد}}

# [[mind]], [[heart]], [[spirit]], [[temper]]
#* {{quote-book|1=ar|author=Al-Mutanabbī|chapter=69|chapterurl=http://www.almotanabbi.com/poemPage.do?poemId=66|trans-chapter=|entry=|entryurl=|trans-entry=|mainauthor=ʔAbū al-Baqāʔ al-ʕUkbariyy|editors=Ibrāhīm al-Abyārī, Muṣṭafā as-Saqqā, and ʕAbd al-Ḥafīẓ Šalabī|title=ar:ديوان أبي الطيب المتنبي بشرح أبي البقاء العكبري|location=Beirut, Lebanon|publisher=Dār Al-Maʔrifah|year=a. 965|year_published=1978|oclc=863546881|volume=1|line=7|page=350|passage=مَا دَارَ فِي '''خَلَدِ''' الْأَيَّامِ لِي فَرَحٌ / أَبَا عُبَادَةَ حَتَّى دُرْتَ فِي '''خَلَدِي'''}}

