Page 8508 خوخ: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|arc|חוֹחַא|tr=ḥōḥā|t=thornbush}}, likely originally referring to the {{taxfmt|Prunus spinosa|species}} variety, commonly known as [[blackthorn]]; cognates with {{cog|syc|ܚܘܚܐ|tr=ḥōḥā|t=thornbush}}, and {{cog|he|חוֹחַ|tr=ḥōaḥ|t=thornbush}}, {{cog|tmr|חָחָא}} / {{m|arc|חָאחָא|tr=ḥaḥḥā|t=plum}}, {{cog|syc|ܚܲܚܵܐ|tr=ḥaḥḥā|t=plum}}. Possibly an ancient {{der|ar|trk|-}} borrowing, belonging to the family of {{cog|az|göyəm|t=sloe}} (see there for more Turkic).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|خَوْخ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-coll-noun|خَوْخ|sing=خَوْخَة}}

# a [[fruit]] of the genus {{taxfmt|Prunus|genus}} ([[plum]], [[peach]], [[apricot]], [[cherry]]); often one sort in particular, but with regional differences
## [[peach]], [[peaches]]
##: {{syn|ar|دُرّاق|q1=Levant|فِرْسِك|q2=Southwest Arabia, Al-Andalus|بَرْقُوق|q3=Mauritania, Western Sahara}}
## {{lb|ar|Syria|Jordan|Oman}} [[plum]], [[plums]]
##: {{syn|ar|بَرْقُوق|إِجَّاص|q2=Al-Andalus, Iraq|عَيْن الْبَقَر|q3=Tunisia, Libya, Al-Andalus|عَبْقَر|q4=Al-Andalus}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|خَوْخ|sing=خَوْخَة}}

====Descendants====
