* {{desc|am|ኮክ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|byn|ኮክ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gez|ኮክ|bor=1|alts=1}}
* {{desc|har|ኁኂ|bor=1|tr=ḫūḫi}}
* Kurdish:
*: {{desc|kmr|xox|bor=1}}
*: {{desc|ckb|قۆخ|bor=1}}, {{l|ckb|کۆخ}}
*: {{desc|sdh|قووخ|bor=1}}, {{l|sdh|کووخ}}
* {{desc|axm|խոխ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ssy|kak|bor=1}}
* {{tooltip|borrowed|→}} Gurage: {{l|sgw|ኩክ|tr=kuk}}
* {{desc|tig|ኮክ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ti|ኩኽ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|bor=1|zza|xewx|xox}}

