* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=332}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=732}}
* {{R:uga:DUL-3|ḥḏrṯ|page=357}}
* {{R:akk:CDA|ḫinzūru|page=117}}
* {{R:akk:CDA|ḫazru|page=113}}
* {{R:sux:ePSD|gidru}}

