*: {{desc|hi|ख़ैमा}}
*: {{desc|ur|خیمہ|tr=xaimā}}
* {{desc|kr|lăimà|bor=1}}
** {{desc|ha|laimā̀|bor=1}}
* Kurdish:
*: {{desc|kmr|xêvet|bor=1}}
*: {{desc|ckb|خێوەت|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ms|khemah|bor=1}}
** {{desc|id|kemah|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|خیمه|tr=xeyme|bor=1}}
* {{desc|es|jaima|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|hema|bor=1}}
** {{desc|ny|hema|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tig|ከይመት|bor=1}}
** {{desc|byn|[[ከይመት]] / [[kaymat]]|bor=1}}

