Page 8616 دارشيشعان: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Calicotome villosa kz12.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|دارشيشعان}} – {{taxlink|Calicotome villosa|species}}|upright=1.4]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|fa|دار شیشعان|tr=dâr šiša'ân}}. The beginning of this term renders {{m|fa|دار|tr=dâr|t=tree, wood}}, the end is unclear, suspected {{der|ar|trk}} {{m|trk-pro|*čeček|t=flower}} or {{m|trk-pro|*ïgač|*agaç|t=tree}}, but the attestation is early for a Turkic borrowing, otherwise after Vullers {{der|ar|sa|चोचक}}, {{m|sa|चोच|t=cinnamon-bark}} in comparison of the woody branches.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|دَارْشِيشَعَان}}

===Noun===
