===Etymology 1===
{{unk|ar}}, with analogs only in {{bor|ar|sem-sar}} – {{cog|gdq|ديجر|tr=dēdžer, dēdžir, dīdžer|sc=Arab}}, {{cog|shv|دجرة|tr=dəgərɛt|sc=Arab}}, collective {{m|shv|دجر|tr=dúgur, dúger|sc=Arab}}, {{cog|sqt|دنجة|tr=déngoh|sc=Arab}}, collective {{m|sqt|دجر|tr=dégər, dígir|sc=Arab}} – and {{der|ar|cus|-}} – shown as descendants here assuming they agglutinated the Arabic article. Maybe metathesized from {{der|ar|sa|दीर्घ|t=long}} comparing {{cog|grc|δόλιχος|t=[[yardlong bean]] ({{taxfmt|Vigna unguiculata subsp. sesquipedalis|subspecies}})|lit=long}} likely calqued from India.

