# to [[befall]], to [[seize]], to [[come over]] (someone) {{q|e.g. of a doubt, joy, etc.}}
# to take up (a profession, etc.), to [[start]]
# to [[drop in]] on, to [[come]] to [[see]], to [[call on]], to [[visit]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى<someone>}}
# to [[consummate]] a [[marriage]], to [[cohabit]], to [[sleep with|sleep]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى/:بِ<with a woman>}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|4|23|passage={{...}} مِنْ نِسَائِكُمُ اللَّاتِي '''دَخَلْتُمْ''' بِهِنَّ فَإِنْ لَمْ تَكُونُوا '''دَخَلْتُمْ''' بِهِنَّ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ {{...}}|t=[born] of the wives whom you have '''gone into'''—but if you have not '''gone into''' them there is no sin upon you}}
