Identical to {{m|ar|تَدْرُج|t=pheasant}}; the first form based on {{bor|ar|pal||*tadurug}}, the present form on the last two thirds of {{m|pal||*tudurāg}}, with gemination in the Arabic word after the measure as found in {{m|ar|عُكَّاز}}.

