* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|page=29a}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=1|page=695}}
* {{R:ar:Quatremère|MII2|pages=236–239}}
* {{R:ar:Steingass|page=361}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-6-de|page=288a}}. Older editions don’t know the vocalization of {{m|ar||دَسْت}} in the boiler sense.

