Page 8810 دف: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From the root {{ar-root|د ف ف}}; a more primitive form of {{ar-root|د ف ع|nocat=1}}. The noun “lateral surface” may have to be drawn to the Persianisms and ultimate Sumerianisms in the second etymology instead, if not deriving from a combination of both it and native roots.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.nopass?.vn:دَفِيف}}

# to [[flap]] the wings (of a bird)

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i.nopass?.vn:دَفِيف}}

