|translation=And when they saw it as a cloud approaching their valleys, they said, "This is a cloud bringing us rain!" Rather, it is that for which you were impatient: a wind, within it a painful punishment, <br> '''destroying''' everything by command of its Lord. And they became so that nothing was seen except their dwellings. Thus do We recompense the criminal people.
|subst=فَلَمَّا/فَ-لَمَّا,بِأَمْرِ/بِ-أَمْرِ,فَأَصْبَحُوا/فَ-أَصْبَحُوا}}

