Page 8887 دمل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|د م ل}}. Compare {{cog|fa|دنبل|tr=donbal|t=boil}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:دَمْل,دَمَلَان}}

# to [[adjust]], to put into a more [[proper]] [[state]]
