Page 8911 دنيا: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|د|ن|و}} or {{ar-root|د|ن|ي}}. Feminine elative of {{m|ar|أَدْنَى||[[lower]]}}. {{m|ar|دُنيَا||[[world]]}} is originally the "lower place" (as opposed to heaven, the "higher place"); compare {{cog|en|here below}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|دُنْيَا}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj-fem|دُنْيَا}}

# {{feminine singular of|ar|أَدْنَى||[[lower]]}}

===Noun===
