# this mortal life; life in this world
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|3|145|passage=وَمَن يُرِدْ ثَوَابَ '''ٱلدُّنْيَا''' نُؤْتِهِ مِنْهَا وَمَن يُرِدْ ثَوَابَ ٱلْآخِرَةِ نُؤْتِهِ مِنْهَا{{nbsp}}ۚ وَسَنَجْزِي ٱلشَّاكِرِينَ|subst=مِنْهَا{{nbsp}}ۚ/مِنْهَا|t=And whoever desires the reward of '''this world''' - We will give him thereof; and whoever desires the reward of the Hereafter - We will give him thereof. And We will reward the grateful.}}
# [[world]] {{gloss|the [[Earth]], or any this-worldly habitat, excluding the [[next world]]}}

