Page 8916 دهر: -------- begin text --------

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~a.vn:دَهْر}}

# to [[overcome]], to [[conquer]], to [[subdue]], to [[overpower]], to  [[master]], to gain the [[mastery]] over, to [[prevail]], to [[predominate]] over, to [[surpass]]

