===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}. Probably a distorted word, potential relations being {{m|ar|ذَنَب}} or {{cog|ayn|زَبَان|tr=zabān|t=fundament; loins}} and the words mentioned there, and possibly just from a figurative use of {{m|ar|ذَابَ|t=to melt, to flow away}} hamzated in a fashion as {{m|ar|سُؤْدُد}} and {{m|ar|ظِئْر}}, note {{m|ar|ذُوبَان}} and {{m|ar|ذِيبَان|t=hair on the neck of a camel, horse, etc.}}.

