#* {{RQ:Qazwiniy:1849|2|page=238 7–6 a fine|passage=فَأَمَرَ بِفَرَسَيْنِ جَمُوحَيْنِ وَشُدَّتْ '''ذَوَائِبُ'''هَا فِي ذَنَبَيْهِمَا ثُمَّ ٱسْتُحْضِرَا فَقَطَعَهَا|t=He called for two restive horses and their '''curl'''s were fastened to their tails then they were brought along and he cut them.}}
# [[coma]] of a [[comet]]
