===Noun===
{{ar-noun|ذِرَاع|f|d=ذِرَاعَانِ|pl=أَذْرُع|pl2=ذُرْعَان}} {{tlb|ar|countable}}

# {{lb|ar|anatomy}} the [[limb]] of any [[animal]], an [[arm]] or [[leg]]
#: {{hyper|ar|طَرَف|t1=an extremity, a termination}}
#: {{cot|ar|جَنَاح|زِعْنِفَة|t1=a wing|t2=a fin}}
#: {{ux|ar|لِلْأُخْطُبُوطِ ثَمَانِي أَذْرُعٍ.|t=Octopuses have eight arms.}}
## {{lb|ar|of primates}} the [[portion]] of the [[upper]] [[appendage]] from the [[shoulder]] to [[wrist]], the [[arm]]
##: {{syn|ar|يَد|q=obsolete}}
##: {{ux|ar|فِي ذِرَاعِ ٱلْإِنْسَانِ ثَلَاثَةُ عِظَامٍ: اِثْنَتَانِ فِي ٱلسَّاعِدِ ٱسْمَاهُمَا ٱلزَّنْدُ وَٱلْكُعْبُرَةُ وَوَاحِدَةٌ فِي ٱلْعَضُدِ.|t=There are three bones in the human arm: two in the lower arm (called the ulna and the radius) and one in the upper arm.}}
## {{lb|ar|by extension}} something [[resemble|resembling]], [[liken]]ed to, or [[relate]]d to an [[arm]] or [[arm]]s (such as a [[lever]], a [[shift]] [[lever]], a [[lever]] [[arm]], a [[crank]] [[arm]], a [[jib]], a [[boom]], a [[branch]] or [[division]], [[power]], [[might]], [[influence]], and so on)
# {{lb|ar|anatomy|of primates}} the [[portion]] of the [[upper]] [[appendage]] from the [[elbow]] to the [[wrist]], the [[lower]] [[arm]], the [[forearm]]
#: {{syn|ar|سَاعِد}}
#: {{cot|ar|عَضُد|يَد|كَفّ|t1=the upper arm|t2=the hand|t3=the palm; the hand}}
# a [[cubit]], especially the [[Arabian]] [[cubit]] [[variously]] [[standardize]]d by [[place]], [[time]], and [[item]] from 25–75{{nbsp}}[[cm]] (10{{nbsp}}[[in]]–2{{nbsp}}[[ft]] 6{{nbsp}}[[in]]).
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|69|32|passage=ثُمَّ فِي سِلْسِلَةٍ ذَرْعُهَا سَبْعُونَ '''ذِرَاعًا''' فَٱسْلُكُوهُ}}

