Page 9123 ذو: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Equivalent to the second element in {{m|ar|هٰذَا|gloss=[[this]]}} and the first element in {{m|ar|ذٰلِكَ|gloss=[[that]]}}; compare also their plural forms. Related to {{cog|arc|דִּי|tr=dī}} and {{cog|he|זֶה|tr=ze}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|ذُو}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|ذُو|m|f=ذَات|d=ذَوَا|dobl=ذَوَيْ|pl=ذَوُو|pl2=أُولُو|pl2tr=ʔulū|plobl=ذَوِي|plobl2=أُولِي|plobl2tr=ʔulī}} {{qualifier|construct state only}}

# [[possessor]] of, [[owner]] of
#: {{synonyms|ar|صَاحِب}}
#: {{ux|ar|inline=y|رَجُلٌ ذُو مَالٍ|a wealthy man, a man of wealth}}
# {{lb|ar|in the plural}} [[relative]]s, {{qualifier|particularly}} [[parent]]s
#* {{quote-journal|ar|url=https://www.libyaakhbar.com/libya-news/469714.html|title=ar:هون – إعتقال إذاعي شاب شارك فى وقفة تطالب بالخدمات ورحيل بلدي الجفرة|date=Oct 30 2017|work=Libya Akhbar
|passage=و قال زملاء للهوني أن عميد البلدية ضالع فى عملية توقيفه عبر ممارسته لنفوذه مع أقارب و مقربين منه فى مديرية الأمن التي لم تقدم لهم و لذويه سبب واضح عن إعتقاله فيما أفاد مركز شرطة هون بأن لجنة القبض التابعة له قد تسلمت زبير من المديرية بعد ضبطه بناءً على أمر من مديرها.
|translation=And colleagues of [Az-Zubayr] Al-Hūnī have said that the head of the municipality is involved in the process of his apprehension through his utilization of his influence by relatives and close friends of him in the Security Directorate which has not issued to them or to his parents a clear reason for his arrest while the police station of [[w:Hun, Libya|Hūn]] has stated that the Arrestment Department belonging to it had taken over Zubayr from the Directorate after his capture based on an order of its director.}}

====Usage notes====
Though syntactically a noun, the word is often used similarly to the English construction "of + mass noun," as in "a man of great strength," "a woman of noble birth," "a child of great talent," "a person of perfect conduct," and so on.  Not unlike French ''du jour'' meaning "of the day".

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-gendered-noun|ذ:lc|d=ذَوَان|pl=ذَوُون|pl2=أُولُون/ʔulūn
|f=ذَات|fd=ذَوَاتَان|fd2=ذَاتَان|fpl=ذَوَات|fpl2=أُولَات/ʔulāt|state=con}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|ذُو وَجْهَيْنِ}}

====See also====
* {{list:nouns with long construct singular/ar}}

{{cln|ar|irregular nouns|suppletive nouns}}
