-------- end text --------
Page 9136 ذيل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ذ|ي|ل}}, an augment of the root {{ar-root|ذ|ل|ل}}, meaning "to be {{l|en|low}}", "to be in {{l|en|low}}-{{l|en|esteem}}". The sense of "a {{l|en|shelter}} or {{l|en|protection}}" stems from the use of this root to describe weaker tribes that needed the support of stronger allies; contrasted with {{ar-root|و|ل|ي|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|ذَيْل}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-ذيل.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|ذَيْل|m|pl=ذُيُول|pl2=أَذْيُل|pl3=أَذْيَال}}

# [[lower]] [[part]] of a [[thing]], [[touching]] the [[ground]]
# [[tail]]
#: {{syn|ar|ذَنَب}}
# [[skirt]], [[hem]], [[train]], [[trail]]
# [[fringes]]
# [[appendix]], [[supplement]], [[postscript]]
# [[lower]] [[margin]] of a [[book]]
# {{rfquote-sense|ar}} [[shelter]], [[protection]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|ذَيْل|pl=ذُيُول|pl2=أَذْيُل|pl3=أَذْيَال}}

