# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[derive]], to [[stem]] {{+obj|ar|:إِلَى<from something>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[depend]] {{+obj|ar|:إِلَى<on someone/something>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[belong]] {{q|by right}} {{+obj|ar|:إِلَى<to someone>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[refrain]], to [[desist]] {{+obj|ar|:عَن<from something>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[revoke]], to [[countermand]] {{+obj|ar|:عَن<a decision>}}
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[withdraw]] {{+obj|ar|:عَن<a statement>}}
