#: {{syn|ar|رَكَبَ}}
# to [[set out]]
# to [[leave]], [[depart]]
#: {{syn|ar|غَادَرَ}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 1369|author=Ibn Battuta|title=رحلة ابن بطوطة|isbn=978-9953-34-180-4|page=211|volume=1|chapter=العراق وفارس|passage=ثُمَّ '''رَحَلْنَا''' وَنَزَلْنَا قَرْيَةً تُعْرَفُ بِالْمُوَيْلِحَةِ. ثُمَّ '''رَحَلْنَا''' مِنْهَا وَنَزَلْنَا جَزِيرَةَ ٱبْنِ عُمَرَ، وَهِيَ مَدِينَةٌ كَبِيرَةٌ حَسَنَةٌ، مُحِيطٌ بِهَا الْوَادِي، وَلِذٰلِكَ سُمِّيَتْ جَزِيرَةً، وَأَكْثَرُهَا خَرَابٌ.|translation='''Journeying on''', we halted at a village called al-Muwailiha, and from there alighted at Jazirat Ibn ‘Omar, a large and beautiful city surrounded by the river [Tigris], which is the reason why it is called Jazira [‘island’]. The greater part of it is in ruins.|footer=Translated by [[w:en:H. A. R. Gibb|H. A. R. Gibb]]}}
# to [[emigrate]]
#: {{syn|ar|هَاجَرَ}}
# {{lb|ar|euphemistic}} to [[die]]

