* {{R:ar:Müller:1887|page=27}}
* {{cite-book|series=Islamic History and Civilization. Studies and Texts|seriesvolume=136/1|title=Roads to Paradise. Eschatology and Concepts of the Hereafter in Islam|editors=Sebastian Günther and Todd Lawson|chapter=Delights in Paradise: A Comparative Survey of Heavenly Food and Drink in the Quran|last=Qian|first=Ailin|isbn=978-90-04-33313-0|location=Leiden, Boston|publisher=Brill|page=256|year=2017}}

