===Etymology 1===
Surely borrowed, considered even by the medievals as from {{bor|ar|fa|رَخْت|tr=raxt}}. Though the term be explainable from an {{noncog|arc|-}} descendant of {{noncog|sem-pro|*raḥat-|t=flat inner of the hand}} used transferredly for various flat tools, had the Arabic been borrowed directly thence it would probably have become {{m|ar||**رَحْت}}.

====Noun====
