===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|رُزْدَاق|رُسْدَاق|رُزْتَاق}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|pal||tr=lwstʾk'|ts=rōstāg|sc=Phlv}}, whence {{cog|fa-cls|روستا|tr=rōstā}}.

===Pronunciation===
