===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|رَصَّ|t=to stick firmly, to join compactly, to make even or level, to file, to pile, to close}}. Apparently extended its meaning in a {{sl|ar|xpr||*arčīč|nocap=1}} cognate to {{cog|axm|արճիճ|t=lead}}.{{ar-rootbox|ر ص ص}}

===Pronunciation===
