* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|page=192b}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=1|page=923b–924a}}
* {{R:ar:Steingass|page=434b}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=500a}}

{{C|ar|Burial}}
