Page 9636 رمضان: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ر م ض}}

===Etymology===
The month was a summer month in pre-Islamic times before the Quranic prohibition against leap months (Quran 9:37). Hence without doubt from the root {{ar-root|ر م ض}}, and related to {{m|ar|رَمَض|t=parchedness, scorchedness}} and {{m|ar|رَمْضَاء|t=sun-baked ground}}. Compare also {{m|ar|اِرْتَمَضَ|t=to be consumed by grief and sorrow}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|رَمَضَان}}
** {{IPA|ary|/ram.dˤaːn/|/rum.dˤaːn/|a=Moroccan}}
* {{rhymes|ar|aːn|s=3}}

