* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|page=198}}
* {{R:sem-srb:Sima:2000|pages=276–277}}
* {{R:CAL|nrdyn|N}}
* {{R:Strong's|H|5373}}

{{C|ar|Laurel family plants|Artemisias}}

