|ref=https://quran.com/at-tariq/17
}}

===Verb===
{{head|ar|verb|head=رُوَيْدًا}}

# {{lb|ar|defective|transitive}} act [[slowly]], [[gently]], [[leisurely]] towards!
#: {{ux|ar|'''رُوَيْدًا''' زَيْدًا فَإِنَّهُ فَقِيرٌ!|'''Act gently towards''' Zeyd for he is poor!}}
#: {{ux|ar|'''رُوَيْدَ'''كَ!|Take it easy!}}

====Usage notes====
The verb is [[defective]] and does not conjugate or receive case endings; it is used the same way with the same final vowels in all contexts.

