===Etymology===
From the causative element {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ša-}}, {{m|sem-pro|*š-}} (which is to wit found in Arabic in the [[Appendix:Arabic nominals#Elative adjectives|elative]] and the verb {{ar-form|IV|nocap=1}} weakened to the glottal stop and zero (like the conjunction {{m|ar|إِن}}) and as expected {{m|ar|س}} in the verb {{ar-form|X|nocap=1}}) assimilated to the root {{ar-root|ج|ر|ي}}, which also happened in {{ar-root|ز ج ل|nocat=1}} and with a different root e.g. {{ar-root|س و ي|nocat=1}}.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

