===Etymology===
{{root|ar|ine-pro|*gʷeyh₃-}}
From {{bor|ar|syc|ܙܝܘܓ|tr=zīwag}}, from a hypothetical {{der|ar|pal||tr=*zywk'|ts=zīwag|t=mercury}}, whence also {{cog|fa|ژیوه|tr=žive}}. From {{bor|ar|pal||tr=zy(w)ndk'|ts=zīndag, zīwandāg, zībandāg|t=living}}, from {{l|pal||tr=zyw|ts=*zīwa-,*zība-|t=live}}, from {{der|ar|peo|𐎪𐎡𐎺|ts=jīva}}, from {{der|ar|ine-pro|*gʷih₃wós}}. For the sense development compare {{noncog|en|quick}} and {{m|en|quicksilver}}. Akin to {{cog|xcl|սնդիկ}}, {{cog|axm|ժիպակ}}, Iranian borrowings.

