Page 9874 زرافة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|ar|id=giraffe|bor|syc>ܙܪܝܦܐ>giraffe}}
From {{bor|ar|syc|ܙܪܝܦܐ|tr=zārīp̄ā}}, variant of {{m|syc|ܙܪܢܦܐ|tr=zarnāp̄ā}}; ultimately from {{der|ar|fa-cls|زُرنَاپَا|tr=zurnāpā}}, a compound of {{m|fa-cls|زُرنَا|tr=zurnā||flute, zurna}} and {{m|fa-cls|پَا|tr=pā||leg}}.

Not a cognate of {{noncog|gez|ዘራት}}, {{m|gez|ዛራት}}, {{noncog|tig|ዝዖታ}}, {{noncog|ti|ዝዖታ}}, {{cog|byn|ድዖታ|tr=dəʿṓtā}}, {{cog|ssy|ዞዖታ|tr=zoʿṓtā|sc=Ethi}}, {{cog|am|ጅራተ ቀጭን|lit=thin-tail|tr=ǧəratä ḳäč̣č̣ən}}, {{cog|so|geri}}, {{cog|ssy|ገረ|tr=garā|sc=Ethi}}, {{cog|aa|garaa}}, {{cog|xan|jeraa}}, all meaning “giraffe” and referring to its remarkable “tail”, {{cog|am|ጅራት}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|زَرَافَة|زُرَافَة}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زَرَافَة|head2=زُرَافَة|f|pl=زَرَافَى|pl2=زُرَافَى|pl3=زَرَائِف|pl4=زَرَاف}}

# [[giraffe]] {{gl|mammal}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زَرَافَة|head2=زُرَافَة|pl=زَرَافَى|pl2=زُرَافَى|pl3=زَرَائِف|pl4=زَرَاف}}

=====Descendants=====
{{top2}}
