* {{desctree|it|giraffa|bor=1}}
* {{desc|es|azorafa|bor=1}}
* {{desc|scn|zirafa|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tig|ዘራፍ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ti|ዘራፍ|bor=1}}
{{bottom}}

===Etymology 2===
From the concept of a {{l|en|giraffe}} being an amalgam of several animals jointly; compare {{noncog|fa|شترگاوپلنگ|tr=šotorgâvpalang||giraffe|lit=camel-ox-leopard}} and {{noncog|grc|καμηλοπάρδαλῐς||giraffe}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زَرَافَة|f|pl=زَرَافَات}}

# [[group]] of people, [[cluster]] of people, [[body]] of people
#: {{coi|ar|'''زَرَافَاتٍ''' وَ{{ZWNJ}}وُحْدَانًا|[[jointly]] and [[severally]]; in groups and alone}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زَرَافَة|pl=زَرَافَات}}

===References===
