===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|زَرْجُون}}

===Etymology 1===

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زَرْجُون|m}}

# {{alternative form of|ar|زَرْقُون|t=minium; zircon|nocap=1}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زَرْجُون}}

===Etymology 2===
Identical to {{cog|jpa|זרגונה|tr=zargōnā}},  {{cog|tmr|זרגונא|tr=zargōnā}}, {{cog|syc|ܙܪܓܘܢܐ|tr=zargōnā}}, {{cog|he|זרגון|tr=zargōn}}, also meaning vine shoots, which could be considered to contain the {{cog|sem-nwe|-}} diminutive suffix ''-ōna'', comparing {{cog|he|זרדים|t=young sprouts, shoots; hawthorn ({{taxfmt|Crataegus monogyna|species}}); whitethorn ({{taxfmt|Crataegus azarolus|species}}) and its shoots}} and {{m|ar|زَعْرُور|t=thorn-apple (''[[Crataegus]]'')}}, but the term most likely passed via {{bor|ar|arc|-}} from {{der|ar|pal||tr=zargōn|lit=gold-coloured}} whence {{cog|fa|زرگون|tr=zargôn|t=gold-coloured}}, a {{doublet|ar|nocap=1}} of which is also present in {{m|ar|مَازَرْيُون|t=spurge-olive (''[[Daphne mezereum]]'')}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|زَرْجُون|m|sing=زَرْجُونَة}}

# [[shoot]]s of a [[grapevine]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|زَرْجُون}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زَرْجُون|m}}

# clear water that [[stagnate]]s in a mountain

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زَرْجُون}}

=====Further reading=====
* {{R:CAL|zrgwn|N}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=1|page=69}}

