===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|ar|falc}}
Akin to {{cog|fa|جره باز|tr=jorra bâz}}, {{cog|axm|ճուռակ}}, {{cog|gkm|τζουράκιον}}<!--found in Orneosophion II S. 578.26-30 Hercher--> also meaning falcons.<ref>{{R:xcl:AG|page=190}}</ref> Possibly also the source of {{m|ar|زَارُوك}}, denoting a kind of [[dhow]] of about 20 metres in length and 4 to 6 m across the beam used until the 1970s for trafficking.<ref>{{R:ar:Agius|Life|pages=89–90}}</ref>

