Page 9906 زعزع: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the {{ar-reduplicated|lc=1}} root {{ar-root|ز ع ز ع}}, whence also the intransitive form {{m|ar|تَزَعْزَعَ}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|זעזע}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|زَعْزَعَ}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[shake]]
#: {{syn|ar|هَزَّ}}
## to [[shake]] physically, to [[move]] fast and violently
##: {{ux|ar|'''زَعْزَعَتِ''' ٱلرِّيحُ ٱلْأَوْرَاقَ|The wind '''shook''' the leaves.}}
## to [[shake]] emotionally; to [[excite]]
##: {{ux|ar|'''زَعْزَعَتِ''' ٱلْخُطْبَةُ ٱلْبَلَدَ كُلَّهُ|The sermon '''shook''' the whole country.}}
## {{lb|ar|of someone's beliefs, convictions, ideologies, and the like}} to [[shake]], to [[unsettle]], to [[weaken]], to [[undermine]]; to make seem [[doubtful]] or [[uncertain]]
## to [[destabilize]]
##: {{ux|ar|'''زَعْزَعَتْ''' حَرْبُ تَحْرِيرِ ٱلْجَزَائِرِ ٱسْتِقْرَارَ فَرَنْسَا|The Algerian Liberation War '''shook''' the stability of (destabilised) France.}}
## to [[agitate]], [[shock]] or [[horrify]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|Iq}}
-------- end text --------
