Page 9908 زعفران: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|צפר}} with [[Appendix:Aramaic terms only attested in borrowings|unattested]] ''-ān'' ending, compare {{m|ar|زَعْتَر|t=wild thyme}} and juxtapose {{m|ar|عُصْفُر}} for a native form from {{m|ar|أَصْفَر|t=yellow}} of the root {{ar-root|ص ف ر|nocat=1}}.

A {{bor|ar|ira-mid|}} borrowing is also maintained, which invites comparison with {{cog|fa|جعفری|tr=ja'fari|t=parsley}}.

