===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ز|ف|ر}}. Possibly related to the Greek word {{l|grc|Ζέφυρος|t=west wind}}, which is also the origin of the English word {{l|en|zephyr|t=light breeze}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|زَفِير|m|pl=أَزْفَار}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|زَفَرَ|form=I}}
