Page 9929 زق: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Roncevaux Gourde de vin en peau ex-voto.JPG|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|زِقّ}}|upright=0.72]]

===Etymology 1===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|זִיקָּא|tr=zīqā}} / {{m|syc|ܙܸܩܵܐ|tr=zeqqā}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|زِقّ}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زِقّ|m|pl=أَزْقَاق|pl2=زِقَاق|pl3=زُقَّان|pl4=أَزُقّ}}

# [[wineskin]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=[[w:Abu Nuwas|Abū Nuwās]]|title=[[s:ar:طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى واصْطبحْ|{{lang|ar|طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى واصْطبحْ}}]]|year=c. 800|passage=طَرِبَ الشيْخُ فغنّى، واصْطبحْ<br/>من عُقارٍ تُنهبُ الهمّ الفَرَحْ<br/>أخَذتْ من كلّ شيءٍ لَوْنَهــا،<br/>هي في ناجودها قوْسُ قُزَحْ<br/>شيْخُ لذّاتٍ، نقِيٌّ عِرْضُهُ،<br/>تحْسُنُ الأشعارُ فيه، والمِدَحْ.<br/>لا تراهُ الدّهْرُ إلاّ ثَمِلاً،<br/>بينَ إبْريقٍ، و'''زِقٍّ'''، وقدَحْ|t=The shaykh gleed and sang and craved more booze<br/>forthy delight removes the sorrow.<br/>He obtained from every thing its hues<br/>and his cup exposed a rainbow.<br/>Shaykh of bliss, no way blammed,<br/>The notes of him are merry, fele to plaud,<br/>Fate sees him not but slammed,<br/>betwixe ewer and '''wineskin''', beaker-pawed.|tr=ṭariba aš-šayḵu fa-ġannā, wa-iṣṭabaḥ<br/>min ʿuqārin tunhabu l-hamma l-faraḥ<br/>ʾaḵaḏat min kulli šayʾin lawna-hā<br/>hiya fī nājūdi-hā qawsu quzaḥ.<br/>šayḵu laḏḏātin, naqiyyun irḍu-hū<br/>taḥsunu al-ʾašʿāru fī-hi, wa-l-midaḥ,<br/>la tarā-hu ad-dahru illā ṯamilan,<br/>bayna ʾibrīqin, wa-'''ziqqin''', wa-qadaḥ.<br/>}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زِقّ|pl=أَزْقَاق|pl2=زِقَاق|pl3=زُقَّان|pl4=أَزُقّ}}

