Page 9962 زمج: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|زُمَّج}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|ar|pal||*zumag}}, compare {{cog|chg|زمج|tr=zummaj|t=[[steppe eagle]], {{taxfmt|Aquila nipalensis|species}}}} known from the {{w|Baburnama|Bāburnāma}} and metathetical {{cog|hi|जुमिज़|t=[[steppe eagle]], {{taxfmt|Aquila nipalensis|species}}; [[eastern imperial eagle]], {{taxfmt|Aquila heliaca|species}}}} and {{cog|syc|ܙܘܡܐ|tr=zūmā, zaumā}} without the suffix from {{cog|pal|*zum}}. {{cog|fa-cls|زمنج||tr=zimunj, ziminj}}, {{m|fa|زمچ|tr=zimič}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زُمَّج|m|pl=زَمَامِج|head2=زُمْج|head3=زَمَج}}

# {{lb|ar|obsolete}}{{C|ar|Eagles}} [[steppe eagle]], {{taxfmt|Aquila nipalensis|species}}
#* {{RQ:Qazwiniy:1849|I|pages=415–416}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زُمَّج|pl=زَمَامِج}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|ar|pal||*zamag}}, compare {{cog|fa-cls|زمه|tr=zama|t=vitriol, alum}}, {{m|fa-cls|زنج|tr=zunj, zanj, zinj|t=resin; chin = {{m|fa|زنخ|tr=zanax}}}}. {{doublet|ar|زَاج|t1=vitriol|صَمْغ|t2=resin}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|زُمَّج|m|head2=زَمَج|head3=زَمْج}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# [[gum arabic]]
# [[raisin]]s

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|زُمَّج|head2=زَمَج|head3=زَمْج}}

