#* {{RQ:Qur'an|17:81
|passage=وُقُلْ جَاءَ الْحَقُّ وَ'''زَهَقَ''' الْبَاطِلُ إِنَّ الْبَاطِلَ كَانَ '''زَهُوقًا'''
|translation=And say, "Truth has come, and falsehood has '''departed'''. Indeed is falsehood, [by nature], ever '''bound to depart'''.
|transliteration=jāʾa l-ḥaqqu wa-'''zahaqa''' l-bāṭilu ʾinna l-bāṭila kāna '''zahūqan'''}}
# {{lb|ar|post-classical}} to be or become [[bored]] of or with (something); to [[weary]] or [[tire]] of (something) {{+obj|ar|:مِن}}
#: {{syn|ar|مَلَّ|سَئِمَ}}

