# {{lb|ar|law}} [[thief]], [[robber]], [[stealer]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|5|38|passage='''وَٱلسَّارِقُ''' وَٱلسَّارِقَةُ فَٱقۡطَعُوٓاْ أَيۡدِيَهُمَا جَزَآءَۢ بِمَا كَسَبَا نَكَٰلٗا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٞ|t=The '''male thief''' and the female thief, amputate their hands in recompense for what they committed as a deterrent from Allah. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.}}

