Page 10192 ساف: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|سَوْفَ|pos=future tense marker}}.

According to ''Dictionnaire du faisceau dialectal arabe andalou'' the bird-name from an {{bor|ar|egy|-}} compound term the second part of which is found in {{cog|cop|ϣⲁϥ|t=desert, wasteland}}; the bird-spotter’s observations motivating him to name the animal by the future marker, or secondarily by the terms derived from it, are left to speculation.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|verb}} {{ar-IPA|سَافَ}}
* {{sense|noun}} {{ar-IPA|سَاف}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:سَوْف}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# to [[smell]], to [[explore]] by [[odour]]
# to [[hunt]]
# to [[endure]] with [[patience]] {{+obj|ar|:عَلَى}}
# to [[perish]], to [[die]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.vn:سَوْف}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سَاف|m|pl=سَافَات|pl2=سِيفَان}}

# {{C|ar|Birds of prey}} {{lb|ar|Tunisia|Algeria|Morocco|al-Andalus}} [[sparrowhawk]]
#* {{quote-web|ar|title=ar:مهرجان «الساف» يضع بلدة الهوارية التونسية المغمورة تحت الأضواء|url=http://www.alriyadh.com/538060|work=Ar-Riyāḍ|date=2010-06-25}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَاف|pl=sfp|pl2=سِيفَان}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سَاف|m|pl=سَافَات|pl2=آسُف}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# [[layer]], [[row]], [[series]]
#* {{RQ:Ibn Tilmidh:2007|page=136 Nr. 290|passage=يؤخذ سمسم مقشور مخلوع غير مقلى مجفف ويجعل في كيس كرباس جديد '''ساف''' سمسم و'''ساف''' زهر بنفسج منقى مقطوع الساق غير مبلول لا كثير التندية فيعفن ولا قليلها بل متوسط|t=Take properly peeled unroasted dried sesame, put a '''layer''' of it into a new bag of cotton, and (another) '''layer''' of clean stalkless unrinsed violet flowers which do not (contain too) much natural) moisture—then they become mouldy—and not (too) little but rather in between;}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَاف|pl=سَافَات|pl2=آسُف}}

===References===
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=673}}
* {{R:ar:Colin:1931b|instead=1|page=28}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=1469c}}
-------- end text --------
