* {{desc|mt|siefer}}
* {{desc|sw|safiri|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
Not relating to meanings from the root {{ar-root|س ف ر|nocat=1}} but terminology of the religious sphere borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|סִפְרָא|tr=sip̱rā|t=writing, book}} / {{m|syc|ܣܷܦܪܴܐ|tr=sep̱rā|t=writing, book}}; and compare {{cog|he|סֵפֶר|tr=sēp̄er|t=writing, book}} and {{m|he|סוֹפֵר|tr=sofér|t=writer}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَافِرٌ|m|pl=سَفَرَة}}

# [[writer]]
#: {{syn|ar|كَاتِب|tr=kātib}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|80:15-16
|passage=بِأَيْدِي '''سَفَرَةٍ''' كِرَامٍ بَرَرَةٍ
|translation=In the hands of '''scribes''', noble and dutiful.
|subst=بِأَيْدِي/بِ-أَيْدِي}}

-------- end text --------
