===Etymology 1.1===
{{ar-rootbox|س ب ر}}
From {{bor|ar|arc|סְבַר|tr=sḇar}} in a very narrow meaning, apparently only back-formed from {{m|ar|سِبَار}}, {{m|ar|مِسْبَار}}, {{m|ar|مِسْبَر|t=probe}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَبَرَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u,i.pass.vn:سَبْر}} {{tlb|ar|transitive}}

# to [[probe]] into (a hole, like a well) so as to [[measure]] its [[depth]]; to [[gauge]]; to [[sound]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَاسَ}}
## {{lb|ar|figurative}} to [[probe]] into (someone) as if [[measure|measuring]] him; to [[gauge]]; to [[sound]]; to [[judge]]; to [[weigh up]]

