===Etymology 1.3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَبْر|سِبْر}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَبْر|head2=سِبْر|m|pl=أَسْبَار}} {{lb|ar|countable}}

# [[measure]], [[habit]], [[form]], [[appearance]], [[garb]], [[feature]]s, [[likeness]], [[mien]]
#: {{syn|ar|هَيْئَة|صُورَة}}
