#: {{coordinate terms|ar|حَفِيد}}
# [[grandchild]]
#: {{syn|ar|حَفِيد}}
# [[tribe]] of the [[Israelite]]s
# [[Shia]] [[imam]] {{qualifier|grandchild of the prophet}}
