===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|ms|سومڤيتن}} / {{m|ms|sumpitan|t=blowpipe}}, derived from {{der|ar|ms|سومڤيت}} / {{m|ms|sumpit|t=blowpipe}}, matched to the Arabic root {{ar-root|س ب ط}} “related to slenderness, lankness”. Also passed into {{cog|fa|زبطانه|tr=zabatâne}}, {{m|fa|زربطانه|tr=zarbatâne}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|سَبَطَانَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سَبَطَانَة|f|pl=سَبَطَانَات}}

# {{lb|ar|weapons}} [[blowpipe]]
# {{lb|ar|firearms}} [[barrel]], [[pipe]]

