Page 10286 سبيدج: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|صَبِّيدَج|سَبِّيط}}

===Etymology===
Since, often, calamar on a plate or in its natural habitat appears white, it is probably the same word as {{m|ar|سِبِيدَاج|t=white lead}}. Compare the repurposing of {{m|ar|كَرْكَنْد|t=ruby spinel}} for “lobster”.

