Page 10297 ستر: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{ar-root|س ت ر}}. Compare {{cog|he|סֵתֶר|t=hiddenness; secrecy}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:سَتْر}}

# to [[cover]], to [[hide]], to [[screen]]; to [[veil]]
# to [[protect]], to [[shield]], to [[guard]], to [[safeguard]]; to [[shelter]]
#: {{synonyms|ar|صَانَ|وَقَى}}
