Page 10358 سدر: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Blinded by the sun (18204667721).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|سَدَارَة}}|upright=1.5]]

===Etymology 1===
Sense of letting go cognate with {{cog|he|שִׁדֵּר|tr=shidér|t=to send, to dispatch, to broadcast}} via {{der|ar|tmr|-}} root {{m|arc|ש־ד־ר||to send|sc=Hebr}}

{{ar-rootbox|س د ر}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَدِرَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.ipass?.vn:سَدَر,سَدَارَة}}

# to be [[dazzle]]d, to be [[blind]]ed, to have [[vision]] [[block]]ed
#* {{quote-book|ar|author={{w|Al-Akhtal al-Taghlibi|al-ʾaḵṭal at-taġlibī}}|title={{lang|ar|[[s:ar:ألا سائلِ الجحافَ هل هو ثائرٌ|ألا سائل الجحاف هل هو ثائر]]}}|year=c. 700
|passage=يصولُ بمَجْرٍ لَيْسَ يُحْصى عديدُه<br/>ويَسْدَرُ مِنْهُ، ساجِياً، كلُّ ناظِرِ
|translation=He encroaches numerously in a number that cannot be counted<br/>And every beholder is silent and dazzled by him.}}
# to be [[careless]], to be [[regardless]], to be [[reckless]]
# to [[let go]], to [[exert]]
# to hung down, to [[descend]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.ipass?.vn:سَدَر,سَدَارَة}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَدَر|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|سَدِرَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَدَر|m}}

[[File:Ziziphus spina-christi 02.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|سِدْر}} – {{taxlink|Ziziphus spina-christi|species}}]]
{{slim-wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology 2===
From the root {{ar-root|س|د|ر}} meaning “to obscure or block vision”, “to make an area inaccessible or blocked”; originally applied variously to lofty trees associated with shade.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سِدْر}}

====Noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|سِدْر|sing=سِدْرَة|pl=سُدُور|pl2=سِدَر|pauc=سِدَرَات}}

# [[buckthorn]], trees of the genus {{taxfmt|Ziziphus|genus}}
#: {{syn|ar|نَبَق}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|56:28-29
|passage=فِي سِدْرٍ مَّخْضُودٍ وَطَلْحٍ مَّنْضُودٍ
|translation=[They will be] among buckthorn trees with thorns removed and vachellia trees layered [with fruit]}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|سِدْر|pl=سُدُور|pl2=سِدَر|pauc=سِدَرَات}}

=====Descendants=====
