Page 10470 سفري: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{wp|lang=ar}}
{{ar-etym-nisba|سَفَر|t=travel, journey}}.

====Adjective====
{{ar-nisba|سَفَرِيّ}}

# [[takeout]], [[to go]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَفَرِيّ}}

===Etymology 2===
{{m|ar||مُعَاوِيَة بْنِ صَالِح|tr=muʕāwiya bni ṣāliḥ}}, chief judge of Córdoba, brought to his home city the pomegranate from Damascus and presented it to {{w|Abd al-Rahman I|ʿAbd ar-Raḥmān I}}, following which the [[courtier]] {{m|ar||سَفَر بْنِ عُبَيْد}} took a cutting and propagated the crop from it on his estate in the Province Rayya ({{l|ar||كُورَة رَيّة|tr=kūrat rayya}}, now {{w|Province of Málaga}}, but its capital then was {{w|Archidona}}), so that by the [[founder effect]] one had a new [[variety]] named after him.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَفَرِيّ|m}}

# {{cln|ar|taxonomic eponyms}}{{C|ar|Myrtales order plants}} {{tlb|ar|al-Andalus|mountainous|_|Morocco}} {{n-g|a [[cultivar]] of [[pomegranate]]}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَفَرِيّ}}

