* {{desc|bor=1|es|zafarí|zaharí|zajarí|jaharí|zaharillo|azaharillo|zajarillo}} {{q|Western Andalucía, obsolete}}
* {{desc|bor=1|syl|ꠢꠚꠞꠤ|tr=hofri}}, {{l|syl|ꠡꠚꠞꠤ|tr=śofri}}

