Page 10472 سفط: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|س ف ط}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.vn:سَفَاطَة}} {{tlb|ar|archaic}}

# to be [[gleeful]], to [[bliss]], to be free of [[straitness]] in mind, to be [[liberal]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.vn:سَفَاطَة}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}} {{tlb|ar|archaic}}

# to [[loam]], to [[besmear]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===Etymology 2===
Interrelated with the roots {{ar-root|ش|ف|ط}}, {{ar-root|س|ف|ف}} and {{ar-root|ش|ف|ف}} meaning "to take something into one's mouth", "to lick up"; "to render lean or emaciate", "to leave emptied or exhausted"; both roots feature the meaning "to drink up much water". The /[[ط]]/ is perhaps a dialectal variant of verb form VIII {{m|ar|إشْتَفَّ|tr=|t=to drink all that is in a vessel, drinking to last drop, to drink without satisfying thirst; to die, to be drained of one's measure of life}}.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:سَفْط}}

# to [[suck]] or [[drink]] up
# to [[drink]] up entirely, to [[chug]], to [[empty]]
# to [[absorb]]
# to [[remove]] excess, to [[drain]] away, to [[siphon]] off
# to [[descale]]
# {{lb|ar|medicine}} to [[aspirate]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.vn:سَفْط}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَفْط|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|سَفَطَ|form=I}}
## [[descaling]]
## {{lb|ar|medicine}} [[aspiration]], [[suction]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَفْط}}

===Etymology 3===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|סַפְטָא}} / {{m|syc|ܣܰܦܛܳܐ|tr=sap̄əṭā}}, from {{der|ar|pal|-}} equivalent to {{cog|fa|سپت|tr=sapat}} now {{m|fa|سبد|tr=sabad}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَفَط|m|pl=أَسْفَاط}}

# [[basket]], [[frail]], [[scuttle]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 675|author={{w|Hasan ibn Thabit|Ḥasan ibn Ṯābit}}|title=[[s:ar:ألاَ دَفَنْتُمْ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ في سَفَطٍ|{{lang|ar|ألا دفنتم رسول الله في سفط}}]]|passage=أَلَا دَفَنْتُم رَسُولَ اللّٰهِ فِي سَفَطٍ — مِنَ الْأَلُوَّةِ وَٱلكَافُورِ مَنْضُودِ|t=Verily you buried God’s prophet in a basket – layered of aloe and camphorwood!}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَفَط|pl=أَسْفَاط}}

===References===
* {{R:CAL|spT|N}}
* {{R:fa:Dehkhoda|سپت}}
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|pages=79–80}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|page=323}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=1382}}
* {{R:ar:Steingass|page=496}}

