Page 10477 سفندر: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|قَفَنْدَر}}

===Etymology===
A corruption of its epithet {{m|ar|إسكندراني|إِسْكَنْدَرَانِيَّة|lit=Alexandrian}} in the {{bor|ar|grc|-}} name of one species {{m|grc|δάφνη Ἀλεξάνδρεια}}, possibly {{blend|ar|notext=1}} blended with a form of {{bor|ar|fa|اسپرغم|tr=esparğam|t=medicinal herb}}, as in Persian {{taxfmt|Ruscus|genus}} genus and species are now most commonly called {{m|fa|مورد اسفرم|tr=murd esfaram|lit=myrtle-herb}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سَفَنْدَر|m}}

# {{vern|box holly}} ({{taxfmt|Ruscus|genus}} gen. et spp.)

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَفَنْدَر}}

===References===
