* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=2|pages=200–202}}
* {{cite-web|es|work=Dioscórides Interactivo|title=δάφνη Ἀλεξάνδρεια – {{taxlink|Ruscus hypophyllum|species}}|url=https://dioscorides.usal.es/p2.php?numero=719|year={{#time:o}}}}

