===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|arc|סְפינִתָּא}} / {{m|syc|ܣܦܻܝܢܬܳܐ|tr=sǝp̄īntā}}. Forming the root {{ar-root|س ف ن}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|סְפִינָה|tr=sᵊfīnāh}}.

