* {{alter|ar|سُقُطْرَة|أَسْقُطْرَة|أَسْقُطْرَى}}

===Etymology===
In respect of the age of the name, the derivation is not set in stone, but one thinks of {{univerbation|ar|سُوق|t1=market|قَطْرَة|t2=drop|notext=1}}, respectively a corresponding {{bor|ar|sem-osa}} or {{bor|ar|sem-sar}} combination, due to the trading port basing its economy around the plantation of [[aloe]], [[w:Dracaena cinnabari|dragon blood trees]], [[frankincense]] and such [[resin]]s.

