===Etymology 1===
[[File:P1060828 (11929764766).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|سُكَّان}}|upright=1.2]]
From {{bor|ar|pal|sc=Latn|*sukān}}, from {{der|ar|akk|sikkānum|𒄑𒍣𒃶|tr=sikkānu|t=oar, steering paddle, rudder blade}}, from {{der|ar|sux|𒄑𒍣𒃶|tr=zigan|t=oar, steering paddle, rudder blade}}. Compare also {{cog|xpr|swk|tr=suk|t=rudder|sc=Mani}} and {{m|ar|سِكِّين}}.

