===Etymology 1.1===
From the root {{ar-root|س|ك|ن}}. Cognate with {{cog|he|שכן}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَكَنَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:سُكُون}}

# to be [[still]], to be [[tranquil]], to be [[peaceful]]
# to [[calm]] down, to [[repose]], to [[rest]]
# {{lb|ar|grammar}} to be [[vowelless]], to have no [[vowel]]
# to [[abate]], to [[subside]], to [[cease]]
# to [[pass]], to [[go away]], to [[leave]]
# to [[trust]], to have [[faith]], to be [[reassured]]
# to [[feel]] [[at home]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.vn:سُكُون}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:سَكَن,سُكْنَى}}

# to [[live]], to [[reside]], to [[inhabit]] {{qualifier|construed with {{m|ar|فِي}} or {{m|ar|بِ}} or direct object}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أَسْكُنُ فِي ٱلْقَاهِرَةِ|I live in Cairo}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:سَكَن,سُكْنَى}}

====References====
* {{R:ar:Lane}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|سكن}}

===Etymology 1.2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَكَّنَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[calm]], to [[reassure]], to [[appease]], to [[placate]]
# to [[soothe]], to [[allay]], to [[alleviate]]
# to make [[vowelless]], to pronounce without a [[vowel]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===Etymology 1.3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَكَن}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَكَن|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|سَكَنَ|form=I}}
# time for [[rest]], [[means]] for rest
# [[dwelling]], [[abode]], [[habitation]]
# [[inhabited]] area, [[habitations]]
# [[ashes]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَكَن}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|رَمَاد}}

-------- end text --------
