From the root {{ar-root|س ل ط}}. Cognates with {{cog|arc|שׁוּלְטָנָא}} / {{m|syc|ܫܘܼܠܛܵܢܵܐ|tr=šulṭānā||power}} and {{cog|he|שִׁלְטוֹן|tr=shiltón|t=rulership, authority}}.

