Page 10642 سمحاق: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
{{unc|ar}}, perhaps representing the {{der|ar|sem-pro|-}} causative prefix ''ša''- prepended to the root {{ar-root|م ح ق}} related to erasure as it is the outer layer of a bone just below the skin and mechanically attrited for bones to be used, however it must be a Southern dialectal term in origin since that prefix is almost everywhere ''ʾa-'' or at least ''ha-'' in Arabic (while {{bor|ar|sem-sar}} preserves this ''ša''-, albeit with the sound {{IPAchar|/ʃ/}}).

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سِمْحَاق|m|pl=سَمَاحِيق}}

