# [[thickness]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سُمْك}}

===Etymology 3===
From the root {{ar-root|س م ك}}, in the sense of "to be elevated or lofty", "to be supported or held up".

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَمْك|m}}

# [[roof]], [[ceiling]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَمْك}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Lane|pages=1430-1431}}
* {{R:Strong's|H|5564}}
