Page 10682 سن: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|س ن ن}}

===Etymology 1===
Etymologically related to {{m|ar|سن#Etymology 3|tr=sinn|pos=sense 3|t=tooth}}; also compare the letter {{m|ar|ش}}.<ref>{{R:American_Heritage_Dictionary|Sunna}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَنَّ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:سَنّ}}

# to [[sharpen]], to [[whet]], to [[hone]], to [[grind]]
# to [[mold]], to [[shape]], to [[form]]
# to [[prescribe]], to [[introduce]], to [[enact]]
# to [[institute]], to [[establish]] a [[method]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:سَنّ}}

===Etymology 2===
Verbal noun of {{m|ar|سَنَّ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَنّ}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَنّ|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|سَنَّ|form=I}}
# [[prescription]], [[introduction]], [[enactment]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَنّ}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*šinn-}}. Cognate with {{cognate|akk|šinnum|𒅗|tr=šinnum}}, {{cognate|arc|שנא|tr=šinā’}}, {{cognate|gez|ስን}}, and {{cognate|he|שֵׁן|tr=shén}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سِنّ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-سن.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سِنّ|f|pl=أَسْنَان|pl2=أَسِنَّة|pl3=أَسُنّ}}

# [[tooth]], [[tusk]], [[fang]]
#: {{uxi|ar|أُنَظِّفُ أَسْنَانِي|I am brushing my teeth}}
# [[point]] or [[tip]]
# a [[spearhead]] or [[arrowhead]]
# [[age]] {{qualifier|years of life}}
# [[cog]], [[sprocket]], [[prong]]

=====Declension=====
