Page 10683 سن اليأس: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Literally: “age of despair”. Perhaps after [[Quran]] 65:4, where it says: {{m|ar||وَاللّائِي يَئِسْنَ مِنَ الْمَحِيضِ مِن نِسَائِكُمْ|tr=wa-llāʔī yaʔisna mina l-maḥīḍi min nisāʔikum|t=those of your women who have despaired of menstruation”, i.e. “those who will certainly not menstruate again}}.{{rfv-etym|ar}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|[[سِنّ]] الْ[[يَأْسِ]]|f}}

# [[menopause]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|سِنّ:tri|mod=يَأْس:tri|idafa=def}}

====Synonyms====
* {{q|euphemism}} {{l|ar|سِنّ الْأَمَلِ|lit=age of hope}}
