===Etymology===
* From the root {{ar-root|س ب ل}} whence also the {{ar-form|IV|verb form}} {{m|ar|أَسْبَلَ|t=to let down, to let hang out}}.
* Compare {{cog|arc|שבלתא|tr=šebaltā|t=ear}}, {{m|arc|שבלא|tr=šebalā|t=ear}}, {{cog|syc|ܫܶܒܰܠܬܳܐ|tr=šebaltā|t=ear}}, {{m|syc|ܫܶܒܠܳܐ|tr=šebalā|t=ear}}, {{cog|he|שִׁבֹּלֶת|tr=šibbṓleṯ|t=flowing stream; ear}}, {{cog|uga|𐎌𐎁𐎍𐎚|t=ear}}, {{cog|akk|šubultum|𒋗𒁍𒌌𒌈|tr=šubultum|t=ear}}, {{cog|xeb|𒋤𒉺𒂖|tr=SÙ.PA.SIKIL|ts=šabaltum|t=ear}}, {{cog|sem-srb|𐩪𐩨𐩡𐩩|t=ear}}, {{cog|gez|ሰብል|t=ear}}, {{cog|ti|ሰብሊ|t=ear}}, {{cog|am|ሰብል|t=ear|tr=säbəl}}, {{cog|sqt|sebóleh|t=ear}}, {{cog|gdq|seblī́t|t=ear}}, {{cog|shv|simbelót|t=ear}}, {{cog|egy|sꜣbꜣjr|<hiero>Aa18-Z1-b-G29-A-y:r*Z1-Hn-Z2ss</hiero>|tr={{l|egy|sꜣbꜣjr}}|t=shoots, spikes (of fruit trees), grape clusters}}.

===Pronunciation===
