===Noun===
{{wp|lang=ar|سنبل هندي|Nardostachys grandiflora}}
{{ar-coll-noun|سُنْبُل|m|pl=سَنَابِل|sing=سُنْبُلَة}}

# [[ear]], [[spike]] {{q|of a crop}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|2|261|passage=مَثَلُ الَّذِينَ يُنْفِقُونَ أَمْوَالَهُم فِي سَبِيلِ اللّٰهِ كَمَثَلِ حَبَّةٍ أَنْبَتَت سَبْعَ سَنَابِلَ فِي كُلِّ سُنْبُلَةٍ مِئَةُ حَبَّةٍ|t=Those who spend their wealth in the way of God are like a grain which grows seven ears, (and) in each ear a hundred grains|subst=كَمَثَلِ/كَ-مَثَلِ}}
# [[Virgo]] {{q|a star constellation}}
# [[aromatic]] [[plant]] with [[ear]]-forming flowers, [[spikenard]], {{taxfmt|Nardostachys|genus}} spp., ''[[Valeriana]]'' spp., ''[[Hyacinthus]]'' spp. and the like

