===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|pal||*sanbūk|sc=Latn}} whence {{cog|fa-cls|سنبک|tr=sumbuk}}, from {{der|ar|sa|शम्बूक|lit=snail-shell}}, or less likely {{der|ar|ms|sampan}}, from {{der|ar|zh|-}} {{ltc-l|舢板|t=[[sampan]], a wooden boat propelled by two oars}}.<br/>
To be kept apart from the name of the {{m|en|xebec}} / {{m|it|sciabecco}} type of vessel which was used in the Mediterranean and is derived only in the 15<sup>th</sup> century {{tooltip|Common Era|CE}} and later from {{noncog|ar|شُبَّاك}}.

