Page 10702 سنة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*šanat-}}, Compare {{cog|he|שָׁנָה}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سَنَه}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سَنَة|f|pl=سَنَوَات|pl2=سِنُون|pl3=سِنِين}}

# [[year]]
#: {{synonyms|ar|عَام|حَوْل}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|29|14|passage=وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا نُوحًا إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِ فَلَبِثَ فِيهِمْ أَلْفَ '''سَنَةٍ''' إِلَّا خَمْسِينَ عَامًا|t=And verily we sent Noah (as Our messenger) unto his folk, and he continued with them for a thousand years save fifty years}}

=====Usage notes=====
According to Ibn Manzur, some speakers decline the nūn in سِنين, treating it as an irregular plural. Accordingly, the yā' does not change to wāw whence using this form.

