Page 10717 سندروس: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar|سندروس رباعي المصاريع|''Tetraclinis''|mul=سندروس}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|سِنْدَلُوس}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|grc|σανδαράκινος|t=orange-coloured, sandarac-like}} or another masculine formation from {{m|grc|σανδᾰράκη|t=sandarac, realgar}}, compare {{m|ar|خندريس|خَنْدَرُوس}} from {{m|grc|χόνδρος|t=spelt; groats; lump, grumous mass}} and {{m|ar|دند|دَنْدَرُوس}} from {{m|grc|δενδροειδής|t=tree-like}}.

The {{cog|syc|-}} form {{m|syc|ܣܢܕܪܘܣ}} is found in {{w|Bar Bahlul}} and [https://gedsh.bethmardutho.org/entry/Bar-Ali-Isho Bar Ali], while {{cog|tmr|סַנְדּרוֹס|tr=sandarōs}} is found in the {{w|Halachot Gedolot|Ḥalaḵōt Gedōlōṯ}} and {{cog|he-mis|סַנְדּרוֹס|tr=sandarōs}} in the {{w|Book of Assaf}}; the Arabic term can well be considered an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} loan hence, considering also that these lects thereof liked to add a reflex of {{m|grc|-ος}} even when it was never there, e.g. the descendants of {{m|grc|σίγνον}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سَنْدَرُوس|m|head2=سِنْدَرُوس}}

# [[sandarac]]
## the tree {{taxfmt|Tetraclinis articulata|species}}
## the [[resin]] obtained from {{taxfmt|Tetraclinis articulata|species}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|سَنْدَرُوس|head2=سِنْدَرُوس}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bor=1|axm|սանդարօս|սանդարաս|սանտարօս}}
* {{desc|fa|سندروس|tr=sandrus|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|sandarusi|bor=1}}

