Page 10739 سهريز: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|شِهْرِيز|شُهْرِيز}}

===Etymology===
A {{bor|ar|pal|-}} borrowing acquired in {{w|Baṣra}}. {{w|Abu Mansur Mauhub al-Jawaliqi|Al-Jawālīqī}}, in his book about Arabicized terminology, [https://www.google.de/books/edition/Mauhūb_b_Aḥmad_Ibn_al_Ǧawālīqī_s/7yo-AAAAcAAJ?hl=de&gbpv=1&pg=PP98 draws it] to Persian {{m|fa-cls||سُهْر|tr=suhr|t=red}}, which is now {{m|fa|سرخ|tr=surx|t=red}}. He [https://www.google.de/books/edition/Mauhūb_b_Aḥmad_Ibn_al_Ǧawālīqī_s/7yo-AAAAcAAJ?hl=de&gbpv=1&pg=PP94 gives] two apparently Persianate synonyms {{m|ar|سَوَادِيّ}} and  {{m|ar|أَوْتَكِيّ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|سِهْرِيز|سُهْرِيز}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|سِهْرِيز|m|head2=سُهْرِيز}}

