Page 10774 سورة: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Sura23.pdf|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|'''سُورَة'''}}]]
{{slim-wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology 1===
Assigned to the root {{ar-root|س و ر}}. It is not clear from which word it was borrowed, it might be from {{bor|ar|syc|ܫܘܽܪܳܐ|tr=šūrā|t=wall; ''also figuratively for any divider''}}, compare {{m|ar|سُور|t=wall}} from the same word, or from {{bor|ar|syc|ܣܽܘܪܓܳܕܳܐ|tr=sūrgāḏā|t=line; writing}}, or from {{bor|ar|he|סִדְרָה|tr=siḏrā|t=technical term for the section marks in the Hebrew scriptures}}, or from {{bor|ar|he|שִׁיר|tr=šīr|t=lyric song; poem}}, or from a variant vocalization of {{bor|ar|syc|ܣܻܝܪܳܐ|tr=sīrā|t=thread; chapter, topical division of a book}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سُورَة}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سُورَة|f|pl=سُوَر}}

# {{lb|ar|Islam}} [[sura]], [[surah]]
#: {{mer|ar|آيَة}}
#: {{hol|ar|اَلْقُرْآن}}
#: {{hypo|ar|سُورَة مَدَنِيَّة|سُورَة مَكِّيَّة}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|2|23|passage=وَإِنْ كُنْتُمْ فِي رَيْبٍ مِمَّا نَزَّلْنَا عَلَى عَبْدِنَا فَأْتُوا بِ'''سُورَةٍ''' مِنْ مِثْلِهِ وَٱدْعُوا شُهَدَاءَكُمْ مِنْ دُونِ اللهِ إِنْ كُنْتُمْ صَادِقِينَ|t=And if you are in doubt about what We have sent down upon Our Servant [Muhammad], then produce '''a surah''' the like thereof and call upon your witnesses other than Allah, if you should be truthful.|subst=وَإِنْ/وَ-إِنْ,فَأْتُوا/فَ-أْتُوا,بِسُورَةٍ/بِ-سُورَةٍ,وَٱدْعُوا/وَ-ٱدْعُوا}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|سُورَة|pl=سُوَر}}

