* {{l|ar|سَوِيط|t=stirred}}
* {{l|ar|سَوَيْطَاء|t=a soup with much onions and chickpeas}}
* {{l|ar|مِسْوَط|t=an implement to mix}}
* {{l|ar|مِسْوَاط|t=an implement to mix}}

