Page 11071 شارب بول بعير: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Literally: “camel-urine drinker”, based on a [[hadith]] in the Sunni standard collection ''{{w|Sahih al-Bukhari}}'' (''kitāb aṭ-ṭibb'', “the Chapter of Medicine”), where Muhammad reportedly recommends a mixture of camel milk and camel urine as medicine.

