Page 11145 شبرم: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from the {{bor|ar|pal|-}} ancestor of {{cog|fa|شبرم|tr=šebram}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|شَبْرَم}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَبْرَم|m|head2=شُبْرُم}}

