===Etymology===
{{ar-etym-iyya|شَبَكَة|net, grid}} within the root {{ar-root|ش ب ك}}.

The interpretation of the pastry as a kind of latticework,<ref>But so phantasized by {{R:ar:Schwartz:2009|page=9b}} as the original meaning of {{cog|fa-cls|زلیبیا|tr=zalībiyā, zilībiyā}}</ref> though it have a griddy structure, is doubtful, since it would only work as a {{glossary|calque}} of half of the term in {{cog|inc|-}} where there are words for “net” such as {{cog|hi|जाल}}, {{m|hi|जाली}}, {{cog|mr|जाळें}}, {{cog|pa|جال|tr=jāl}}. It may be instead from {{m|ar|شَوْبَك|t=rolling pin}}.

