===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|fa|سرپوش|tr=sarpuš}}, being {{m|fa|سر|tr=sar|t=head}} and {{m|fa|پوش|tr=puš|t=cover}}. Fell into disuse by the [[w:Mamluk Sultanate (Cairo)|Circassian Mamluks]]; not so however the still popular variant {{m|ar|طَرْبُوش}}. Passed also into {{cog|syc|ܣܲܪܦܘܿܫܳܐ|tr=sarp̄ōšā}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|شَرْبُوش}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَرْبُوش|m|pl=شَرَابِيش}} {{tlb|ar|historical}}

