Page 11264 شرشور: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ش|ر|ش|ر}} meaning “to scatter”, “to spread”, “to cut into pieces”, especially said of grass and wheat; so called for its habit of eating waste grain among chaff; compare {{noncog|en|chaffinch}}.

