Page 11265 شرشير: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar|بط بري أزرق الجناحين|شرشير}}

===Etymology===
From the bright blue-grey cap of a male {{m|ar|شُرْشُور|tr=|t=[[w:chaffinch|chaffinch]]}}, likely applied to this bird by semantic comparison to {{noncog|en|teal}}. Alternatively, for its similar largely granivorous diet in winter seasons comparable to the notable habit of chaffinches; see {{m|ar|شُرْشُور|tr=}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَرْشِير|m}}

# {{vern|blue-winged teal}}, {{taxfmt|Anas discors|species}}
# [[common teal]], {{taxfmt|Anas crecca|species}}
#: {{syn|ar|حَذَف شَتَوِيّ}}
# {{alternative form of|ar|شَرْشَر|t=''[[Tribulus]]'' spp.}}

====Declension====
