Page 11320 شطف: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From a merger in Levantine dialects of Galilean {{bor|ar|arc|שְׁטֵף|tr=šṭēp̄|t=to wash}} and {{bor|ar|syc|ܫܛܰܦ|tr=šṭap̄|t=to split}}. Doublet of {{m|ar|شَطَبَ}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:شَطْف}}

# to [[rinse]], to [[flush]]
#* {{quote-web|ar|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171016093838/http://www.baytelmarefa.com/2014/03/Hygiene.html|title=ar: بحث حول النظافة|archivedate=2017-10-16|date=2014-03-19|url=http://www.baytelmarefa.com/2014/03/Hygiene.html|work=Bayt Al-Maʿrafa
|passage=تجنبي قرض أظافرك بأسنانك واهتمي بدعكها بالفرجون والماء والصابون ثم اشطفيها وجففيها جيداً.
|translation=Avoid gnawing your nails with your teeth and take care to scrub them with the brush and the water and the soap and then rinse and dry them well.}}
# to [[scold]], to [[chide]], to [[berate]]
# to [[cut]], to [[chunk]], to [[split]]
# to [[infatuate]], to [[captivate]] with [[passion]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=ʿalīy Kāẓim|date=2020-07-02|title=ar:ألا ليت الحب يعود يوماً|page=5|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=IljuDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA5|publisher=Read Publisher|passage=شطفت باب قلبي<br/>فأعتابك تستحق الطهارة|t=You have captivated the door of my heart<br/>For your doorsteps merit purity}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.vn:شَطْف}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}} {{tlb|ar|rare}}

# to [[rinse]] intensively, to [[flush]] well

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَطْف|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|شَطَفَ|form=I}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَطْف|m}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|شِطْفَة|t=spelk}}, {{l|ar|شُطْفَة|t=chunk; flint of a gun-lock}}
* {{l|ar|شَطَّافَة|t=hand shower}}

