Page 11331 شعبية: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Feminine of {{m|ar|شَعْبِيّ}}, the [[nisba]] adjective of {{m|ar|شَعْب||people, nation, tribe}}.

As a noun, introduced for the top-level administrative division of Gaddafi's Libya in 1995, replacing the earlier ''baladiyya'' ({{m|ar|بَلَدِيَّة}}) system.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|شَعْبِيَّة}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj-fem|شَعْبِيَّة}}

# {{feminine singular of|ar|شَعْبِيّ}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|shabiyah}}
{{ar-noun|شَعْبِيَّة|f|pl=شَعْبِيَّات}}

