Page 11428 شلاق: -------- begin text --------
[[File:CH-NB - Bettler, Arme - Collection Gugelmann - GS-GUGE-BÜCHEL-E-4.tif|thumb|right|{{l|ar||شَحَّاذٌ مَعَ شَلَّاقٍ عَلَى ظَهْرِهِ}}]]

===Etymology===
Has been identified with {{cog|tmr|סַלָּקוּתָא|tr=sallaqūṯā}} which occurs in some obscure context in {{w|Terumot}} 8 from which one can only derive that it is a kind of container. {{der|ar|grc|σάλαξ|t=miner’s sieve}} has been suggested for this word. It has also been related to {{cog|xcl|շալակ}}. Compare also how the meaning “to beg“ of {{m|ar|شَحَذَ}} is suspected to be from {{bor|ar|arc|-}}.

Probably of {{bor|ar|ira}} origin, cognate to {{cog|fa|شالاق|tr=šâlâq|t=rag}}, {{m|fa|جولخ|tr=jôlax|t=mendicant’s woolen cloth; cloth for saddle-bags}}, {{m|fa|جوال|tr=jovâl}}, {{m|fa|گوال|tr=govâl|t=sack}}, {{cog|ar|جُوَالَق|t=sack, bag}}, {{cog|tmr|גְּוָאלְקָא|tr=gwālqā|t=sack}}, {{cog|syc|ܓܘܵܠܩܵܐ|tr=gwālqā|t=sack}}, {{cog|bal||tr=gwaləg|t=flour-sack made of goat-hair}}, {{cog|sdh|گۆوال|t=sack}}, {{cog|ckb|گەوال|t=sack}}, {{cog|os|го́ллаг|t=sack}}, {{cog|ka|გვალაგი}}, {{m|ka|გუალაგი|t=sack}}, {{cog|zza|şelag|t=sack}}, {{cog|sdh|شوول|t=sack}}; compare also the forms at {{cog|ar|جُلّ|t=horse-covering, saddle-cloth}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|شَلَّاق}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَلَّاق|m}}

# [[beggar]]’s [[knapsack]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=c. 1110|author={{w|Al-Hariri of Basra|Al-Ḥarīriyy}} ed. {{w|Antoine Isaac Silvestre de Sacy}}|year_published=1822|location=Paris|chapter=ar:[http://al-hakawati.la.utexas.edu/2012/01/29/%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d9%82%d8%a7%d9%85%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b5%d9%88%d8%b1%d9%8a%d8%a9/ المقامة الصورية]|title=Les séances de Hariri|volume=1|page=330|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/lessancesdehari00unkngoog/page/n355|passage=وَقَد بَذَلَ لَهَا مِنَ الصَّدَاقِ شَلَّاقًا وَعُكّازًا. وَصِقَاعًا وَكُرَّازًا. فَأَنْكَحُوهُ إِنْكَاحَ مِثْلِهِ|t=And he offered for her of dowry a beggar’s knapsack and mendicant’s staff, and a mouth-rag and a drinking-jar. And they gave him off to marriage in such a fashion.|subst=مِثْلِهِ/مِثْلِ-هِي,لَهَا/لَ-هَا,فَأَنْكَحُوهُ/فَ-أَنْكَحُو-هُ,وَعُكّازًا/وَ-عُكّازًا,وَصِقَاعًا/وَ-صِقَاعًا,وَكُرَّازًا/وَ-كُرَّازًا,وَقَد/وَ-قَد}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَلَّاق}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|fa|شلاق|tr=šallâq|bor=1|unc=1}}

