Page 11442 شليل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{ar-rootbox|ش ل ل}}
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|-}}, where {{cog|arc-jla|שְׁלִילָא|tr=šəlīlā|t=embryo}} is reanalyzed from the form of {{cog|arc-jla|שִׁילְיְתָא|tr=šilyəṯā}}, {{m|arc|שִׁילְיָא|tr=šilyā}}, {{cog|tmr|שִׁלְיְיתָא|tr=šilyəṯā}}, {{cog|syc|ܫܠܻܝܬܴܐ|tr=šəlīṯā|t=secundine, membrane covering the foetus}}, words descending in the same manner as Arabic {{doublet|ar|notext=1|سَلًى}}, {{m|ar|سَلًا|t=secundine}} from {{der|ar|sem-pro|*šilyat-|t=fetal membrane}}, perhaps with the Aramaic root of {{m|ar|شِلَّة|t=skein}} as a model: fittingly the variant pattern attested in {{cog|syc|ܫܶܠܳܠܳܐ|tr=šəlālā|t=suture; implication, convoluted situation; stonelet (?); *skein}} is also mirrored by an alternative form of the present word, {{m|ar|شِلَال|id=padding|t=padding under the rear of a saddle}}. {{doublet|ar|سَلِيل|notext=1}} may be the same word borrowed another time earlier.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|شَلِيل}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|شَلِيل|m|pl=أَشِلَّة}}

# [[padding]] under the [[rear]] of a [[camel]]'s or [[horse]]'s [[saddle]]
# [[undergarment]] under a [[coat of mail]]
# remaining [[strain]]s of water in a [[wadi]]
# [[medulla spinalis]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَلِيل|m|pl=أَشِلَّة}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Almaany}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=2|pages=445}}
* {{R:CAL|šlyl|N}}
* {{R:CAL|šlyyh|N}}

{{C|ar|Horse tack|Armor|Bodies of water|Tissues}}
