# {{ellipsis of|ar|nocap=1|إِمَارَةُ جَبَلِ شَمَّرَ|t={{w|Emirate of Jabal Shammar}}, a state derived from the tribe}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَمَّر:di|state=ind-def}}

