===Etymology===
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}
Disputed etymology:
*Stemming from its shape, derived from {{bor|ar|ota|شماندره|tr=şamandara, şamandra, şamandıra|t=buoy}}, hence a {{doublet|ar|nocap=1|شَمَنْدُورَة|t1=buoy}}.
*Alternatively, ultimately from {{der|ar|sux|𒌑𒁁𒁯|tr=šumundar|t=beetroot, red-plant}}, with an uncertain etymological chain, as the {{noncog|akk|𒌑𒁁𒁯}} was likely read ''šumuttu''.
See {{cog|syc|ܨܩܢܕܪ|tr=ṣqndr}}, {{m|syc|ܣܡܰܛܪܳܝܳܐ|tr=səmaṭrāyā}}, {{cog|ku|-}} {{m|kmr|çewender}}, {{m|ckb|چەوەندەر}} with possible connections to {{cog|fa|چغندر|tr=čoğondar}} and the dialect variant {{cog|fa|چندر|tr=čondor}}, or even {{cog|sa|चन्द्र|t=red pearl}}.

