# {{lb|ar|uncountable}} {{ar-verbal noun of|شَهِدَ|form=I}}
# {{lb|ar|law}} [[testimony]], [[witness]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|24|4
|passage=وَٱلَّذِينَ يَرْمُونَ ٱلْمُحْصَنَاتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَأْتُوا بِأَرْبَعَةِ شُهَدَاءَ فَٱجْلِدُوهُمْ ثَمَانِينَ جَلْدَةً وَلَا تَقْبَلُوا لَهُمْ '''شَهَادَةً''' أَبَدًا وَأُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْفَاسِقُونَ
|translation=As for those who accuse chaste women and do not bring four witnesses, strike them eighty lashes, and never accept any '''testimony''' from them after that, and they are transgressors.}}
# [[statement]]
# [[certificate]], [[certification]], [[testimonial]], [[affidavit]]
# [[diploma]]
# {{lb|ar|education}} [[transcript]]
# [[attestation]], [[attest]]
# [[credentials]], [[identification]]
# [[creed]]; [[credo]]
