# to [[testify]], to [[bear witness]], to give [[testimony]], to give [[evidence]]
#: {{ux|ar|شَهِدَ الشَّاهِدُ بِالحَقِّ أَمَامَ القَاضِي.|The witness testified to the truth in front of the judge.}}
