# to [[witness]] (a signature)
# to [[acknowledge]], to [[adjudge]]
<!-- These are only in expressions in Wehr
# to [[swear]] an oath
# to [[notarize]] -->

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.ipass?.vn:شَهَادَة}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|وَشَهِدَ شَاهِدٌ مِنْ أَهْلِهَا}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{ar-root|ش|ه|د}}, uncertain sense, perhaps from likening the [[honeycombs]] to the [[graves]] of [[martyrs]] or the [[swarming]] of [[people]] at such [[shrines]] like [[bees]] swarm around a [[hive]]; see {{mention|ar|مشهد}}. Otherwise from the [[mucus]] that covers a [[fetus]] at [[birth]]; the meaning of birth is extended from the "being around" or "being present" of verb form I.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|شَهْد|m|pl=شِهَاد|head2=شُهْد}}

# [[honey]] ''especially'' still in the [[honeycomb]]
#: {{syn|ar|عَسَل}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|chapter=|title={{lang|fa|{{w|lang=fa|دیوان سعدی}}}}|trans-title=[[divan|Dīwān]] of {{w|Saadi Shirazi|Saʿdī}}|author={{w|Saadi Shirazi|Saʿdī aš-Šīrāzī}}|text=فَكَمْ تُمَرِّرُ عَيْشِي وَأَنْتَ حامِلُ شَهْدٍ|t=And how much you make my life bitter and [although] you are a carrier of honey|year=13th century}}
# [[honeycomb]]
# [[melon]], [[cantaloupe]]
# [[nectar]]
# {{lb|ar|metaphorically}} anything [[pleasant]]
# {{lb|ar|metaphorically|from stickiness}} [[semen]], [[menstruation]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|شَهْد|pl=شِهَاد|head2=شُهْد}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desctree|bor=1|fa|شَهْد|tr=šahd}}

===Etymology 3===

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj-pl|شُهَّد}}

# {{masculine plural of|ar|شَاهِد}}

