===Etymology===
{{bor+|ar|pal|*šīrag}}.{{ref|{{cite-web|url=https://iranicaonline.org/articles/arabic-ii|title=Arabic Language ii. Iranian loanwords in Arabic|site=iranicaonline.org|publisher={{w|Encyclopædia Iranica}}|author=A.Tafażżolī|year=2011}}}} Compare {{cog|fa-cls|شیره|tr=šīra}}.

