===Etymology 2===
Interrelated with the root {{ar-root|ص|ي|د}}, {{bor+|ar|arc-nab|-}} and ultimately from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ṣVd-|t=to take food, to capture game, to fish; hunting and gathering}}, with early alphabetic symbols interpreted as depicting, a plant, a fishing hook or hunting barb, and in Arabian scripts possibly even a stick-figure human crouched in ambush.

