Page 11831 صديد: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ص د د}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|صَدِيد|m}}

# [[pus]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَيْح}}

====Usage notes====
* Many sources make a distinction between {{m|ar||صديد}} for more watery forms of [[exudate]] and {{m|ar||قَيْح}} for pus in the stricter sense. However, the former may cover this sense as well.

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|صَدِيد}}
