Page 11837 صراخة: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Dracunculus2(js).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|صَرَّاخَة}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ص ر خ}}, so called in Spain because one believed that a cry of this plant on {{w|Bonfires of Saint John|St. John’s Day}} indicates death in the same year.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|صَرَّاخَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|صَرَّاخَة|f}}

# {{tlb|ar|Al-Andalus}} [[dragonwort]], {{vern|common dragon}} ({{taxfmt|Dracunculus vulgaris|species}})
#* {{RQ:Awwam|28|13|volume=2|page=316}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|صَرَّاخَة|f}}

===References===
* {{pedia|lang=ar|صراخة}}
* {{R:xaa:Corriente|page=305a}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=1|page=827a}}

{{C|ar|Arum family plants}}
