===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|ar|arc|צִפָּא}} / {{m|arc|צִיפָּא|tr=ṣippā}}, {{m|arc|צִפְּתָא}} / {{m|arc|צִיפְּתָא|tr=sippəṯā}} / {{m|syc|ܨܝܦܬܐ}} / {{m|syc|ܨܶܦ݁ܬ݂ܳܐ|tr=ṣeppəṯā|t=mat}}, suspected to be from {{der|ar|akk|𒍦𒉺𒀀𒌅|tr=ṣip-pa-a-tu|ts=ṣippatu|t=a type of reed}}, or instead {{m|arc|סִפָּא}} / {{m|arc|סִיפָּא|tr=sippā}} / {{m|syc|ܣܷܦܴ݁ܐ|tr=seppā|t=threshold, doorpost}}, alleged to be from {{der|ar|akk|𒈨𒁍|tr=sip-pu|ts=sippu|t=doorsill}} but possibly cognate to it.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|صُفَّة}}

