# {{C|ar|Buildings}} [[vestibule]], [[anteroom]], [[entrance]]-[[room]], [[portico]], an [[elevated]] room over or before an [[edifice]] including a [[mosque]] and even over a [[sepulchre]]
#: {{ux|ar|أَهْلُ الصُّفَّةِ|the [[companions]] of the prophet [[Mohammed]]|inline=t}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=322 line 9|instead=1|lang=ar}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=169 line 9 seq.|instead=1|lang=ar}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=84 line 6|instead=1|lang=ar}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=94 line 6|instead=1|lang=ar}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=449 line 12|instead=1|lang=ar}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|page=130 line 8|instead=1|lang=ar}}
# {{C|ar|Horse tack}} [[seat]] of a [[saddle]]
# a [[small]] [[part]], a [[little]] of
