===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}. Has been compared to {{cog|xcl|շաղեմ|t=to knead or mix e.g. mortar}}, {{m|xcl|շաղախ|t=clay, mud, mortar}}.<ref>{{R:xcl:NHB|շաղախ|vol=II|page=460a}}</ref>

