Page 11945 صلى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ص ل و}}
Cognate with {{cog|gez|ጸለየ|tr=ṣälläyä}}, {{cog|arc|צלא|tr=sa.læ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|صَلَّى}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.III:و.pass.vn:صَلَاة}}

# to [[pray]]
# to [[supplicate]]
## to supplicate [[blessing]] and [[salutation]] (on [[somebody]]) {{construed with|ar|عَلَى|gloss=on}}
##* {{RQ:Qur'an|33|56|passage=يَٰأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ آمَنُوا '''صَلُّوا''' عَلَيْهِ وَسَلِّمُوا تَسْلِيمًا|t=O you who believe, '''supplicate blessing and salutation''' on him and greet [him] the greeting of peace.}}
##* {{RQ:Sunna|muslim|5|341|passage=إِنَّ ٱلْمَلَٰئِكَةَ '''تُصَلِّي''' عَلَىٰ أَحَدِكُمْ مَا دَامَ فِي مَجْلِسِهِ|t=Verily the angels '''supplicate blessing and salutation''' on every single one of you who remains seated in his place [in the mosque even when not praying].}}
### to [[shower]] [[blessing]] and  [[salutation]] (on somebody) {{construed with|ar|عَلَى|gloss=on}}
###: {{ux|ar|'''صَلَّىٰ''' ٱللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ|t=God '''shower blessing and salutation''' on him and his family and grant [them] peace|inline=t}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.III:و.pass.vn:صَلَاة}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|صَلَّىٰ ٱللَّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ|tr=ṣallā llāhu ʕalayhī wa-ʔālihī wa-sallama}}
* {{l|ar|ٱللَّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ|tr=allāhumma ṣalli ʕalā muḥammadin wa-ʔāli muḥammadin}}

=====Related terms=====
