Page 11947 صلى الله عليه وسلم: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|Peace be upon him}}
{{wikipedia|Salawat}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|صَلَّى ٱللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ}}

===Phrase===
{{head|ar|phrase|head=[[صَلَّى]] [[اللهُ]] [[عَلَيْهِ]]  [[وَ]][[سَلَّمَ]]}}

# {{lb|ar|Islam}} God shower [[blessing]] and [[salutation]] upon him and grant him [[peace]]

====Usage notes====
A [[blessing]] commonly used by Muslims after mentioning the name of [[wikipedia:Islam|Islamic]] [[wikipedia:Muhammad|Prophet Muhammad]], rendered in English as [[peace be upon him]].

====Descendants====
* {{desc|az|səllallahu əleyhi və səlləm|bor=1}}
