===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.pass.vn:ضَرْب}}

# to [[strike]], to [[beat]], to [[hit]] {{+obj|ar|acc<someone/something> + :بِ<with something>|:بِ<with something> + :عَلَى<on someone/something>|acc<someone> + :عَلَى<on something, e.g. a body part>}}
