### [[warranty]], [[guarantee]] {{gloss|a written declaration that a certain product will be fixed upon failing or being broken}}
### {{lb|ar|figurative}} [[guarantee]], [[avouchment]]
###* {{quote-journal|1=ar|url=http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509544945664889000/|date=Nov 2 2017|work=Al-Quds|title=ar:مع قرب موعد أول عملية زراعة رأس لإنسان...المخاطر والعواقب|accessdate=3 November 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171102214534/http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509544945664889000/|archivedate=2 November 2017
|passage=وسيجري العملية الجراح الإيطالي سيرجيو كانافيرو، الذي أشار إلى أنه من المتوقع أن تُجرى الجراحة في الربع الأول من 2018، وأكد على ضمان نجاحها، وأعلن عن تعاون جراح صيني آخر معه، هو شياو بينج رن.
|translation=And the Italian surgeon [[w:Sergio Canavero|Sergio Canavero]] will perform the operation who indicated that it is expected that the surgery will take place in the first quarter of 2018, and he affirmed that its good outcome is guaranteed, and he announced the cooperation of another, Chinese surgeon with him, [[w:Xiaoping Ren|Xiao Ping Ren]].}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|ضَمَان|m|pl=ضَمَانَات}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|تَأْمِين}}
-------- end text --------
Page 12169 ضمة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{ar-instance noun}} of the {{ar-form|I}} verb {{m|ar|ضَمَّ|t=to [[embrace]]; to [[gather]]; to [[compress]] the [[lip]]s}}, from the root {{ar-root|ض|م|م}}. When used to describe the vowel [[ـُ|{{lang|ar|ـُ}}]] (''u''), {{m-self|ar|ضَمَّة}} means “an instance of [lip-]rounding”, since ''u'' is the only short vowel in Arabic that is pronounced with [[lip]]-[[rounding]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|ضَمَّة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|ضَمَّة|f|pl=ضَمَّات}}

# an [[embracing]]
# a [[number]] of [[horses]] [[assembled]] from every [[quarter]] for a [[race]]
# {{lb|ar|linguistics|grammar}} [[damma]], [[ḍamma]], the [[diacritic]] in the [[Arabic script]] that represents the [[vowel]] {{IPAchar|/u/}}, appearing as a small curl placed above a letter:&nbsp; {{lang|ar|[[ـُ]]}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|ضَمَّة|pl=ضَمَّات}}

