===Etymology===
From [[Nabataean]] {{m|arc|𐢋}}, from [[Syriac]] {{m|arc|ܛ}}, from [[Aramaic]] {{m|arc|ט‬}}, from [[Imperial Aramaic]] {{m|arc|𐡈}}, from the [[Egyptian]] {{m|arc|𓄤}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|ar|/tˤaːʔ/}}
