Page 12220 ط و ر: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
A variant of {{ar-root|ط ي ر|nocat=1}}, also {{cog|syc|-}} {{syc-root-entry|ܛ|ܘ|ܪ}}, other {{cog|arc|-}} and {{cog|he|ט־ו־ר|tr=ṭ-w-r}}. An {{bor|ar|arc|-}} borrowing into Arabic is also possible, so that that the verbs are denominal from the noun, compare {{m|ar|أَنَى|t=to draw near}} from {{m|ar|آن|t=time}} (from a root related to time that can be traced back to {{cog|sem-pro|-}} as can be seen by {{cog|akk|inu|t=time}}), and the similar semantics behind {{m|ar|تَارَة|t=time}} and {{m|ar|تَوّ|t=knot; instance}}.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

