Page 12223 ط و ق: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
There are no inherited formations or cognates in other {{cog|sem|-}} languages, all is denominal from {{m|ar|طَوْق|t=ring, hoop, collar}}; and here, the uncommon {{ar-form|I|nocap=1}} is derived from the more developed {{ar-form|II|nocap=1}}, the {{ar-form|I|nocap=1}} sense “to be capable of or be able to sustain” developed from the {{ar-form|II|nocap=1}} sense ”to put around the neck, to make bear”.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

