{{ar-conj|II}}

===Etymology 3===
Occurring from the mid-8th century onwards, from {{bor|ar|gkm|τάβλα}}, {{m|grc|τάβλη}}, {{m|grc|τάβλον}}, from {{der|ar|la|tābula}}. {{doublet|ar|طَاوُلَة}}.

