[[File:Good Food Display - NCI Visuals Online.jpg|thumb]]
{{ar-noun|طَعَام|m|pl=أَطْعِمَة}}

# {{lb|ar|countable|uncountable}} [[food]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|2|259|passage=قَالَ بَل لَّبِثْتَ مِائَةَ عَامٍ فَٱنْظُرْ إِلَى '''طَعَامِكَ''' وَشَرَابِكَ لَمْ يَتَسَنَّهْ|t=He said, “Rather, you have remained one hundred years. Look at your '''food''' and your drink; it has not changed with time.”|subst=مِائَةَ/مِئَةَ,فَٱنْظُرْ/فَ-ٱنْظُرْ,وَشَرَابِكَ/وَ-شَرَابِكَ}}
#* {{R:ar:Lévi-Provençal:1934|page=243 (٥١) 12}}
## [[prepared]] [[meal]]
##* {{R:ar:Lévi-Provençal:1934|page=235 (٤٣) 12}}
# {{lb|ar|verbal noun}} [[feeding]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|89|18|passage=وَلَا تَحَاضُّونَ عَلَى '''طَعَامِ''' ٱلْمِسْكِينِ|t=And ye urge not on '''feeding''' the poor.|subst=وَلَا/وَ-لَا}}
# {{lb|ar|countable|uncountable|formerly|_|Ḥijāz|Al-Andalus|now|_|South Tunisia}} [[wheat]]
#* {{R:ar:Lévi-Provençal:1934|page=229 (٣٧) 2}}
#* {{R:ar:Lévi-Provençal:1934|page=242 (٥٠) 15}}
#* {{RQ:Awwam|16|volume=1|page=680|passage=وقيل إن نضح بقدر جرة من ماء الزيتون قدر مائة جرة من ال'''طعام''' لم يفسد ولم تصبه آفة وإن نضح عليه ماء الأفسنتين بقي ولم يفسد.|t=It is said that when a jar of '''wheat''' is dampened with a jar of amurca it does not suffer decay nor damage, and if it is dampened with absinthe water, it stays and does not rot.}}
#: {{syn|ar|قَمْح|حِنْطَة|بُرّ|id3=wheat|غَلَّة}}
# {{lb|ar|countable|uncountable|Ḥaḍramawt}} [[grain]], [[cereal]]

