Page 12399 طفيلي: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}
{{ar-rootbox|ط ف ل}}

===Alternative forms===
• {{alt|ar|مُتَطَفِّل}}

===Etymology===
There are two opinions attributed to Al-Asmaʿi. The first one is that it came from {{desc|ar|طَفَل}} which mean the arrival of night's darkness, as an analogy to the sudden coming of the uninvited person. The second one is that it came from the proper noun {{desc|ar|طُفَيْل}}, a man from Ghatafan tribe who used to be a prominent parasite in Kufa.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|طُفَيْلِيّ}}

