Byform of {{m|ar|طَابَق}}, {{m|ar|طَبَق}}. Everything else in the root {{ar-root|ط و ق}} is denominal from this word. Compare the cognate {{cog|syc|ܛܰܘܩܳܐ|tr=ṭawqā|t=dish}} and {{m|syc|ܛܰܒܩܳܐ|tr=ṭaḇqā|t=dish}}, and {{m|ar|كَوْكَب}} from {{noncog|sem-pro|*kabkab-}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|طَوْق|m|pl=أَطْوَاق}}

# anything that surrounds another thing, [[ring]]-shaped [[border]], [[hoop]], [[headband]], [[necklace]] etc.

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|طَوْق|pl=أَطْوَاق}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|acw|طوق|tr=ṭōg}}
* {{desc|mt|tewq|alts=1}}
* {{desc|bor=1|aii|ܬܘܩܐ|tr=tōqā|ܛܘܩܐ|tr2=ṭūqā}}
* {{desc|kmr|toq|alt=t’oq|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ota|طوق|tr=tavk, tok|bor=1}}
** {{desc|tr|tok}}
* {{desc|fa|طوق|tr=towq|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
From the root {{ar-root|ط و ق}}, {{denominal verb|nocap=1|ar}} from the word above.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to put a [[hoop]], [[ring]], [[collar]] etc. around
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[encircle]], to [[surround]]
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[cramp]], to [[restrict]] that developments come out from the inner of or encroach upon from the outside, to [[lock up]] in its [[artistical]] [[capability|capabilities]] or with [[legal]] [[power]], to [[close off]], to [[cordon off]]<!--beengen z.B. künstlerisch, verzehren, und absperren wie in einer Polizeiabsperrung, Sperrgebiet …-->
# {{lb|ar|ditransitive}} to [[endow]] or to [[emburden]] with {{gloss|also occurring in the idiom {{m|ar||طَوَّقَ [[عنق|عُنْقَ]]هُ بِـ|lit=to put X on the neck of|tr=ṭawwaqa ʕunqa-hū bi}}}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[press]] or to [[embrace]] in a [[good]] [[sense]], to [[hug]], to [[receive]] with open arms so to say, or perhaps to have someone on the [[lap]], even so: {{m|ar||يُطَوِّقُ يَدِي|t=he holds my hand|tr=yuṭawwiqu yad-ī}}
<!-- to [[pack up]], to [[enwrap]] perhaps, or is this a peripheral use of “to surround”? Reverso Context:  إنّي طوّقت هذهِ الهدية بنفسي. -->

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|طَوْق|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|طَاقَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|طَوْق}}

===Etymology 3===

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|طُوق|m|pl=طُوقَات|pl2=أَطْوَاق}}

# {{alt form|ar|طُوغ|t=horsetail}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|طُوق|pl=sfp|pl2=أَطْوَاق}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Toll:1969|pages=144–146}}

{{C|ar|Headwear|Neckwear}}

