Page 12515 طيون: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar|mul=طيون دبق}}

===Etymology===
Looks like an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} cognate of {{m|ar|ظَيَّان}}, however also like exposing an {{der|ar|grc|-}} ending: probably a loan from {{bor|ar|arc|-}}, in view of the attestation of {{cog|syc|ܕܝܢܘܣ|tr=dynws|t=celandine}}, a distortion of {{der|ar|grc|χελιδόνιον}}. Compare the botanically close {{m+|ar|طُبَّاق|t={{taxlink|Dittrichia viscosa|species}}}} having a similar correspondence ''ṭ'' {{IPAchar|/tˀ/}} to ''d'' {{IPAchar|/d/}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|طَيُّون}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|طَيُّون|m}}

# {{taxfmt|Inula|genus}} spp., particularly {{taxlink|Inula viscosa|species}} (now {{taxlink|Dittrichia viscosa|species}})
#* {{quote-web|ar|work=eSyria|url=http://esyria.sy/sites/code/index.php?site=latakia&p=stories&category=misc&filename=201310250840041|date=2013-10-25|title=ar: "الطيون".. معقم طبيعي مجاني }}
#* {{quote-book|ar|title=ar:اسرار الشفاء بالطبيعة|author=ar:هيام محمود رزق; ar:معصومه حسين علامه|year=2016|publisher=ar:دار القلم للطباعة و النشر و التوزيع|location=Bayrūt|pages=44–45|isbn=9953-72-119-X|pageurl=https://www.google.com/books/edition/اسرار_الشفاء_بالطبيعة/u6LyDAAAQBAJ?gbpv=1&dq=&pg=PT45&printsec=frontcover}}

