{{ar-verb|I/a~a.pass.vn:ظَعْن,ظَعَن,ظُعُون}} {{tlb|ar|intransitive|literary}}

# to [[set out]] on a [[journey]]; to [[travel]]; to [[journey]]; to [[fare]]; to [[venture]] [[out]] or [[forth]]
#: {{syn|ar|سَافَرَ|اِرْتَحَلَ}}
#* {{quote-book|ar
|title=ar:المَقَامَة الدِمْيَاطِيَّة
|trans-title=The Damiettan Episode
|author=al-Ḥarīrī
|text=
'''ظَعَنْتُ''' إِلَى دِمْيَاطَ. عَامَ هِياطٍ وَمِيَاطٍ. وَأَنَا يَوْمَئِذٍ مَرْمُوقُ ٱلرَّخَاءِ. مَوْمُوقُ ٱلْإِخَاءِ. أَسْحَبُ مَطَارِفَ ٱلثَّرَاءِ. وَأَجْتَلِي مَعَارِفَ ٱلسَّرَّاءِ.
|t=I '''fared off''' to Damietta, in a year of hurry-scurry, in arresting luxury, and prized fraternity, pulling along the tails of plenty, relishing visages of felicity.}}

