Page 12564 ع: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the Nabataean letter {{m|arc-nab|𐢗|tr=ʿ|t=ʿayn}}, derived from the {{der|ar|phn|-}} letter {{m|phn|𐤏|tr=ʿ|t=ʿayn}}, from the {{der|ar|egy|-}} hieroglyph {{m|egy|𓁹 }}. See also {{m+|syc|ܥ|tr=ʿ|t=ʿe}}, {{m+|he|ע|tr=ʿ|t=ʿayin}}, {{m+|grc|Ο}}, {{m+|la|O}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{ar-IPA|عَيْن}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{ar-IPA|عْ}}

===Letter===
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ع '''/''' ع‍ '''/''' ‍ع‍ '''/''' ‍ع'''|tr=ʕayn}}

# The eighteenth letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. It is preceded by {{l|ar|ظ}} and followed by {{l|ar|غ}}.
# [[Z]], unknown variable.

===Symbol===
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''ع '''/''' ع‍ '''/''' ‍ع‍ '''/''' ‍ع'''|tr=ʕayn}}

# The sixteenth letter in traditional [[abjad]] order, which is used in place of numerals for list numbering ([[abjad numerals]]). It is preceded by {{l|ar|س}} and followed by {{l|ar|ف}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb-form|عِ|I}}

# {{inflection of|ar|وَعَى||2|m|s|actv|impr}}

===See also===
* {{list:Arabic script letters/ar}}
* [[w:Arabic alphabet|Wikipedia article on the Arabic alphabet]]
* [[Special:Allpages/ع|Search for entries beginning with {{lang|ar|ع}}]]

[[Category:Abjad numerals|2-70]]

