===Etymology===
The meanings “to stay, to bide” of the Arabic root {{ar-root|ع د ن}} appear to be denominal from the due date and spatial meanings of {{m|ar|عِدَّان}}, to be separated from the significations of “striking sharply”, hence “to manure”, “mine; metal”.

