===Etymology===
Metathesis of {{m|ar|عَفَصَ}}. The forms and ideas of {{m|ar|عُصَافَة|t=chaff}} or refuse of corn in a society that attained agriculture only late are derivative to that of an oakgall {{m|ar|عَفْص}}. Note also {{m|ar|عِنْفَص|t=bung-hole of a waterclock}}. Distantly related to the root {{ar-root|ع ص ر|nocat=1}}.

