===Etymology===
Variant of {{ar-root|غ ب ر|nocat=1}}, while {{ar-root|ع ف ر}} is less common but common in {{cog|he|-}} and {{cog|arc|ע־פ־ר}}. {{cog|gez|-}} has only {{m|gez|አፈር|t=dust}} which is considered a loanword from either Amharic or Hebrew – it is present in {{cog|am|-}}, {{cog|har|-}}, {{cog|sgw|-}}, {{cog|agj|-}}. {{noncog|xsa|𐩲𐩰𐩧}} means “to perform, to do consideration”. From {{der|ar|sem-pro|*ʿapar-|t=soil, dust}}.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

