# [[admirer]], [[lover]], [[adorer]]

====Usage notes====
In many descendants the word has taken on the meaning of “[[ashugh]], mystic bard, balladeer, or troubadour”. This sense developed in Turkic, according to {{xlit|ru|Севортян}} (''apud'' {{xlit|ru|Аникин}}) under the influence of Armenian. According to Asatryan, the term is of [[Sufi]] origin.

