Page 12911 عبر: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ع ب ر}}

===Etymology 1===
From the root {{ar-root|ع ب ر}}. Compare {{cog|he|עָבַר|tr=ʿāḇar|t=to cross}}, {{cog|sem-srb|𐩲𐩨𐩧|t=to transgress}}, {{cog|akk|𒁄|tr=ebēru|t=to cross}}.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:عَبْر,عُبُور}}

# to [[cross]], to [[traverse]]
# to [[ford]]
# to [[swim]] {{qualifier|something}}
# to [[pass over]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:عَبْر,عُبُور}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:عَبْر,عِبَارَة}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[interpret]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|12|43
|passage=يَا أَيُّهَا ٱلْمَلَأُ أَفْتُونِي فِي رُؤْيَايَ إِنْ كُنْتُمْ لِلرُّؤْيَا '''تَعْبُرُونَ'''|subst=لِلرُّؤْيَا/لِ-ٱلرُّؤْيَا|t=O people give me your opinion about my vision if you can see through it!}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.pass.vn:عَبْر,عِبَارَة}}

===Etymology 2===

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|عَبْر|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|عَبَرَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|عَبْر}}

===Etymology 3===
{{adverbial accusative|ar|عَبْر||{{l|en|crossing}}}}. Compare {{cog|sem-srb|𐩲𐩨𐩧|t=towards}}.

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|عَبْرَ}}

# [[across]]

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|عَبْرَ}}

===Etymology 4===
From the root {{ar-root|ع ب ر}} and in the meanings of explaining, interpreting, expressing a {{sl|ar|pal|tr=wtltn'|ts=widārdan|nocap=1|sc=Phlv|t=to cause to pass}} = {{cog|fa-cls|گذاردن|tr=guḏārdan|t=to cause to pass; to clean, to purge; to put, to place}}, {{m|pal|tr=wcʾltn'|ts=wizārdan|sc=Phlv|t=to separate; to explain, to interpret, to express}} = {{m|fa|گزاردن|tr=gozârdan|t=to cause to pass; to draw the outline of a picture; to express}}.
{{rfquote|ar}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.pass}}

# {{lb|ar|ditransitive}} to [[get across]]
## {{lb|ar|obsolete|literally}} to make [[cross]], to cause to [[pass over]], to [[convey]] [[across]] {{+obj|ar|:بِ<over what>}}
## {{lb|ar|transferred}} to [[express]], to put into terms {{+obj|ar|:عَنْ}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[interpret]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.pass}}

===References===
* {{R:akk:CAD|volume=4|page=10|entry=ebēru}}
* {{R:sem:Fraenkel-Lautwandel|pages=69–70}}

-------- end text --------
