Page 12914 عبرة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ع ب ر}}. Compare to {{l|ar|عَبْر|t=[[crossing]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|عِبْرَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|عِبْرَة|f|pl=عِبْرَات|pl2=عِبَر}}

# [[example]], [[lesson]], [[warning]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|12|111|passage=لَقَدْ كَانَ فِي قَصَصِهِمْ '''عِبْرَةٌ''' لِأُولِي الْأَلْبَابِ|subst=لِأُولِي/لِ-أُلِي|translation=There is a '''lesson''' in the stories of such people for those who understand.|footer=<small>Translated by [[w:en:Muhammad Abdel-Haleem|Muhammad Abdel-Haleem]]</small>}}
# {{rfdef|ar}}
#: {{usex|ar|اَلْعِبْرَةُ بِالْكَيْفِ لَا بِالْكَمِّ.|t=What matters is quality, not quantity.}}

====Derived terms====
{{ar-decl-noun|عِبْرَة|pl=sfp|pl2=عِبَر}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|اَلْعِبْرَةُ بِعُمُومِ اللَّفْظِ لَا بِخُصُوصِ السَّبَبِ}}

====Descendants====
