Page 13060 عرعر: -------- begin text --------
[[File:عطف بن جيراد.jpg|thumb|right|عَرْعَر]]
{{wikipedia|lang=ar|عرعر (شجر)}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|عَرْعَار|عَرَار|عَرْعَال}}

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ع|ر|ر}} meaning “to be mangy” “to be covered in scabs or scales”, “to strip or flake”, the juniper plant being characterized by its tiny scale-like leaves; cognate with {{cog|he|עַרְעָר|tr=ʿarʿār|t=juniper}}, and also {{cog|uga|𐎓𐎗𐎓𐎗|t=tamarisk}}, {{cog|syc|ܥܰܪܳܐ|tr=ʿarrā|t=tamarisk}} as [[tamarisk]]s look similar in texture.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|عَرْعَر}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|عَرْعَر|m}}

# [[juniper]] {{gloss|{{taxfmt|Juniperus|genus}} gen.}}
## [[evergreen]], [[cypress]]

