Page 13061 عرف: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ع ر ف}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عَرَفَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-عرف.ogg}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.vn:مَعْرِفَة,عِرْفَان}} {{tlb|ar|transitive}}

# to be [[familiar]] with (a person, a place, a piece of news or information, and so on); to [[know]]
#: {{syn|ar|خَبُرَ}}
#: {{ant|ar|أَنْكَرَ|جَهِلَ}}
#: {{cot|ar|عَلِمَ|دَرَى}}
#: {{ux|ar|هَلْ '''تَعْرِفُهَا'''؟|Do '''you know her'''?}}
#: {{ux|ar|'''أَعْرِفُ''' أَنَّهَا دَرَسَتِ الْحُقُوقَ.|'''I know''' that she studied law.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|12|58|passage=وَجَاءَ إِخْوَةُ يُوسُفَ فَدَخَلُوا عَلَيْهِ '''فَعَرَفَهُمْ''' وَهُمْ لَهُ مُنْكِرُونَ|t=Then Joseph's brothers came in, and he '''knew them''', while they did not recall him.}}
# to be [[familiar]] with (a skill or profession); to be [[experience]]d in; to be [[proficient]] at or in; [[can]]
#: {{syn|ar|أَجَادَ|t=to excel at}}
#: {{ux|ar|هُوَ '''عَارِفٌ''' بِالْيَابَانِيَّةِ|He is '''proficient''' in Japanese.}}
#: {{ux|ar|'''أَعْرِفُ''' الْعَزْفَ وَالْغِنَاءَ.|'''I know''' how to sing and play music.}}
#: {{ux|ar|هُمْ لَا '''يَعْرِفُونَ''' السِّبَاحَةَ.|They '''cannot''' swim.}}
# to [[recognise]] (a person, a place, and so on); to [[identify]]; to [[recall]]
#: {{syn|ar|تَذَكَّرَ|t=to remember}}
#: {{ux|ar|.أَرَيْتُهَا صُورَتَهُ فَلَمْ '''تَعْرِفْهُ'''|I showed her his picture, but she could not '''recognize''' him.}}
# to become [[aware]] of; to [[find out]]
#: {{syn|ar|أَدْرَكَ}}
