Page 13078 عروب: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ع ر ب}}

===Etymology 1===
Probably an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} borrowing as a slang term for a kind of extratribal licentious woman, since in {{cog|jpa|-}} / {{cog|arc-jla|עָרִיב|tr=ʕārīḇ}} is found as “sweet, pleasing”, and for {{m|arc|עֲרוּבְתָּא|tr=ʿărūḇtā|t=eve; eve before Sabbath; Friday}} present in pre-Islamic Arabic {{m|ar|عَرُوبَة|t=Friday}} the meaning “Venus”, [[dies Veneris]], must be assumed, hence her name apposed to a [[venust]] woman. The related terms {{m|ar|عَرَّبَ}}, {{m|ar|أَعْرَبَ}}, {{m|ar|اِسْتَعْرَبَ}}, {{m|ar|عِرَابَة}} then denote fescennine commerce as if denominal and originally argotic terms to be comprehended as “to do Venus” or at least “to do joy girl”.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ar|عَرُوبَة|عَرِبَة|عَرِيب}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عَرُوب}}

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj|عَرُوب|fpl=عُرُب}}

# [[concupiscent]], [[lustful]], [[bold]] in [[love]], [[lascivious]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 620|author={{w|lang=ar|أوس بن حجر|ʔAws ibn Ḥajar}}|title={{lang|ar|ودع لميس وداع الصارم اللاحي }} …|url=https://www.aldiwan.net/poem326.html|passage=وَدِّع لَميسَ وَداعَ الصارِمِ اللاحي … إِذ فَنَّكَت في فَسادٍ بَعدَ إِصلاحِ<br/>إِذ تَستَبيكَ بِمَصقولٍ عَوارِضُهُ … حَمشِ اللِثاتِ عِذابٍ غَيرِ مِملاحِ<br/>وَقَد لَهَوتُ بِمِثلِ الرِئمِ آنِسَةٍ … تُصبي الحَليمَ '''عَروبٍ''' غَيرِ مِكلاحِ|t=Bid farewell the soft vigorously and fulminantly … for she insisted in the loss after convalescence,<br/>For she snares you in a fashion as froth milk, its mouth … slender in gums, of zestless sweetness.<br/>’Nough you dallied with a sleek sand gazelle’s image … heating the mellow, a '''gillflirt''' unglary.}}
#* {{RQ:Quran|56|35–37|passage=إِنَّا أَنْشَأْنَـٰهُنَّ إِنْشَآءً فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُنَّ أَبْكَارًا '''عُرُبًا''' أَتْرَابً|t=Lo! We have created them a (new) creation [scilicet mates]<br/>And made them virgins,<br/>'''Lovers''' and equals in age.}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-adj|1=-|d=-|pl=-|f=عَرُوب|fpl=عُرُب}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عُرُوب}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|عُرُوب|m-p}}

# {{tlb|ar|rare}} {{plural of|ar|عَرَب}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:CAL|(ryb|A}}
* {{R:ar:Jeffery-Foreign|page=213}}
* {{R:ar:Rotter:1993|pages=122–139}}
