Page 13173 عصفر: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Carthamus tinctorius、Safflower、紅花P5026694.JPG|thumb|right|عُصْفُر]]
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
From a variant of {{m|ar|أَصْفَر}}, the atypical /[[ع]]/ occurs occasionally in some Arabic dialects in replacement of /[[أ]]/ due to the pharyngeal-aspect of a nearby emphatic consonant, namely /[[ص]]/.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|عُصْفُر|m}}

# the [[seed]]s of the [[safflower]]
# the [[petal]]s of the [[safflower]]
# the [[dye]] from the [[safflower]]

