* {{l|ar|عَكَّزَ|t=to fix the iron foot upon the staff}}
* {{l|ar|تَعَكَّزَ|t=to bow by the staff}}
* {{l|ar|عَكُوز|t=a socket of iron where a person affected by elephantiasis puts the foot}}

