Page 13340 علي: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ع ل ي}}

Ultimately from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʿaly-|*ʿall-, *ʿaly-|to be high; exalted}}, from {{inh|ar|afa-pro|*ʿal-|*ʿal-, *ʿVl(ay)-|to be high, tall; to rise, ascend}}.

Cognate with {{cog|he|עָלָה||to ascend, rise, grow, develop|tr=ʿalá}}, {{cog|he|עלי||ascent|tr=ʿeli}} and thereby ''[[Eli#English|Eli]]''.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عَلِيَ}}
* {{rhymes|ar|ijj|s=2}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I.III:و.nopass.vn:عَلَاء}}

# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to be [[exalted]], [[high]]
# {{lb|ar|intransitive}} to [[excel]], to [[stand out]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I.III:و.nopass.vn:عَلَاء}}

