# {{lb|ar|Islam}} [[peace be upon him]]; {{non-gloss definition|a [[eulogy]] used after mentioning the names of holy persons}}

====Usage notes====
* Used after mentioning Islamic prophets other than [[Muhammad]], and by [[Shia]]s also for the [[w:The Twelve Imams|twelve Imams]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|ar|عَلَيْهَا السَّلَامُ||peace be upon her}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|az|əleyhissəlam|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|علیه السلام|tr='aleyhe-s-salâm|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tg|алайҳиссалом|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tr|aleyhisselam|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ur|علیہ السلام|tr='alayhi-s-salām|bor=1}}
* {{desc|uz|alayhissalom|bor=1}}

===See also===
* {{l|ar|صَلَّىٰ ٱللَّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ|tr=ṣallā llāhu ʕalayhī wa-ʔālihī wa-sallama}}
* {{l|ar|عَلَيْهِ ٱلصَّلَاةُ وَٱلسَّلَامُ}}
