===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ع م ل}}
The grammatical “government” meaning is a {{semantic loan|ar|ML.|vīs|nocap=1}}. Compare {{cog|he|עָמָל|tr=`Amal|t=work, deed}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عَمِلَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.pass.vn:عَمَل}}

# to [[work]], [[perform]]
#: {{ux|ar|هُوَ يَعْمَلُ فِي مَجَالِ التَكْنُولُوجِيَا.|He works in the field of technology.}}
#: {{ux|ar|أَنَا أَعْمَلُ كَمُدَرِسٍ فِي الْمَدْرَسَةِ.|I work as a teacher at the school.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|18|79|passage=أَمَّا السَّفِينَةُ فَكَانَتْ لِمَسَاكِينَ '''يَعْمَلُونَ''' فِي الْبَحْرِ|translation=As for the ship, it belonged to some poor people, '''working''' at sea.|footer=<small>Translated by Mustafa Khattab.</small>}}
# to [[do]] {{q|with deliberate thought}}
# to [[practice]], [[profess]]
# to [[produce]] an [[effect]]
# to be [[brisk]], [[walk]] [[fast]]
# to [[exercise]] an [[influence]]
# {{lb|ar|grammar}} to [[govern]] a [[case]]
# to [[take]] [[pains]] {{qualifier|{{m|ar|عَلَى}} with}}
# to [[work]] to an [[end]]
# to [[take care of]]
# to [[last]] [[without]] [[interruption]]

