Page 13412 عنب: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ع|ن|ب}}, from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʿanbab-|t=fruit, flower, shoot}}, ultimately {{inh|ar|afa-pro|*ʿanbab-|t=plant, flower}}. Akin to {{cog|ar|عُنَّاب|t=jujube}}, {{cog|he|עֵנָב|t=grape|tr=ʿēnāḇ}}, {{cog|he|עֲנָבָה|tr=ʿănāḇā}}, {{cog|arc|עֲנָבָא|tr=ʿănnāḇā|t=stalk of grapes}}, {{m|arc|עִנְּבָא|tr=ʿinneḇā|t=cluster of grapes}}, {{m|arc|עִנְבְּתָא|tr=ʿinbəṯā|t=berry}}, {{cog|syc|ܥܷܢܒ݂݁ܳܬܐ|tr=ʿinbəṯā|t=berry}}, {{cog|uga|𐎙𐎐𐎁|t=grape(s)}}, {{cog|xsa|𐩲𐩬𐩨|t=vineyard}}, {{cog|gez|ሕንባብ}}, {{m|gez|ሕባብ|t=grape; grain}}, and thus {{m|ar|حَبّ|t=seed}}, and {{cog|akk|inbum|𒄧|tr=inbum|t=fruit}} with its many derivatives.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|عِنَب}}
** {{a|ar|Moroccan}} {{ary-IPA|ʕinab|ʕnab}}

===Noun===
{{ar-coll-noun|عِنَب|m|sing=عِنَبَة|pl=أَعْنَاب}}

# {{lb|ar|collective}} [[grape]]s

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|عِنَب|pl=أَعْنَاب}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|عُنَّاب|t=jujube}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|mt|għeneb}}
* {{desc|am|ዒነብ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ota|عنب|tr=ineb|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|عنب|tr='enab|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tig|ዕነብ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ur|عنب|tr=ineb|bor=1}}

{{C|ar|Fruits|Grapevines}}

