# The nineteenth letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. It is preceded by {{l|ar|ع}} and followed by {{l|ar|ف}}.

===Symbol===
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''غ '''/''' غ‍ '''/''' ‍غ‍ '''/''' ‍غ'''|tr=ḡayn}}

