* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=934}}
* {{R:CAL|(r%232|N}}, lumps the “laurel” with the “tamarisk” sense, which became a homonym in some Aramaic lects, but {{m|ar|عَرْعَر}} and {{m|ar|أَرْز}} and {{m|ar|غَرَب}} are all to be distinguished

