|passage=وَلَا تَطْرُدِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ رَبَّهُم بِ'''ٱلْغَدَوٰةِ''' وَٱلْعَشِىِّ يُرِيدُونَ وَجْهَهُۥ
|translation=˹O Prophet!˺ Do not dismiss those ˹poor believers˺ who invoke their Lord '''morning''' and evening, seeking His pleasure.}}

