===Etymology 2===
A vernacular borrowing of {{bor|ar|ota|قرابیه|tr=[[kurabiye]]}}, {{m|ota|غرابیه|tr=gurabiye|t=an almond-biscuit; a small hunting-case watch}}, a pseudo-Arabism like {{m|ota|جمهوریت|tr=cumhuriyet}} suffixed {{m|ota|ـیت|tr=-iyyet}} from {{der|ar|ar|غُرَاب|t=the extremity of the haunch, bend of the scabbard|nocat=1}} because the [[fob watch]] was carried near the haunch or scabbard, from which the cookie name was transferred.
{{wp|lang=ar|غريبة (حلوى)}}
{{wp|lang=ar|غريبة (أكلة)}}

