Page 13828 غنج: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
In view of the irregular homorganic first and third radical, a mashup of some other morphemes, {{m|ar|غُنَّة}}, {{m|ar|أُغْنِيَّة}} or {{m|ar|غَنَم}} with perhaps {{m|ar|[[عَن]] [[عَوَجٍ]]}};<ref>{{m|ar|غَنَم عَن عَوَجٍ}} is suggested by {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=931}}, though we would have expected them to suggest reduplication or augmentation from the biradical.</ref>  the verbs and adjectives are to be presumed denominal.

{{w|Davud Monshizadeh|Monši-Zâde}} deems likely a {{bor|ar|ira-mid}} loan related to {{m|fa|قر|tr=qer|t=rotation; twerk}}, {{m|fa||قر دادن|tr=qer dâdan|t=to rotate}}, {{m|fa|غل دادن|tr=ğel dâdan|t=to rotate}}, {{m|fa|گردیدن|tr=gardidan}}, {{m|fa|گلیدن|tr=galidan}}, {{m|fa|غلتیدن|tr=ğaltidan}}, {{m|fa|غلطیدن|tr=ğaltidan|t=to sway around, to roll, to wallow}}, {{m|fa|غلط|tr=ğalt}}, {{m|fa|غلت|tr=ğalt}}, {{m|fa|غل|tr=gal|t=rotation}}, {{m|fa|غلطک|tr=ğaltak}}, {{m|fa|غلتک|tr=ğaltak|t=cylinder, roll; mangle; bucket-wheel}}, {{m|fa|غلتنگ|tr=ğaltang|t=cylinder, roll}}.<ref>{{R:fa:Monchi-Zadeh:1990|page=72 Nr. 215}}</ref>

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.nopass.vn:غُنْج}}

# to [[vocalize]] [[erotic]] [[disposition]] as a [[female]], to [[coquet]], to [[flirt]], to [[tease]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.nopass.vn:غُنْج}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|تَغَنَّجَ}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[entice]] or [[pamper]] by [[flirtatious]] [[word]]s
#* {{quote-book|ar|title=apparently some random poet on the internet wrote|year=2008|url=https://mofradat.ahlamontada.net/t991-topic|passage=وَمَا عَادَ ٱلشَّبَابُ<br/>لَوْلَاهُ مَا ٱخْضَرَّ ٱلنَّبَاتُ<br/>إِنْ كُنْتُ قَدْ '''غَنَّجْتُ'''هُ<br/>أَوْ كُنْتُ قَدْ دَلَّلْتُهُ<br/>أَوْ كُنْتُ قَدْ كَرَّمْتُهُ<br/>فَكُلُّ ذَا قَلِيلٌ|t=Youth has not returned,<br/>Without it the plant greens not<br/>When I '''pampered''' it<br/>Or when I led it<br/>Or when I hearted it<br/>Anyhow this is all trifling}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===Adjective===
