Page 13875 ف: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ar|ڢ}} (African form; dotted when final)
* {{l|ar|ࢻ}} (African form; undotted when final)

===Etymology===
From the Nabataean letter {{m|arc-nab|𐢘|tr=p|t=pē}}, derived from the {{der|mul|phn|-}} letter {{m|phn|𐤐|tr=p|t=pē}}, from the {{der|mul|egy|-}} hieroglyph {{m|egy|𓂋}}. See also {{m+|syc|ܦ|tr=p|t=pē}}, {{m+|he|פ|tr=p|t=pe}}, {{m+|grc|Π}}, {{m+|la|P}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{ar-IPA|فَاء}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{ar-IPA|فْ}}

===Letter===
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ف '''/''' ف‍ '''/''' ‍ف‍ '''/''' ‍ف'''|tr=fāʔ}}

# The twentieth letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. It is preceded by {{l|ar|غ}} and followed by {{l|ar|ق}}.

===Symbol===
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''ف '''/''' ف‍ '''/''' ‍ف‍ '''/''' ‍ف'''|tr=fāʔ}}

# The seventeenth letter in traditional [[abjad]] order, which is used in place of numerals for list numbering ([[abjad numerals]]). It is preceded by {{l|ar|ع}} and followed by {{l|ar|ص}}.

===Conjunction===
{{ar-con|فَـ}}

# [[then]], and [[then]]
#: {{uxi|ar|يَوْمًا '''فَ'''يَوْمًا|subst=فَ/فَ-|day '''after''' day}}
#: {{uxi|ar|شَيْئًا '''فَ'''شَيْئًا|subst=فَ/فَ-|step '''by''' step}}
# and [[so]], [[thus]], [[hence]], [[therefore]]
# but [[then]], [[then]] however
# [[because]], [[for]]
# {{qualifier|with a subjunctive}} [[so that]]
#: {{usex|ar|لَا تَدْنُ مِنَ الْأَسَدِ فَيَأْكُلَكَ.|t=Do not approach the lion '''lest''' he eat you.}}
#: {{usex|ar|لَا تَكُنْ رَطْبًا '''فَ'''تُعْصَرَ وَلَا يَابِسًا '''فَ'''تُكْسَرَ.|subst=فَ/فَ-,وَ/وَ-|Do not be so soft '''that''' they squeeze you, nor so hard '''that''' they break you.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|17|29|passage=وَلَا تَجْعَلْ يَدَكَ مَغْلُولَةً إِلَىٰ عُنُقِكَ وَلَا تَبْسُطْهَا كُلَّ الْبَسْطِ '''فَ'''تَقْعُدَ مَلُومًا مَّحْسُورًا|subst=فَ/فَ-,وَ/وَ-}}

====Usage notes====
* {{m|ar|فَ}} indicates that the second action follows directly after the first action, whereas {{m|ar|ثُمَّ}} indicates that there is a certain period of time between the two actions.

