===Etymology===
* Possibly related to the root of {{m|ar|فَحْل}}, for the root f-ḥ-l is somewhat developed in {{cog|gez|-}} in the meaning of “lasciviousness”
* Possible related to {{cog|syc|ܦܚܶܙ|tr=pḥez|t=to act voluptuously}}, {{cog|he|פָּחַז|tr=pāḥaz|t=to leap, to bound; to be wanton; to be lascivious; to be proud}}, which could also relate to the root {{ar-root|ف خ ر|nocat=1}}.

