Page 13882 ف خ ر: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Owning the lack of {{cog|sem|-}} cognates and the narrow meaning, probably denominal from {{m|ar|فَخْر|t=boast}}, the originally most common word in the root formula, borrowed from a descendant {{der|ar|ira-pro|*huHarnā́h|t=splendour, glory}}, although it could stand in variation with {{ar-root|ف ح ش|nocat=1}} as {{m|ar|حَفَرَ}} with {{m|ar|حَفَشَ}}.

