===Etymology===
Maybe extended from {{ar-root|ف ر ر|nocat=1}} meaning “to flee”, wherefore “joy breaking out”; release, breaking out and release from sorrow also being senses of {{ar-root|ف ر ج|nocat=1}}. And the same derivation type in {{ar-root|م ر ح|nocat=1}} related to joy.

