** {{desc|mul|-|der=1}} ''[[Fagara]]''
*** {{desc|bor=1|fr|fagara|fagare|g2=f,m}}
**** {{desc|fr|fagarier|der=1}}
*** {{desc|en|fagara|bor=1}}
*** {{desc|es|fagara|bor=1}}
* {{desc|syc|ܦܥܪܐ|tr=pāʿərā|bor=1|id=pepper}}

