Page 14181 فرنس: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|فَرَنْسَا|gloss=[[France]]}}, with the first quadriliteral conjugation implying the bestowing of a particular quality. Compare {{m|ar|أَمْرَكَ|gloss=to [[Americanize]], to make [[American]]}}، {{m|ar|أَلْمَنَ|gloss=to [[Germanize]], to make [[German]]}}, {{m|ar|عَرَّبَ|gloss=to [[Arabize]], to make [[Arab]]}}, {{m|ar|تَرَّكَ|gloss=to [[Turkify]], to make [[Turkish]]}}, {{m|ar|هَوَّدَ|gloss=to [[Judaize]], to make [[Jewish]]}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|Iq}}

# To [[gallicize]], to make [[French]]

