Page 14252 فصولياء: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
The long ''ā'' of {{m|ar|فَاصُولِيَاء}}, being unstressed and pre-tonic, has been contracted in dialects. This feeds back into Modern Standard Arabic and causes the vowel not to be written plene. On the other hand, Ottoman Turkish orthography varied here too.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|فَصُولِيَاء}}

===Noun===
