Cognate to {{cog|he|פָטַר|tr=pāṭar|t=to set free, to let out, to release, to dismiss}}, {{cog|arc|פָטַר|tr=pāṭar|t=to cleave, to separate, to free, to discharge}}, {{cog|arc|פְטַר|tr=pəṭar|t=to free, to release, to dismiss}}, {{cog|syc|ܦܛܰܪ|tr=pṭar|t=to leave, to desist from; to shoot out; to separate, to dissolve; to dismiss}}, {{cog|uga|𐎔𐎉𐎗|t=to split}}, hypercorrected {{cog|uga|𐎔𐎑𐎗|t=to free, to loosen, to let go}}, {{cog|akk|𒃮|ts=paṭāru|tr=DUḪ|t=to loosen, to detach; to relax, to slacken; to release, to let free; to disperse}}, and {{cog|gez|ፈጠረ|t=to carve; to feign; to create}} which has been borrowed into a second {{m-self|ar|فَطَرَ|id=create}}.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:فَطْر}}

# to [[rip]] apart, to [[rend]] the seam, to [[cleave]], to [[break]] apart, to [[crack]]
# to [[split]] open, to [[cut]] open, to [[slit]] open, to [[crack]]
# to [[lance]], to [[lacerate]], to [[gash]], to [[cut]], to make an [[incision]]

