# a [[muzzle]] of a [[dog]] or [[canine]], [[jawbone]] with [[similar]] [[feature]]s

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|فُقْم}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|فَقَم|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|فَقِمَ|form=I}}
# {{C|ar|Genetic disorders}} [[prognathism]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|فَقَم}}

===Etymology 2===
{{wikipedia|فقميات|lang=ar}}
Most likely just an international word from {{der|ar|grc|φώκη|t=seal}}, perhaps with this form in Arabic potentially influenced by {{m-self|ar|فُقْم}} in the sense of a dog's muzzle. Compare the by-name {{m|ar|كَلْبُ البَحْرِ|tr=|t=sea lion, seal|lit=dog of the sea}} as the Arabs, among other cultures, connect pinnipeds visually with canines.

[[File:Harbor seal on patch of ice floating in water phoca vitulina.jpg|thumb|right|upright=1.15|{{lang|ar|فُقم}} – ''[[Phoca vitulina]]'']]

====Noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|فُقَّم|head2=فُقْم|sing=فُقَّمَة|sing2=فُقْمَة|m}}

# [[seal]] ([[marine]] [[animal]] of the family {{taxfmt|Phocidae|family}})

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|فُقَّم|head2=فُقْم}}

