* Related to {{bor|ar|arc|פַּקּוּעָא|tr=paqqūʿā|t=a type of gourd}}, from {{der|ar|akk|𒉿𒅅𒄣𒋾|tr=peqqūtu|t=colocynth, cucumber, gourd; vine-plant that spreads across the ground}}.

