* {{desc|az|fələk|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gez|ፈለክ|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|ms|falak|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|fa|فلک|bor=1|tr=falak}}
* {{desc|sw|falaki|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tr|felek|bor=1}}
* {{desc|uz|falak|bor=1}}

====References====
* {{R:gez:Leslau-Comp.|page=159}}

