Page 14385 فن: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|fa-cls|پند|tr=pand|gloss=knack, trick}}. Semantic development resembles {{semantic loan|ar|grc|τέχνη|notext=1}} and {{semantic loan|ar|la|ars|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|فَنّ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-فن.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|فَنّ|m|pl=فُنُون|pl2=أَفْنَان|pl3=أَفَانِين}}

# [[genre]]
#: {{usex|ar|اَلْغَزَلُ '''فَنٌّ''' مِنْ '''فُنُونِ''' الشِّعْرِ|t=The ghazal is a '''genre''' of poetry.|lit=The ghazal is a '''genre''' from among the '''genres''' of poetry.}}
# [[art]]
# {{lb|ar|archaic}} [[knack]], [[trick]], [[artifice]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} [[quarrel]], [[ruffle]], [[trouble]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 800|authorlink=Sa'id ibn Aws al-Ansari|author=ar:أبو زيد سعيد بن أوس الأنصاري<tr:ʔabū zayd saʕīd ibn ʔaws al-ʔanṣārīy>|title=ar:كتاب النوادر|trans-title=Buch der Seltenheiten}} {{R:ar:Fleischer-KS|volume=3|pages=483–484}}:
#*: {{quote|ar|لَأَجْعَلَنْ لِإْبْنَةِ عَمْرٍو فَنَّا … حَتَّى يَكُونَ مَهْرُهَا دُهْدُنَّا|subst=عَمْرٍو/عَمْرٍ|t=Verily I will cause a '''dispute''' about ʕamr’s daughter … so her marriage portion will be vain}}
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} [[adornment]], [[decoration]], [[embellishment]]
# {{lb|ar|archaic}} [[sort]], [[species]], [[type]]
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} [[state]], [[condition]], [[case]]

