Page 14434 فوق: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
Originally a case form of a defective noun {{m|ar|فَوْق||[[location]] that is [[above]]}}; see the usage note. From the root {{ar-root|ف و ق}}.

====Adverb====
{{ar-adv|فَوْقُ}}

# [[above]]

=====Usage notes=====
This originates as a case form of a defective noun {{m|ar|فَوْق|t=location that is above}}. It is declined normally when definite or in the construct state, e.g. {{m|ar||الْفَوْقُ|t=the location that is above}}, {{m|ar||فَوْقُهُ|t=his upper part}}. Other forms are the adverbial accusative in the preposition {{m|ar|فَوْقَ|t=above}}, the genitive in the expression {{m|ar|مِنْ فَوْقٍ|t=from above, above}} (also with an attached pronoun, as in {{m|ar||مِنْ فَوْقِهِمْ|t=(from) above them}}), and the irregular expression {{m|ar|مِنْ فَوْقُ|t=(from) above}}.

=====References=====
* {{R:ar:Lane|فوق}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{audio|ar|Ar-فوق.ogg}}

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|فَوْقَ}}

# [[above]], [[on top of]]
# [[more]] than, [[over]]
#: {{usex|ar|كَانُوا فَوْقَ الْعِشْرِين|They were more than twenty}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|4|11|passage=فَإِنْ كُنَّ نِسَاءً '''فَوْقَ''' ٱثْنَتَيْنِ فَلَهُنَّ ثُلُثَا مَا تَرَكَ}}
# more important than

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|فَوْقَ}}

