Page 14436 فول: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Claimed to be borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|פֹּולא|tr=pōlā|t=bean}}, which is supported by the names of other grain-yielding legumes {{m|ar|حِمَّص|t=chickpea}}, {{m|ar|بَاقِلّاء|t=broad bean}}, {{m|ar|تُرْمُس|t=lupin}}, {{m|ar|خُلَّر}}, {{m|ar|جُلُبَّان|t=grasspea}}, {{m|ar|فَصْفَص|t=lucerne}} being borrowed from Aramaic, though {{m|ar|عَدَس|t=lentils}} is an example against this. Ultimately perchance from {{inh|ar|sem-pro||*pūl-|t=bean, corn, seed, grains, little pieces}}; possibly distantly related to {{cog|egy|prj|t=to emerge}} and {{m|egy|prt|t=growing season}}.

===Pronunciation===
