Page 14446 في: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|فِي}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-في.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
Possibly related to {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*pay-|t=mouth, an orifice, an entrance, a means in or to enter}}, cognates with {{cog|he|פֹּה|tr=|t=here}} and {{m|he|פִּי|tr=|t=multiplied, -fold|lit=with, to have this length with this width}} and {{cog|uga|𐎔|tr=|t=here, in this place or in this time; in the manner of, relating or pertaining to}}, and {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*piʔat-|t=side; border; front, facing part of anything}}, i. e. the same word as {{m|ar|فِئَة|t=troop}}, since this word is retained in {{cog|gez|-}} only in the combination {{m|gez|ለፌ|t=in the direction of or from, thence or thither}}. It has also functions originally borne by {{der|ar|sem-pro|*bV-}}, potentially perceived or originating as a devoiced form of it.

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|فِي}}

# [[in]], [[within]]
# [[during]], for a [[duration]] of
# [[in]] [[with]], [[among]], [[together]] [[with]]
# [[of]], [[about]], in [[regards]] to, [[pertaining]] to, in the [[subject]] or [[topic]] of
#: {{usex|ar|عِنْدِي سُؤَالٌ فِي النَّحْوِ|I have a question about grammar}}
# [[on account of]], for the [[reason]] of, in [[relation]] to
# [[times]], [[multiplied]] by, to have a [[measure]] of [[this]] by [[this]]
#: {{ant|ar|عَلَىٰ|q1='on, divided by'}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أَرْبَعَة فِي خَمْسَة|Four times five}}

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|فِي}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|فِيمَا}}
* {{l|ar|فِيمَا بَعْد}}
* {{l|ar|فِيمَ}}
* {{l|ar|فِيمَنْ}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|mt|f'}}

===Etymology 2===

====Verb====
{{ar-verb-form|فِي|I}}

# {{inflection of|ar|وَفَى||2|f|s|actv|impr}}

-------- end text --------
