Cognate with {{cog|arc|פִּילָא|tr=pīlā|sc=Hebr}} and {{cog|he|פיל|tr=píl}}. Compare also {{cog|xcl|փիղ|}}, {{cog|fa|پیل|tr=pil}}, {{cog|sa|पीलु}}.

