Page 14678 قاعدة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the verb {{m|ar|قَعَدَ||to [[sit down]], to [[lie in wait]], to [[waylay]]}}, root {{ar-root|ق|ع|د}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|قَاعِدَة}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-قاعدة.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|قَاعِدَة|f|pl=قَوَاعِد}}

# [[foundation]]
#: {{syn|ar|أَسَاس}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|16|26|text=قَدْ مَكَرَ الَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَأَتَى اللَّهُ بُنْيَانَهُم مِّنَ الْقَوَاعِدِ فَخَرَّ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّقْفُ مِن فَوْقِهِمْ وَأَتَاهُمُ الْعَذَابُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَا يَشْعُرُونَ|t=Indeed, those before them had plotted, but Allah struck at the ˹very˺ '''foundation''' of their structure, so the roof collapsed on top of them, and the torment came upon them from where they did not expect.}}
# [[basis]]
#: {{syn|ar|أَسَاس}}
# [[precept]], [[rule]], [[principle]]
# [[fundament]]
# {{lb|ar|military}} [[base]]
# {{lb|ar|chemistry}} [[base]]
#: {{syn|ar|قَلَوِيّ}}
#: {{ant|ar|حَمْض}}
# [[support]], [[socle]], [[pedestal]]
# [[chassis]], [[undercarriage]]
# [[formula]]
#: {{uxi|ar|قَاعِدَة فِيثَاغُورَس|tr=qāʿidat fīṯāḡōras|t=Pythagorean formula, Pythagorean theorem}}
# [[method]], [[manner]]
# [[model]], [[pattern]]
#: {{syn|ar|نَمَط}}

