===References===
* {{cite-book|title=Proceedings of the Eighth International Conference of Ethiopian Studies, University of Addis Ababa, 1984|year=1989|location=Addis Ababa|publisher=Institute of Ethiopian Studies|volume=2|page=635|editor=Beyene, Taddese}}
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=999|entry=قبقاب}}
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=1014|entry=قرابقي}}, where an occupational {{m|ar|قَرَابِقِيّ|t=clog-maker}}
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=1023|entry=قرقب}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=335|قرقب}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=303}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy-V|volume=2|pages=347–349}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=3|page=392}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag-Einl.|page=118, from 112}}
* {{R:gez:Leslau-Comp.|page=438}}

