From {{bor|ar|grc|κράνεια}}, {{m|grc|κρανία|t=cornel tree}}, extensions of {{m|grc|κράνον|t=cornel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|قَرَانِيَا}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|قَرَانِيَا|f}}

# [[dogwood]], [[cornel]] (''[[Cornus]]'' gen. et spp.)

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|قَرَانِيَا}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|axm|ղարանիայ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|قرانیا|tr=qarâniyâ|bor=1}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=339b}}

{{C|ar|Cornales order plants}}
