Page 14826 قرب: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1.1===
* From the root {{ar-root|ق|ر|ب}}, with the {{ar-form|I|nocap=1}} being reconstructed securely as {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ḳarib-}}, likewise the {{ar-form|II|nocap=1}} as {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ḳarrib-}}.
* While the {{cog|hbo|קָרַב|tr=qāráḇ|t=to approach}} governs prepositions of approach like {{m|he|אֶל|tr=el}}, {{m|he|לְ|tr=lə}}, {{m|he|עַל|tr=ʿal}}, the Arabic {{m-self|ar|قَرُبَ}} has obtained the opposited preposition {{m|ar|مِن}} by analogy of {{m|ar|بَعُدَ|t=to be far}}; compare the same with {{m|ar|دَنَا|t=to come near}}.<ref>{{cite-book|de|last=Barth|first=Jakob|authorlink=de:Jakob Barth|chapter=Formangleichung bei begrifflichen Korrespondenzen|year=1906|title=Orientalische Studien. Theodor Nöldeke zum siebzigsten Geburtstag (2. März 1906), gewidmet von Freunden und Schülern und in ihrem Auftrag herausgegeben von Carl Bezold|publisher=Alfred Töpelmann|location=Gießen|page=795|pageurl=https://menadoc.bibliothek.uni-halle.de/ssg/content/pageview/799686}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قَرُبَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.ipass?.vn:قُرْب,مَقْرَبَة,قَرَابَة,مَقْرُبَة}}

# to be [[near]], to come near, to [[approach]] {{+obj|ar|:مِن/:إِلَى}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.ipass?.vn:قُرْب,مَقْرَبَة,قَرَابَة,مَقْرُبَة}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/u~u.ipass?.vn:قَرَابَة,قُرْبَة,قُرْبَى,مَقْرَبَة}}

# to be [[related]], to be of [[close]] [[relations]], to be [[kindred]] (especially on the maternal side)
# to have [[relation]] to something, to be [[associated]]
# to be [[engaged]] with, to be or become [[involved]] with

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/u~u.ipass?.vn:قَرَابَة,قُرْبَة,قُرْبَى,مَقْرَبَة}}

===Etymology 1.2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قَرِبَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.pass.vn:قِرْبَان,قُرْبَان}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to be [[near]], to come near, to [[approach]] {{+obj|ar|acc}}
#: {{usex|ar|لَا '''تَقْرَبِ''' الْأَسَدَ فَيَأْكُلَكَ.|Do not '''approach''' the lion lest he eat you.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|2|35|passage=وَقُلْنَا يَا آدَمُ ٱسْكُنْ أَنْتَ وَزَوْجُكَ الْجَنَّةَ وَكُلَا مِنْهَا رَغَدًا حَيْثُ شِئْتُمَا وَلَا '''تَقْرَبَا''' هَٰذِهِ ٱلشَّجَرَةَ فَتَكُونَا مِنَ ٱلظَّالِمِين}}
# {{C|ar|Sex}} {{lb|ar|transitive|euphemism}} to [[copulate]] with
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|2|222|passage=وَلَا '''تَقْرَبُوهُنَّ''' حَتَّىٰ يَطْهُرْنَ}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.pass.vn:قِرْبَان,قُرْبَان}}

===Etymology 1.3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قَرَّبَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to cause or allow to be near
# to make or let approach

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II}}

===Etymology 1.4===

====Pronunciation====
