====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قُرْب|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|قَرُبَ|form=I}}
# [[nearness]], [[presence]]
#: {{ux|ar|عِنْدَمَا كَانَ جَالِسًا بِالْقُرْبِ مِنْ زَوْجَتِهِ... صَرَخَتْ فِي وَجْهِهِ قَائِلَةً: ”اِبْتَعِدْ عَنِّي!“|When he was sitting next to his wife... she yelled into his face, saying: “Go away from me!”}}
#* {{quote-text|ar|year=2004|author=Nancy Ajram|chapter=Ana Leih|title=Ah W Noss
|passage={{lang|ar|أنا ليه بحب حبك قوي كده ليه <br /> وأموت في '''قربك''' أنا كده ليه}}
|translation=ʾana leih bi-ḥubbi ḥubbak qawī kida leih <br /> wa-'mūtu fī qorbak ʾana kida leih}}

