Page 14843 قرص: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ḳaraṣ-}}, from the root {{ar-root|ق|ر|ص}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قَرَصَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.vn:قَرْص}}

# to [[pinch]]
## to [[clean]] with [[fingers]] (by pinching)
##: {{ux|ar|'''قَرَصَ''' الثَّوْبَ بِالْمَاءِ|He '''cleaned''' the cloth with the water (by pinching it).}}
# to [[bite]], to [[sting]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.vn:قَرْص}}

=====Synonyms=====
* (''to pinch''): {{l|ar|قَبَصَ}}
* (''to bite, to sting''): {{l|ar|لَدَغَ}}, {{l|ar|لَذَعَ}}, {{l|ar|لَسَعَ}}

====References====
* {{R:ar:Almaany}}

===Etymology 2===
Derived from the {{ar-verbal noun|lc=1}} of {{m|ar|قَرَصَ}}, from the root {{ar-root|ق|ر|ص}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قَرْص}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قَرْص|m}}

# [[pinch]], [[pinching]]
# [[biting]], [[stinging]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|قَرْص}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ar|قَرْصَة}}

===Etymology 3===
From the root {{ar-root|ق|ر|ص}}. There is no evidence that it might be borrowed.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|قُرْص}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قُرْص|m|pl=أَقْرَاص}}

