Page 14844 قرصان: -------- begin text --------
{{was fwotd|ar|2022|September|19}}
[[File:Admiral der türkischen Schiffe, der Seeräuber von Algier.tif|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|قُرْصَان}}]]

===Etymology===
Likely via {{bor|ar|it|corsale|t=corsair, privateer}}<ref>“Corsair” in E. J. Van Donzel (1994): ''Islamic Desk Reference. Compiled from the Encyclopedia of Islam.'' E.J. Brill: Leiden, Netherlands, page 74.</ref> from {{der|ar|ML.|cursārius|t=pirate, sea-raider}}, from {{der|ar|la|cursus|t=course, a running; plunder, hostile inroad}},<ref name="Lingua Franca">J. E. Wansborough (1996), Lingua Franca in the Mediterranean, Curzon Press, page 165.</ref> with the Arabic {{suffix|ar||ـَان}} suffix. Cognate with {{cog|en|corsair}} or {{cog|de|Korsar}}. With the derived terms {{m|ar|قَرْصَنَ}} and {{m|ar|قَرْصَنَة}} it forms a root {{ar-root|ق ر ص ن}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|قُرْصَان}}
* {{IPA|acw|[ɡʊr.sˤaːn]|[qʊr.sˤaːn]|a=Hijazi}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|قُرْصَان|m|pl=قَرَاصِنَة|pl2=قَرَاصِين}}

# [[pirate]], [[sea]]-[[raider]]
# {{lb|ar|computing}} [[pirate]]; [[cracker]]; [[hacker]]
#* {{quote-journal|1=ar|date=2017-07-02|work=At-Tiqniyy|url=https://www.thechni.com/2017/02/Hacker.html|author=Abdelaali Es-Salmi|title=ar:تعرف على أنواع الهكر أو المخترقون|trans-title=Know the types of hackers or crackers|accessdate=22 October 2018|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20180206092902/http://www.thechni.com/2017/02/Hacker.html|archivedate=6 February 2018
|passage=اكر أو قرصان أو مخترق (بالإنجليزية: Hacker) يوصف بأسود إن كان مخرب وأبيض إن كان يساعد على أمان الشبكة ورمادي إن كان مجهول الهوية، عموما كلمة توصف المختص  المتمكن من مهارات في مجال الحاسوب وأمن المعلوماتية.
|translation=A hacker or corsair or cracker (in English: hacker) is called black when he destroys, white when he helps security of networks, and gray when he is of unknown identity, in general the word denotes someone specialized in obtaining skills in the computer field and information security.}}
#* {{quote-journal|ar|date=2018-9-27|title=ar:فيروبوت.. قرصان إلكتروني يطالبك بـ520 دولارا|url=http://www.aljazeera.net/news/scienceandtechnology/2018/9/27/%D9%81%D9%8A%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8%D9%88%D8%AA-%D9%82%D8%B1%D8%B5%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%A5%D9%84%D9%83%D8%AA%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%86%D9%8A-%D9%8A%D8%B7%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D9%83-%D8%A8%D9%80520-%D8%AF%D9%88%D9%84%D8%A7%D8%B1%D8%A7|work=Al-Jazeera|trans-title=Electronic see-raider demands 520 dollar}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|قُرْصَان|pl=قَرَاصِنَة|pl2=قَرَاصِين}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|قَرْصَنَ|t=to cruise as a pirate}}
* {{l|ar|قَرْصَنَة|g=f|t={{l|en|piracy}}}}

