in https://nbatatmneen.wordpress.com/2018/04/18/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%82%D8%B1%D8%B5%D8%B9%D9%86%D8%A9-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AD%D9%82%D9%84%D9%8A%D8%A9/ it is an equation of {{c|sh|Celery family plants}} [[sea holly]] {{taxlink|Eryngium campestre|species}}) which would match BCS skolab but this is not enough for me – FF-->

