===Etymology===
From {{der|ar|ota|قازمه|tr=kazma|t=pickaxe}}, from {{der|ar|ota|قازمق|tr=kazmak|t=to dig out, to excavate}}, ultimately from {{der|ar|trk-pro|*kaŕ-|t=to dig out}}. From the common cross-cultural depictions of dwarves working the earth, likely bolstered by the real-life use of smaller individuals in mines to reach inaccessible places.

