===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ق ط ف}}, from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*qaṭap-}}. Compare {{cog|arc|קְטַף}} / {{m|syc|ܩܛܲܦ|tr=qṭap̄}}, {{cog|he|קָטַף|tr=qāṭáp̄}}, {{cog|akk|𒋡𒋫𒁍|tr=qa-ta-pu|ts=qatāpu}}. The saltbush name must be from {{bor|ar|syc|ܩܲܛܦܵܐ|tr=qaṭəp̄ā}}, {{m|syc|ܩܛܵܦܵܐ|tr=qəṭāp̄ā|t=saltbush}},<ref>{{R:arc:Löw-Pflanzen|page=282}}</ref><ref>{{R:syc:Brockelmann 1995|page=661a}}</ref> for it mirrors its vocalization.

