===Noun===
{{ar-IPA|قُفْل}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-قفل.ogg}}
{{ar-noun|قُفْل|m|pl=أَقْفَال|pl2=أَقْفُل|pl3=قُفُول}}

# [[lock]], [[bolt]]

====Declension====
