===Etymology 2===
Apparently a twentieth-century borrowing (?) from {{bor|ar|he|קִלֵּס|tr=qilles|t=to mock}} = {{cog|uga|𐎖𐎍𐎕|t=to scorn}}. Semantical doublet of {{m|ar|سَلَقَ}} in the meaning which got borrowed from {{noncog|gez|ተሳለቀ|t=to scoff at}} (the Ethiopic cognate to the Northwest Semitic by metathesis).

