# [[pencil]]
#: {{ux|ar|[[قَلَم]] [[رَصَاص]]|[[pencil]]|inline=t}}
# [[writing]], [[script]], calligraphic style, [[ductus]], [[handwriting]]
# [[style]]
# [[office]], [[bureau]], [[agency]]
# [[window]], [[counter]]
# ''(commerce)'' [[item]], [[entry]]
# [[stripe]], [[streak]], [[line]], [[bar]], [[stria]]

