===Etymology===
Of {{uncertain|ar|nocap=1}} etymology, derived from a conflation of {{der|ar|arc|קולסיתה}} and {{der|ar|arc|קולנייא}} both forms of unknown origin with suggested connections to:
* {{cog|la|calautica|t=coif}} in particular its {{cog|la-vul|calantica}} form
* possibly {{cog|grc|κόρῠς|t=helm, headgear}}
* seeming to be a Persian headdress in particular suggests such a source; perhaps ultimately from {{der|ar|pal|tr=kwlʾp̄|ts=kulāf, kulāv, kulāw|t=cap, bonnet}} or {{der|ar|pal|tr=kwlʾc|ts=kulāč|t=bun, round bulb; hence a base to wrap a turban around}}, cognate with {{cog|fa|کلاه}}
Source of {{cog|he|קַלַנְסֻוָה|tr=qalansuwā}} borrowing.

