===Etymology 1===
From a {{ar-reduplicated|lc=1}} {{onomatopoeic|ar|nocap=1}} root. Compare {{m|ar|غَرْغَرَ|t=gurgle}}, {{m|ar|وَسْوَسَ|t=whisper}}.

