* {{R:ar:Almaany}}
* {{R:ar:BehnstedtWoidich|WA2|pages=360–364}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=407b}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=3|page=501a}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=2|page=847b}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=1058}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=925}}

