Page 15140 قنب: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|ar|arc|-}}, there being {{cog|tmr|קִינְּבָא|tr=qinnəḇā|t=hemp}}, {{cog|syc|ܩܢܦܐ|tr=qənappā|t=hemp}}, and other forms. See {{cog|grc|κάνναβις|t=hemp}} for related terms.

====Noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|قِنَّب|m|head2=قُنَّب|sing=قِنَّبَة|sing2=قُنَّبَة}}

# [[hemp]]
#: {{syn|ar|شَاهْدَانَج|تَنُّوم}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|قِنَّب|head2=قُنَّب}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|قِنَّبِيّ}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|mt|qanneb}}
* {{desctree|ota|قنب|tr=kınnep, kınnap|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
Probably from an {{bor|ar|arc|-}} term cognate to {{cog|syc|ܩܘܽܢܒܳܐ|tr=qunbā|t=greater sail of a ship}} in a [[Appendix:Aramaic terms only witnessed by borrowings|more general meaning]] of a “sleeve, covering sheath or membrane”, possibly related to the mentioned word for hemp, relating to fabrics being made from hemp; hence “to enter or go into” and perhaps more via the idea of “going forth or around” also the names of military detachments.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قُنْب|m|pl=قُنُوب}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# [[great]]er [[sail]] of a [[ship]]
# [[involucre]] of a [[flower]]
#: {{holonyms|ar|كِمّ}}
# the [[membrane]] or [[sheath]] in which certain [[animal]]s have the [[male member]], particularly a [[lion]]
# the [[prepuce]] of the [[clitoris]] of a [[human]] [[female]]
#: {{holonyms|ar|بَظْر}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|قُنْب|pl=قُنُوب}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|قُنْب الْأَسَد}}, also called {{l|ar|ذَنَب الْأَسَد}} and {{l|ar|ذَيْل الْأَسَد}}, denoting the star {{l|en|Denebola}} in the constellation {{w|lang=ar|الأسد (كوكبة)|Leo}}
* {{l|ar|مِقْنَب|t=a certain thing a trapper uses to hunt by envelopping the prey; a {{m|ar|حَلْقَة}} of gold; a cavalry squadron (also {{l|ar|قَنْبَل}} and {{l|ar|قَنْبَلَة}}}}
* {{l|ar|قُنَّابَة|t=leaves in which an ear of grain is enveloped}}
* {{l|ar|قِنَاب|t=the part of a fore-paw into which the claw of a lion is withdrawn; leaves in which an ear of grain is enveloped}}
* {{l|ar|قَنِيب|t=company of men}}
* {{l|ar|قَيْنَاب}} and {{l|ar|قَانِب|t=quick foot messenger, a {{l|ar|فَيْج}}}}
* {{l-self|ar|قَنَبَ|t=to come out and [[forth]] from its [[involucrum]]; to [[enter]], to [[go]] into}}
* {{l-self|ar|قَنَّبَ|t=to put [[forth]] the {{l|ar|قُنَّابَة|t=leaves in which an ear of grain is enveloped}}; to [[form]] a [[squadron]] ({{l|ar|مِقْنَب}}), to [[journey]] with [[collect]]ed men on [[horse]]s}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.nopass.vn:قُنُوب,قَنْب}}

# to come out and [[forth]] from its [[involucrum]]
# to [[enter]], to [[go]] into
## namely, into the [[house]] or [[tent]]
## to [[set]] {{gloss|said of the sun}}
## to [[withdraw]] the [[claw]] into the [[receptacle]] {{gloss|said of a lion}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.nopass.vn:قُنُوب,قَنْب}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.nopass}}

# to put [[forth]] the {{l|ar|قُنَّابَة|t=leaves in which an ear of grain is enveloped}}
# to [[form]] a [[squadron]] ({{l|ar|مِقْنَب}}), to [[journey]] with [[collect]]ed men on [[horse]]s

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.nopass}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قَنْب|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|قَنَبَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|قَنْب}}

===Etymology 3===
Likely of [[ideophonic]] origin, as also known of {{cog|de|knappen}}, {{m|de|abknappen}}. A connection to the senses of the aforementioned root of entering into envelopes via the idea of putting the hand into vegetation is unlikely since plantations are pruned from the outside, especially with the kinds of growings relevant in the Arab world.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.vn:قَنْب}}

# to [[prune]], to [[cut off]] from {{gloss|the object being a vine}}
#: {{syn|ar|قَضَبَ|شَذَبَ|قَلَمَ}}
#* {{quote-web|ar|work=ar:الشرق الأوسط|title=ar: الرجل الذي تعلقت حياته بشجرة زيتون|date=04-06-2017|url=https://aawsat.com/home/article/942571/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B1%D8%AC%D9%84-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B0%D9%8A-%D8%AA%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%82%D8%AA-%D8%AD%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%AA%D9%87-%D8%A8%D8%B4%D8%AC%D8%B1%D8%A9-%D8%B2%D9%8A%D8%AA%D9%88%D9%86|passage=ويقضي أبو علي معظم وقته عند الشجرة التي تملكها عائلته، بهدف العناية بها، يحرسها من أي متطفلين محتملين، ينظف حولها، '''يقنب''' أوراقها وعيدانها، ويحصل أيضاً على محصولها الأهم «زيت الزيتون».|t=Abu Ali spends most of his time with the tree that his family owns, to care for it, he protects it from possible parasites and cleans around it, '''prunes''' its leaves and woods, and obtains its most important produce, the oil of the olive.}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i.vn:قَنْب}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[prune]], to [[cut off]] from {{gloss|the object being a vine}}
#: {{syn|ar|قَضَّبَ|شَذَّبَ|قَلَّمَ}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|قَنْب|m}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|قَنَبَ|form=I}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|قَنْب}}

