#* {{quote-book|ar|author={{lang|ar|{{w|lang=ar|دعبل الخزاعي}}}} [[https://en.wikishia.net/view/Di%27bil_b._%27Ali_al-Khuza%27i Diʿbil al-Ḵuzāʿīy]]|title=ar:يا أبا سعد قوصره<qq:first line>|year=a. 861|url=https://www.aldiwan.net/poem29374.html|passage=يا أَبا سَعدِ قَوصَرَه … زانِيَ الأُختِ وَالمَرَه|t=Oh father of success of the basket, abuser of the sister and wife!}}

