Page 15233 قير: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Minimile9.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|قِير}}]]
{{swp|lang=ar}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|قَار}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|קִירָא}} / {{m|arc|ܩܝܪܐ|tr=qīrā|t=bitumen; wax}} (also {{m|syc|ܩܐܪܐ|tr=qārā}}), from {{der|ar|akk|𒀀𒇒𒉈|ts=qīru|t=bitumen}}; uncertain relation to {{cog|grc|κηρός|t=wax}}, {{cog|la|cēra|t=wax}} which stem from an unknown substrate. Likely ultimately related to {{der|ar|akk|𒌋𒀜|ts=kīru|t=kiln}} from {{der|ar|sux|𒌋𒀜|tr=gir|t=kiln}}, which also gave rise to {{cog|arc|גִירָא}},{{m|syc|ܓܝܪܐ|tr=gīrā|t=lime}}, and {{cog|ar|جِير|t=lime}}, {{cog|lrc|قیل|tr=qil}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|قِير|m}}

# [[tar]]; [[asphalt]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|قِير}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|قِيرِيّ|t=[[tarry]], [[bituminous]]}}
* {{l|ar|قَيَّرَ|t=to [[tar]], to [[asphalt]]}}
* {{l|ar|قَوَّرَ|t=to [[tar]], to [[asphalt]]}}
* {{l|ar|تَقَيَّرَ|t=to be [[tar]]red}}
* {{l|ar|قَيَّار|t=having [[tar]] or [[asphalt]]; who works with [[tar]]}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[tar]], to [[asphalt]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

