* {{q|Upper Egypt, extinct}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡaj.tˤuːn/|/ɡa.tˤuːn/}}
* {{q|Libya}}
** {{q|{{w|Cyrenaica}}}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡiː.tˤuːn/}}
** {{q|{{w|Phazania}}, {{w|Tripolitania}}}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡi.tˤuːn/}}
** {{q|Jews of Tripoli}} {{IPA|ar|/qi.tˤuːn/}}
* {{q|Tunisia}}
** {{q|{{w|Tunis}}}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡiː.tˤuːn/}}
** {{q|[[w:en:Sousse|Sousse]]}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡi.tˤuːn/}}
** {{q|[[w:en:Mrazig|Marazīq]]}} {{IPA|ar|/ɡaː.tˤuːn/}}
* {{q|Algeria}}
