Page 15293 ك ه ل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
A more general meaning is found in {{cog|xsa|𐩫𐩠𐩡|t=to be successful}}, {{m|xsa|𐩫𐩠𐩡𐩩|t=success}}, whereas perhaps generalized from this meaning the (widely developed, also in other {{cog|sem-eth}} languages) root of {{cog|gez|ክህለ|t=to be able}} and {{cog|he|כְּהַל|tr=kəḥal|t=to able}} and {{cog|arc|-}}. The similarity to {{cog|fa|کهنه|tr=kohna|t=old}} is thus a coincidence.

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

