===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كَيْلُون}}

===Etymology===
An unclassical word, apparently applying the [[Appendix:Arabic nominals|vulgar tool pattern]] {{l|ar||فَاعُول}} to {{bor|ar|grc|χαλινός|t=bit; thong; part of the tackle of a ship; anything that restrains from the outer}}. Also passed into {{cog|syc|ܟܠܴܢܳܐ|tr=klānā|t=bar or bolt for fastening doors, {{m|la|sera}}}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كَالُون}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كَالُون|m|pl=كَوَالِين}}

# [[lock]] [[install]]ed onto something; [[padlock]]
#* {{quote-web|ar|title=ar:8 نَصَائِحَ لِحِمَايَةِ شَقَّتِكَ مِنَ ٱلسَّرِقَةِ .. تَعَرَّفْ عَلَيْهَا|trans-title=8 advices for the security of your apartment from thieves …  learn them|date=2017-01-22|url=https://www.youm7.com/story/2017/1/22/8-%D9%86%D8%B5%D8%A7%D8%A6%D8%AD-%D9%84%D8%AD%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%8A%D8%A9-%D8%B4%D9%82%D8%AA%D9%83-%D9%85%D9%86-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D8%B1%D9%82%D8%A9-%D8%AA%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%81-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%8A%D9%87%D8%A7/3066757|work=Al-Maṣr Al-Yawm
|passage=4 ـ تَرْكِيبُ '''كَالُونِ''' أَمَانٍ وَعَدَمُ ٱلْاِعْتِمَادِ عَلَى '''كَالُونٍ''' وَاحِدٍ عَلَى بَابِ شَقَّتِكَ.
|translation=4. Installation of security '''locks''' and not relying onto a single '''lock''' on the door of your apartment.}}

