Page 15388 كبابة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{wp|lang=ar}}
It can handily be derived as a diminutive formation of {{m|ar|كُبَّة|t=spherule; meatball}}; however {{bor|ar|fa|کبابه چینی|tr=kabâba-yi čînî}}, {{m|fa|کباب چینی|tr=kabâb-i čînî|t=cubeb}} and {{bor|ar|ur|کَباب چینی}} / {{bor|ar|hi|कबाबचीनी|t=cubeb|g=f}} may also lay claim upon this word as more complete forms and closer to the plant’s home in {{w|Srivijaya}}. It could be a {{clq|ar|kaw|kumukus|t=cubeb; smoke|nocap=1}}, from {{m|kaw|kukus|t=smoke, steam}}, based on a connection to {{m+|ar|كُبَّة|t=meatball}} or {{m|ar|كَبَاب|t=roast meat, kebab}} respectively {{cog|fa|کباب|tr=kabâb|t=roast meat, kebab}} or {{cog|hi|कबाब|t=roast meat, kebab}}. However also present in {{bor|ar|syc|ܟܒܳܒܳܐ|tr=kəḇāḇā|t=cubeb}}, which can be put to {{m|syc|ܟܽܘܒܴ݁ܐ|t=spine|tr=kubbā}} used for various spiny plants, and would explain the vowel variation.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كَبَابَة|كُبَابَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كَبَابَة|f|head2=كُبَابَة}}

# [[cubeb]] ({{taxfmt|Piper cubeba|species}})
#: {{syn|ar|حَبّ الْعَرُوس}}
#: {{rfquotek|ar|Ibn Luyūn}}
#: {{rfquotek|ar|كتاب عمدة الطبيب في معرفة النبات لكل لبيب}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|كَبَابَة|head2=كُبَابَة}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|axm|քապապայ|bor=1}}

===References===
* {{R:syc:Brockelmann 1995|page=315}}
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II|page=1086}}, according to whom from Persian
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=436a–b}}, believing in a native derivation
* {{R:ar:Qamus|vol=I|page=242}}
* {{R:ar:Glessgen:1996|page=743}}, according to whom from Persian and the vowel form {{m|ar||كُبَابَة}} late
* {{R:ar:King:2015|page=504}}, deeming it a “good Arabic derivation”, though confronted with the view of a Persian borrowing, still “much more plausible”.
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=3|page=62}}
* {{R:ar:Steinschneider|6|page=327|section=1637}}
* {{R:ar:WKAS|I|page=16b}}, claims the vowel form {{m|ar||كُبَابَة}} late
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=946b}}

{{C|ar|Piperales order plants}}
