{{bor+|ar|gez|ክብር}}, see {{m|ar|كِبْرِيَاء}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|كِبْر|m}}

# [[majesty]], [[glory]], [[highness]] 
# [[pride]], [[presumptuosity]], [[superciliousness]], [[haughtiness]], [[greed]] for [[glory]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|40|56|footer=<small>Translates {{w|Marmaduke Pickthall|Pickthall}}</small>|passage=إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يُجَـٰدِلُونَ فِي ءَايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ بِغَيْرِ سُلْطَـٰنٍ أَتَىٰهُمْ إِن فِي صُدُورِهِمْ إِلَّا '''كِبْرٌ''' مَّا هُم بِبَـٰلِغِيهِ|t=Lo! those who wrangle concerning the revelations of Allah without a warrant having come unto them, there is naught else in their breasts save '''pride''' which they will never attain.}}
# [[leonine share]], [[greatest]] [[deal]], [[bulk]]
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|24|11|footer=<small>Translates {{w|Marmaduke Pickthall|Pickthall}}</small>|passage=إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ جَآءُو بِٱلْإِفْكِ عُصْبَةٌ مِّنْكُمْ لَا تَحْسَبُوهُ شَرًّا لَّكُم بَلْ هُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍ مِّنْهُم مَّا ٱكْتَسَبَ مِنَ ٱلْإِثْمِ وَٱلَّذِي تَوَلَّى '''كِبْرَهُ''' مِنْهُمْ لَهُ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ|subst=كِبْرَهُ/كِبْرَ-هُو,لَهُ/لَ-هُو|t=Lo! they who spread the slander are a gang among you. Deem it not a bad thing for you; nay, it is good for you. Unto every man of them (will be paid) that which he hath earned of the sin; and as for him among them who had '''the greater share therein''', his will be an awful doom.}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|كِبْر}}

===Etymology 3===
{{rfe|ar}}
{{wikipedia|lang=ar|جزيرة كبر}}
{{wikipedia|lang=en|Kubbar Island}}

