# the [[Scripture]], the [[Qur'an]] or the [[Bible]]
# [[letter]], [[note]], [[paper]], piece of [[writing]], [[message]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|27|29-31|passage=قَالَتْ يَا أَيُّهَا ٱلْمَلَأُ إِنِّي أُلْقِيَ إِلَيَّ '''كِتَابٌ''' كَرِيمٌ{{nbsp}}&#1757; إِنَّهُ مِنْ سُلَيْمَانَ وَإِنَّهُ بِسْمِ ٱللَّٰهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ{{nbsp}}&#1757; أَلَّا تَعْلُوا عَلَيَّ وَأْتُونِي مُسْلِمِينَ{{nbsp}}&#1757;|t=She said, O eminent ones, indeed, to me has been delivered a noble '''letter'''. Indeed, it is from Solomon, and indeed, it is: 'In the name of God, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful, be not haughty with me but come to me in submission.'}}
# {{senseid|ar|book}} [[book]]
#: {{ux|ar|الْكِتَاب|the [[Qur'an]]; the [[Bible]]|inline=1}}
# [[record]], [[document]], [[deed]], [[contract]]
# a [[marriage]] contract.
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} {{ar-verbal noun of|كَتَبَ|form=I}}
# {{ar-verbal noun of|كَاتَبَ|form=III}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|24|33
|passage=وَٱلَّذِينَ يَبْتَغُونَ '''ٱلْكِتَابَ''' مِمَّا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَانُكُمْ فَكَاتِبُوهُمْ
|t=And those who seek a '''contract''' (for eventual emancipation) from among whom your right hands possess - then make a contract with them}}

