Page 15421 كتب: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Guercino Sibilla Persica.jpg|thumb|right|upright=1.19|{{l|ar||تَكْتُبُ ٱمْرَأَةٌ رِسَالَةً|t=a woman is writing a letter}}]]

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ك ت ب}}
From {{inh|ar|sem-wes-pro|*katab-}}, but the sense "to write" has long been considered a borrowing from another {{cog|sem-cen}} language, perhaps denominally from {{m|ar|كِتَاب}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|كَتَبَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-كتب.ogg}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:كِتَابَة,كَتْب,كِتَاب}} {{tlb|ar|transitive}}

# to [[mark]] (symbols, shapes, graphs, glyphs, letters, and the like) on a [[surface]], to [[write]], to [[inscribe]]
## to [[draw]] (figures)
##: {{syn|ar|رَسَمَ|خَطَّ|t1=to draw (a shape or a letter)|t2=to handwrite}}
##: {{hypo|ar|حَبَرَ|t=to ink}}
## to [[cut]] (figures)
##: {{syn|ar|نَقَشَ|t1=to inscribe by carving, to engrave, to etch}}
# to [[produce]] or [[generate]] by [[writing]]
## to [[write up]], to [[compose]], to [[draw up]], to [[draft]]
##: {{syn|ar|أَنْشَأَ|سَطَرَ|t1=to compose|t2=to line; to write}}
##: {{hypo|ar|أَلَّفَ|صَنَّف|نَظَمَ|t1=to author|t2=to compile; to compose|t3=to compose (rhyming and metrical verse)}}
## to [[set down]] [[figure]]s with a [[typewriter]] or a [[keyboard]], to [[typewrite]] or [[keyboard]], to [[type]]
# to [[put down]] in [[writing]], to [[write down]]; to [[record]]; to [[register]]; to [[track]]
#: {{syn|ar|سَجَّلَ|t=to record, to register; to account for}}
#: {{hypo|ar|أَحْصَى|أَرَّخَ|t1=to record or enumerate in writing or otherwise|t2=to chronicle, to historize}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|4|81|passage=وَٱللَّهُ يَكْتُبُ مَا يُبَيِّتُونَ فَأَعْرِضْ عَنْهُمْ وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ|subst=وَٱللَّهُ//وَ-ٱلَّهُ,وَتَوَكَّلْ//وَ-تَوَكَّلْ,ٱللَّهِ//ٱلَّهِ|t=But God '''records''' what they scheme by night; so turn away from them and rely upon Allah.}}
## to [[write down]] (an event, such as a destiny or a fatality); to [[destine]] or [[predestine]]; to [[foreordain]]
##: {{syn|ar|قَدَّرَ}}
##* {{RQ:Qur'an|9|51|passage=قُل لَنْ يُصِيبَنَا إِلَّا مَا '''كَتَبَ''' اللَّهُ لَنَا|subst=اللَّهُ//ٱلَّهُ|t=Say "Never will we be struck except by what Allah '''has decreed''' for us..."}}
## to [[write down]] (an ordinance, a law, a commandment, or the like); to [[prescribe]]
##* {{RQ:Qur'an|5|32|passage=مِنْ أَجْلِ ذٰلِكَ '''كَتَبْنَا''' عَلَىٰ بَنِي إِسْرَائِيلَ أَنَّهُ مَن قَتَلَ نَفْسًا بِغَيْرِ نَفْسٍ أَوْ فَسَادٍ فِي الْأَرْضِ فَكَأَنَّمَا قَتَلَ النَّاسَ جَمِيعًا وَمَنْ أَحْيَاهَا فَكَأَنَّمَا أَحْيَا النَّاسَ جَمِيعًا|subst=وَمَنْ//وَ-مَنْ|t=Because of that, '''We decreed''' upon the Children of Israel that whoever kills a soul unless for a soul or for corruption in the land; it is as if he had slain mankind entirely. And whoever saves one: it is as if he had saved mankind entirely.}}
## to [[bequeath]]
##* {{RQ:Qur'an|5|21|passage=يَا قَوْمِ ٱدْخُلُوا ٱلْأَرْضَ ٱلْمُقَدَّسَةَ ٱلَّتِي '''كَتَبَ''' ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ وَلَا تَرْتَدُّوا عَلَى أَدْبَارِكُمْ فَتَنْقَلِبُوا خَاسِرِينَ|subst=وَلَا//وَ-لَا|t=O my people, enter the Holy Land that Allah '''has assigned''' to you and do not turn back and become losers.}}

