Page 15466 كذين: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كُدِين|كُوذِين|كُودِين|كُذِينَق|كُذِينَة|كُوذِينَة}}

===Etymology===
From the {{bor|ar|pal|-}} ancestor of, it is said, {{cog|fa-cls|کدنگ|tr=kudang}}, {{m|fa|کدنگه|tr=kodanga|t=fuller’s beetle}}, but {{m|fa|گزینه|tr=gazina}} also has this meaning, and the Arabic poet’s locus is vocalized with [[fatha|fatḥa]] in the first syllable by some editors. For the second vowel discrepancy compare {{m|fa|پودنه|tr=pudena}} and related forms. They also mirror the mid consonant variation in {{cog|fa-cls|کوتنگ|tr=kōtang|t=washer’s beetle}} and {{m|fa-cls|کوتک|tr=kūtak|t=cudgel, club, pestle}}, {{m|fa|کتک|tr=kotak, kotk|t=club, short stick for grinding, pestle}}, {{cog|ps|کوتک|tr=kōtak|t=cudgel, club, pestle; a wood for washing clothes}}. Further there are relations with {{cog|xco||tr=ckwndyk|t=hammer}}, {{m|xco||tr=ckwnd-|t=to hammer, to forge}}, {{m|xco||tr=ʾkwnd-|t=to beetle, to waulk}}, and one has to adduce {{cog|ota|كوتك|tr=kötek|t=bat, cudgel; beating, cudgelling}}, {{cog|az|kötək|t=wooden rod, bludgeon, cudgel; beating therewith}} and {{cog|tt|кутак|t=male member, willy}}. Note also {{cog|fa|کژک|tr=kažak|t=hook or crook; crooked stick […]; [[ward]]s of a lock}}, {{m|fa|کژه|tr=kaža|t=hook or crook; a piece of wood so placed as to prevent a lock from being opened}} which explains the inauspicious {{cog|ru|кута́к|t=door latch}}, apart from the known {{m|ru|кута́к|t=willy, [[hot rod]], [[hammer]], [[ramrod]]}}, although the surface relates {{m|fa|کژ|tr=kaž|t=crooked}}. Ultimately well-known suffixes which Monchi-Zadeh considers most likely appended to descendants of {{der|ar|ira-pro|*gádaH}}, {{der|ar|iir-pro|*gadaH|t=club}}, unextended in {{cog|fa|گز|tr=gaz|t=yard|id=Cubit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كُذِين}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كُذِين|m|pl=كَوَاذِين}}

# {{tlb|ar|obsolete}} [[fuller]]’s [[beetle]]
#: {{syn|ar|مِدَقّ|مِدَقَّة|مِكْبَس|بَيْزَر|بَيْذَر|بَيْزَارَة|وَبِيل|مِكْمَدَة}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|author={{lang|ar|{{w|lang=ar|دعبل الخزاعي}}}} [[https://en.wikishia.net/view/Di%27bil_b._%27Ali_al-Khuza%27i Diʿbil al-Ḵuzāʿīy]]|title=ar:اصرميني يا خلقة المجدار<qq:first line>|year=a. 861|url=https://www.aldiwan.net/poem29358.html|passage=اِصرِميني يا خِلقَةَ المِجدارِ …  وَصِليني بِطولِ بُعدِ المَزارِ<br/> فَلَقَد سُمَيتي بِوَجهِكِ وَالوَص …  لِ قُروحاً أُعيتُ عَلى المِسبارِ<br/> ذَقنٌ ناقِصٌ وَأَنفٌ طَويلٌ …  وَجَبينٌ كَساجَةِ القُسطارِ <br/>  طالَ لَيلي بِها فَبِتُّ أُنادي …  يا لَثارَاتِ مُستَضاءِ النَهارِ <br/>  قامَةُ الفُصعُلِ الضَئيلِ وَكَفٌّ …  خِنصَراها '''كُذَينَقا''' قَصّارِ}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|instead=1|lang=ar|page=145 line 7}}
#* {{RQ:Qazwiniy:1849|2|page=150 line 15 and 22}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|كُذِين|pl=كَوَاذِين}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Goeje|Indices|page=339}}
* {{R:trk:ESTJa|vol=V|pages=123–124}}
* {{R:fa:Monchi-Zadeh:1990|page=195 Nr. 573 redirecting to pages 59–60 Nr. 174}}

{{C|ar|Tools|Laundry}}
