===Etymology 2===
Ultimately from {{der|ar|akk|𒄀𒆤𒈣|ts=kuru|t=short reed mat, collection of reeds; a woven thing}}, from {{der|ar|sux|𒄥|tr=gur|gloss=to twist, to wind, to turn}}.

