## {{lb|ar|{{w|Basra|al-Baṣra}}, {{w|Wasit, Iraq|Wāṣiṭ}}}} 120 {{l|ar|قَفِيز}}, 2880 kg
# {{lb|ar|dialectal|Syria}}{{C|ar|Baby animals}} the [[foal]] of an [[ass]]

