===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|כְּרָאכָא}} / {{m|arc|כְּרָכָא|tr=kərāḵā|t=large mat}}, so attested in {{cog|tmr|-}} also for boats, while {{cog|syc|ܟܪܵܟܵܐ|tr=kərāḵā}} means more generally “revolving, being wrapped or going around”.

