===Etymology 1===
{{etymid|ar|bm}}
Borrowed from {{bor|ar|pal|sc=Latn||*karag}} whence {{cog|fa|کره|id=bm|tr=kare|t=butter; mouldiness, mustiness}}. The verbs are denominal.

====Pronunciation====
* {{sense|noun}} {{ar-IPA|كَرَج}}
* {{sense|stem I}} {{ar-IPA|كَرِجَ}}
* {{sense|stem II}} {{ar-IPA|كَرَّجَ}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|كَرَج|m}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete|rare}}

# [[mouldiness]], [[mustiness]], the being, becoming or having become [[bad]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|كَرَج}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-self|ar|كَرِجَ}}, {{l-self|ar|كَرَّجَ}}, {{l|ar|أَكْرَجَ}}, {{l|ar|تَكَرَّجَ}}, all of like meaning

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.pass.vn:كَرَج}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete|intransitive|rare}}

# to [[go bad]], to go [[mouldy]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.pass.vn:كَرَج}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.nopass}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete|intransitive|rare}}

# to go bad, to go mouldy

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.nopass}}

===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|ar|Georgia}}
From {{bor|ar|fa|گرج|tr=gorj}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|كُرْج}}

====Proper noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|كُرْج|sing=كُرْجِيّ|singg=m}}

# {{tlb|ar|collective|historical|_|or|_|obsolete}} [[Georgian]]s (especially in the [[Middle Ages]])

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|كُرْج|sing=كُرْجِيّ}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|جُورْجِيَا|tr=jorjiyā}}
* {{l|ar|جَرْجَان}}

===Etymology 3===
{{etymid|ar|colt}}
From {{bor|ar|pal|tr=kwlk'|ts=kurrag|t=colt}} whence {{cog|fa|کره|id=colt|tr=korra|t=colt}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ar|كُرَّك||rare}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|كُرَّج|كُرِّج}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|كُرَّج|head2=كُرِّج|m}} {{tlb|ar|obsolete}}

# [[hobby horse]], [[wooden]] [[imitation]] of a [[horse]] for [[child]]ren to play
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=915|title={{w|lang=ar|تاريخ الطبري|Tārīḵ}}|author={{w|Al-Tabari|At-Ṭabarī}}|section=ed. [http://solo.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/primo_library/libweb/action/display.do?tabs=detailsTab&ct=display&fn=search&doc=oxfaleph015147832&indx=1&recIds=oxfaleph015147832 de Goeje] series 3 page 971 last line, web [http://al-hakawati.net/Books/BookDetails/4062/المجلد-الثامن--وثوب-الجند-بطاهر-بن-الحسين-بعد-مقتل-الأمين here] and [https://shamela.ws/book/9783/4870 there]
|passage=وإذا محمد في كُرَّج، وإذا الدار مملوءة وصائف وخدماً، وإذا اللعّابون يلعبون، ومحمد وسطهم في الكُرَّج يرقص فيه،}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|كُرَّج|head2=كُرِّج}}

