Page 15520 كرسف: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كُرْفُس||hardly found in use, apparently original form obsolete by the time Arabic is usually attested}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|sa|कर्पास|t=cotton}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كُرْسُف}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كُرْسُف|m|pl=كَرَاسِف}}

# {{tlb|ar|classical}} [[cotton]]
#: {{syn|ar|قُطْن|عُطْب}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=w:Labīd|year=a. 660|title=unclear title|passage=لَهَا غُلَلٌ مِنْ رَازِقِيّ وَكُرْسُف|t=There are coverings of rāziqīy linen and cotton}}
