{{slim-wikipedia|lang=ar|Vicia ervilia|كِرْسَنَّة}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|arc|כַּרְשִׁינָא|tr=karšinnā}} or {{bor|ar|he|כַּרְשִׁינָה|tr=karšīna}}. That is explained as from {{der|ar|sa|कृष्ण|t=black}} and so this is a {{doublet|ar|كُشْنَى|t1={{taxlink|Vicia palaestina|species}}|nocap=1}}, which comes via {{cog|syc|ܟܘܫܢܐ|tr=kūšnā}}, also in {{cog|akk|𒄘𒃻𒄯𒊏|ts=kiššanu}}, or instead as from {{cog|syc|ܟܱܪܣܴܢܳܐ|tr=karsānā, karsannā|t=ventrose}} (to {{der|ar|sem-pro|*kariś-|t=paunch}}) because of flatulence of the belly one has when eating from this plant.

Akin to {{cog|xcl|քրսամն}}, {{cog|hy|քուռուշնա}}, {{cog|az|kürüşnə}}, {{m|az|kürişnə}}.

