#: {{syn|ar|سَخِيّ}}
#: {{ant|ar|بَخِيل}}
#: {{ux|ar|كَرِيمٌ هُوَ الَّذِي يَسْتَمِعُ إِلَى الآخَرِينَ وَيَسَاعِدُهُمْ بِكُلِّ مَا يَحْتَاجُونَ إِلَيْهِ.|He is generous, as he listens to others and helps them with everything they need.}}
# [[venerable]], [[honored]]
# [[precious]]
#: {{uxi|ar|حَجَرٌ كَرِيمٌ|precious stone}}
# {{lb|ar|definite}} a title of [[God]] in [[Islam]]
# a kind of [[turtledove]]

