* {{l|ar|كُزْبَرَةُ الْثَعْلَبِ|t=[[pimpernel]], ''[[Sanguisorba minor]]'' as also ''[[Anagallis arvensis]]''}}
* {{l|ar|كُزْبَرَةُ الْحَبَشَةِ|t={{vern|yellow germander}}, {{taxlink|Teucrium flavum|species}}}}
* {{l|ar|كُزْبَرَةُ الْحَمَامِ|t={{vern|common fumitory}}, {{taxlink|Fumaria officinalis|species}}}}
* {{l|ar|كُزْبَرَةٌ بَرِّيَّةٌ|t={{vern|common fumitory}}, {{taxlink|Fumaria officinalis|species}}}}
* {{l|ar|كُزْبَرَةُ الْمَلِكِ|t={{taxlink|Fumaria capreolata|species}} or {{taxlink|Fumaria spicata|species}} or {{taxlink|Fumaria muralis|species}}}}

