===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كُسْب|كُزْب|كُسْبَا|كُسْبَج}}

===Etymology===
Partially from {{bor|ar|fa|کسپه|tr=kospe}} and partially from {{bor|ar|arc|כוספא}} / {{m|syc|ܟܘܣܦܐ|tr=kuspā}}, {{m|syc|ܟܘܨܦܐ|tr=kuṣpā}}, {{m|syc|ܟܘܣܒܐ|tr=kusbā}}, from which first also {{cog|tr|küspe|t=pulp, residue of seeds}}, ultimately from {{der|ar|akk|𒆪𒊻𒁍|tr=ku-us-pu|ts=kuspu}}, also {{m|akk|𒁺𒋢|tr=kup-su|ts=kupsu}}, {{m|akk|𒆠𒄑𒁍|tr=ki-is-pu|ts=kispu, kisbu|t=husks, bran; residue of pressed dates or sesame etc.}}. The meaning of a date sort possibly is to be separated as belonging to {{m|ar|قَسْب|t=dried dates}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كُسْبَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كُسْبَة|f}}

# [[refuse]] of [[oil]] [[plant]]s, the [[oil cake]] of [[sesame]] or [[castor bean]], pulp of [[cotton]] or the like, what is left of [[press]]ed [[fruit]]s
#* {{quote-web|ar|title=ar: تسمين الأغنام|work=Ministry of Local Administration of the Syrian Arabic Republic|url=http://www.reefnet.gov.sy/reef/index.php?option=com_content&view=category&id=51%3Aanimals&Itemid=150&layout=blog&limitstart=35<!--and www.reefnet.gov.sy/reef/index.php?option=com_content&view=category&id=51%3Aanimals&Itemid=150&layout=blog&limitstart=35 -->|year=2006|passage=يجب العمل على جرش كسبة القطن لأنها ترد بشكل قطع لايمكن للخراف التهامها.|t=It is necessary to work on crushing the cotton refuse for it is in strips which the lambs cannot swallow.}}
# a sort of [[date]]s
#* {{RQ:Awwam|7|43|volume=1|page=344 l. 12}}
#* {{RQ:Awwam|8|13|volume=1|page=492 l. 1}}

