Borrowed from {{bor|ar|syc|ܟܰܠܟܳܐ|tr=kalkā}}, from {{der|ar|akk|kalakku|𒋢𒅗𒆷𒆠|tr=<sup>KUŠ</sup>ka-la-ke|ts=kalakku}}, from {{der|ar|sux|𒋢𒆠𒇲|ts=kila|t=box, container, vessel}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كَلَك}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كَلَك|m|pl=كَلَكَات}} {{tlb|ar|Iraq}}

# [[raft]] {{gloss|of inflated skins}}
#: {{near-syn|ar|شَنَان|رَمَث|طَوْف}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|كَلَك|pl=كَلَكَات}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|fa|کلک|tr=kalak|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|ota|كلك|tr=kelek|bor=1|id=raft}}
* {{desc|zza|kelek|bor=1}}

===References===
* {{R:CAL|klk|N}}
* {{R:Kaufman-Infl.|page=61}}
* {{R:akk:Meissner:1894|pages=270–272}}

{{C|ar|Watercraft}}

-------- end text --------
Page 15671 كلكلانج: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كَلانَج|جَلْكَلَانَج}}

===Etymology===
Probably via {{bor|ar|pal|-}} from {{der|ar|sa|*[[कल्क]]-[[कल्याणक]]|lit=[[prosperous]] [[oily]] [[sediment]], [[good]] [[unguent]] or [[paste]]}}, or just {{m|sa|कल्याणक|t=prosperous}} which by itself already denotes an [[electuary]] oil, or {{m|sa|जलकरङ्क|t=coconut}}, where {{m|sa|करङ्क|t=skeleton, skull; the mere shell of coconut}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كَلْكَلَانَج}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كَلْكَلَانَج|m}}

# {{tlb|ar|obsolete}} the [[coconut oil|oil]] of the [[coconut]], used for [[medical]] [[treatment]]s as an [[electuary]]
#: {{syn|ar|دُهْن النَارَجِيل}}
#* {{RQ:Janah:2020|section=230 (fol. 22v,3)|page=420|passage=دهن الكلانج هو دهن الجوز الهندي.|t=Oil of cocoanut is the oil of coconut.}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|كَلْكَلَانَج}}

{{C|ar|Pharmaceutical drugs|Fats and oils}}
-------- end text --------
