Page 15673 كلم: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ك ل م}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.vn:+,كَلَام}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[speak]], to [[talk]], to [[address]]
#: {{ux|ar|لَا '''أُكَلِّمُ'''هُ آخِرَ الدَّهْرِ|I will not '''speak''' to him to the end of time}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.vn:+,كَلَام}}

===Etymology 2===
From the root {{ar-root|ك|ل|م}} in its original sense, "to use one's jaw", "to bite", "to chew". Compare {{cog|akk|𒄴|tr=kalmatu|t=insect, bug}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|كَلْم|m|pl=كُلُوم|pl2=كِلَام}}

# [[bite]], [[bitemark]]
# [[wound]], [[cut]], [[slash]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|كَلْم|pl=كُلُوم|pl2=كِلَام}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun-pl|كَلِم}}

# {{plural of|ar|كَلِمَة}}

