* {{R:ar:Lane}}, in the supplement, page 3003
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4}}
* The Pennsylvania Sumerian Dictionary, [http://psd.museum.upenn.edu/epsd/e6044.html  uman (INSECT)], University of Pennsylvania, 2004

