{{head|ar|pronoun|head=ـكُمْ|tr=-kum|g=m-p}} (''enclitic form of'' {{m|ar|أَنْتُم}})

# [[you]], [[your]] {{qualifier|masculine plural}} {{qualifier|bound object pronoun}}
#: {{lang|ar|السَّلامُ عَلَيْكُمْ}} ''as-salāmu ʿalay'''kum''''' — "peace be upon you"

===Etymology 4===
Compare {{ar-root|ب ك م|nocat=1}}.

