* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=2b|كبث}} and {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=62a|كنبث}} without the horsetail name
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=2|page=851b|كبث}} and {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=2|page=933b|كنبث}} without the horsetail name

