Page 15749 كنس: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ك ن س}}. In Fraenkel’s and Nöldeke’s view the meaning “to sweep” is from {{sl|ar|arc|notext=1|כְּנַשׁ}} / {{m|syc|ܟܢܫ|tr=kənaš|t=to gather; to sweep}}, denominal via {{m|ar|مِكْنَسَة|t=broom}}. Note {{cog|gdq|kənūs|t=to sweep}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u.nopass.vn:كُنُوس}}

# to [[hide]], to [[retreat]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|81|15-16
|passage=أُقْسِمُ بِالْخُنَّسِ الْجَوَارِ الْكُنَّسِ
|translation=I swear by the receding [planets], which fly by and fade}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u.nopass.vn:كُنُوس}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~u,i.vn:كَنْس}}

# to [[sweep]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|author=ar:{{w|lang=ar|وجدي الأهدل|وَجْدِيّ الْأَهْدَل}}|title=ar:أرض المؤامرات السعيدة|year=2018|isbn=978-614-469-069-7|publisher=Nawfal / Hachette Antoine|location=Bayrūt|page=181|passage=أطفأتُ المكيّف وفتحت النافذة، فدخل الهواء البحريّ حارّاً و'''كنس'''  الأوكسجين المُعلّب غير الصحّي من قفصي الصدري.|t=I quenched the air conditioner and opened the window, and sea wind entered hot and '''swept''' the unhealthy canned oxygen out of my ribcage.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u,i.vn:كَنْس}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj-pl|كُنَّس|p}}

# {{plural of|ar|كَانِس|t=''active participle of {{l-self|ar|كَنَسَ}}''}}

