* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=96}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|pages=63–64}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=2633}}
* {{R:acx:Nöldeke:1895|page=21}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|pages=1122–1123}}

