Page 15808 كوخ: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Muzeum dřevěného porculánu v Držkové - salašnická koliba.JPG|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|كُوخ}}|upright=1.2]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|كَاخ}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|ar|syc|ܟܘܟܝܬܐ|tr=kukkīṯā|t=shack, hut}}, from {{der|ar|arc|כוכי|tr=kukkī|t=shack, hut}}, ultimately from {{der|ar|akk|𒆠𒅅𒆠𒋙|tr=kikkiš|t=reed wall or fence; reed hut}}; cognates with {{cog|fa|کوخ|t=hut, shack}} and {{cog|ka|ქოხი|t=cabin, shack}}. Possibly conflated in other forms with {{noncog|pal|kwšk'|tr=kōšk|t=pavilion, palace}}, {{noncog|fa|کاخ|tr=kâx|t=palace, castle}}, and {{noncog|akk|𒆠𒅕𒄷|tr=kirḫu|t=acropolis, inner sanctum; a walled off enclosure intended for the priestly class}} > {{noncog|ar|كِرْح}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|كُوخ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|كُوخ|m|pl=أَكْوَاخ}}

# [[hut]], [[shack]], [[cottage]], [[lodge]], [[hutch]], [[cabin]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|كُوخ|pl=أَكْوَاخ}}

===References===
* {{R:CAL|kwky%232|N}}
* {{R:CAL|kwxh|N}}
* {{R:CAL|krx|N}}
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|pages=29–30}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=69}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=2635}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=991}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=1126}}

{{C|ar|Buildings|Housing}}
