Page 15834 كوكب سيار: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{calque|ar|grc|[[ἀστήρ|ἀστὴρ]] [[πλανήτης]]|t=[[wandering star]], [[planet]]}} as distinguished from the [[fixed star]]s, from {{af|ar|كَوْكَب|سَيَّار|t1=star|t2=wanderer}}.

