|translation=The Messenger of God, peace be upon him, cursed men who wear women's attire and women who wear men's attire.
|transliteration=laʿana rasūlu l-lahi ṣallā llāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallama r-rajula yalbasu libsata l-marʾati wa-l-marʾata talbasu libsata r-rajuli.}}

