Page 16041 لبن: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-wes-pro|*laban-}}, from the root {{ar-root|ل ب ن}}. Cognate to {{cog|he|לָבָן||white|tr=laván}}, {{cog|uga|𐎍𐎁𐎐}}, and {{cog|phn|𐤋𐤁𐤍}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|لَبَن}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|لَبَن|m|pl=أَلْبَان|pl2=لِبَان}}

# {{lb|ar|uncountable|Standard Arabic|_|and|_|Egyptian|_|colloquial}} [[milk]]
#: {{usex|ar|لَا تَأْكُلِ السَّمَكَ وَتَشْرَبَ '''اللَّبَنَ'''|t=Do not eat fish and drink '''milk''' at the same time.}}
# {{lb|ar|uncountable|Levant|Iraq|Peninsula}} [[coagulated]] [[sour milk]]; [[yogurt]] (often [[strained]] yogurt); “[[leban]]”
#: {{syn|ar|زَبَادِيّ|qq1=the original Egyptian word formed from {{m|arz|زِبْدَة|tr=zibda|t=butter}}|لَبَن رَائِب|qq2=specified to avoid confusion|رَوْب|qq3=strictly curdled milk|يُوغُورْت|qq4=|مَاسْت|qq5=Classical Arabic|[[جُغْرَات]] ~ [[صُقْرَاط]]|qq6=Classical Arabic}}
# {{lb|ar|uncountable|Kuwait|Morocco|Algeria}} [[coagulated]] milk drink specifically (i.e. excluding [[yoghurt]]); yoghurt or [[buttermilk]] drink.
# {{l|ar||اَلْأَلْبَان}}: [[dairy]] products

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|لَبَن|pl=أَلْبَان|pl2=لِبَان}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|ar|حَلِيب}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|afb|لِبَن|tr=liban}}
* {{desc|acw|لبن|tr=laban}}
* {{desc|acm|لِبَن|tr=liban}}

===Etymology 2===
As {{cog|he|לְבֵנָה||brick|tr=ləḇenā́}} borrowed from {{bor|ar|arc|לְבִינְּתָּא|tr=ləḇinṯā, ləḇittā}} (written in {{cog|syc|ܠܒܬܐ||tr=ləḇettā}}), from {{der|ar|akk|𒋞|ts=libittu|tr=SIG<sub>4</sub>}}, whence also {{cog|uga|𐎍𐎁𐎐𐎚}}, from the root in Akkadian corresponding to {{ar-root|ل ب ن|nocat=1}}, apparently the singulative in Arabic came first.

====Noun====
{{ar-coll-noun|لِبْن|m|sing=لِبْنَة|head2=لَبِن|sing2=لَبِنَة}}

# [[brick]]s, [[adobe]]s

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|لِبْن|head2=لَبِن}}

===Etymology 3===
{{denominal verb|ar}} of {{l|ar|لَبِن|t=brick}}.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II.ipass?}}

# to make [[brick]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II.ipass?}}

===References===
* {{R:CAL|lbnh|N}}
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|pages=4–5}}
* {{R:Kaufman-Infl.|page=66}}

{{C|ar|Milk|Building materials}}

-------- end text --------
