Page 16063 لجأة: -------- begin text --------
{{ar-rootbox|ل ج ء}}
[[File:Cobblers Reef Turtle 2013.JPG|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|لَجَأَة}} – {{taxfmt|Caretta caretta|species}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|لَجِئَ}} due to the animal taking refuge in its shell, attested since the 9<sup>th</sup> century. In the sense of a roll-slide {{sl|ar|grc|χελώνη|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|لَجَأَة}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|لَجَأَة|f|pl=لَجَآت}}

# {{C|ar|Turtles}} [[sea turtle]]
# {{C|ar|Simple machines}} {{lb|ar|obsolete|rare}} [[rolling]] [[slide]] to [[move]] [[heavy]] [[load]]s

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|لَجَأَة|pl=sfp}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:WKAS|II|part=I|pages=230–238a}}
* {{R:ar:Ullmann-Nomen-generis|page=96}}
