Page 16098 لدن: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ar|un}}

===Etymology 1===
{{uncertain|ar}}, often considered a variation of {{m|ar|لَدَى}} perhaps the /[[ن]]/ reflecting a vestigial duality; at one's two hands. Alternatively, by analogy with one's feet, developed from a contraction of {{l|ar|لَ|tr=|t=to, for}} + {{l|ar|دُون|tr=|t=beneath; by one's feet}}; hence coming to or being at a space or duration close or near, right at their feet, immediately before them, in the presence of, happening or being near, following in a location or time.

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|لَدُنْ}}

# [[at]], [[by]], [[near]], since, from the moment that
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|18|10
|passage=إِذْ أَوَى الْفِتْيَةُ إِلَى الْكَهْفِ فَقَالُوا رَبَّنَا آتِنَا مِنْ '''لَدُنْكَ''' رَحْمَةً وَهَيِّئْ لَنَا مِنْ أَمْرِنَا رَشَدًا
|translation=<small>Mufti Taqi:</small> When the young men took refuge in the Cave and said, “Our Lord, bless us with mercy from Your own and provide us with guidance in our matters.”}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Usually preceded by {{m|ar|مِنْ|t=from}}.

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|لَدُنْ|1s=[[لَدُنِّي]] / [[لَدُنِّيَ]]}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|ar|لَدَى}}
* {{l|ar|عِنْدَ}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|لَدُنِّيّ|pos=adjective}}
** {{l|ar|اَلْعِلْمُ اللَّدُنِّيّ}}

===Etymology 2===

====Verb====
{{ar-verb-form|لِدْنَ|I}}

# {{inflection of|ar|وَلَدَ||2|f|p|actv|impr}}

-------- end text --------
Page 16099 لدى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Related to {{cog|arc|ליד|tr=lyd|t=under control of, next to}} and {{cog|tmr|לידי|tr=lydy|t=into one's possession, into a state of, towards}}. Developed parallel with {{l|ar|لَدُن|tr=|t=}}, derived from a contraction of {{l|ar|لَ|tr=|t=to, for; at}} + {{l|ar|يَد|يَدَا|tr=|t=hand}}; at hand. Hence rendering the sense, to be right before them, to be in their presence, immediately at their person, nearly occupying the same location, as close as one can get.

===Preposition===
{{ar-prep|لَدَى}}

# [[at]], [[near]]
# [[on]], [[upon]] (something occurring or someone doing something)
# [[with]]

====Inflection====
{{ar-prep-auto|لَدَى}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ar|عِنْدَ}}
-------- end text --------
