# [[thin]], [[fine]], [[delicate]], [[dainty]]
# [[little]], [[small]], [[cute]]
# [[gentle]], [[soft]], [[light]], [[mild]]
# [[pleasant]], [[agreeable]]
# [[amiable]], [[friendly]], [[kind]], [[nice]]
# [[civil]], [[courteous]], [[polite]], [[refined]]
# [[charming]], [[lovely]], [[graceful]], [[elegant]]

