Page 16208 لم: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|لَمْ}}

====Particle====
{{ar-particle|لَمْ}}

# [[not]] (negating past tense)
#: {{see also|[[ما|مَا]]}}
#: {{ux|ar|'''لَمْ''' [[كتب|يَكْتُبْ]]|t=He '''has not''' written.|inline=t}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|98|1|passage='''لَمۡ''' يَكُنِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ مِنۡ أَهۡلِ ٱلۡكِتَٰبِ وَٱلۡمُشۡرِكِينَ مُنفَكِّينَ حَتَّىٰ تَأۡتِيَهُمُ ٱلۡبَيِّنَةُ.|t=Those who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists were '''not''' to be parted [from misbelief] until there came to them clear evidence.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{lang|ar|لم}} is used to deny the [[past tense|past]]. It governs the [[jussive]] of the verb.

=====See also=====
* Negative particles: {{l|ar|لَا}}, {{l|ar|لَن}}, {{l|ar|مَا}}
* {{l|ar|لَيْسَ}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|لِمَ}}

====Adverb====
{{ar-adv|لِمَ}}

# [[for what]], [[why]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|61|2-3|passage=يَا أَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ آمَنُوا '''لِمَ''' تَقُولُونَ مَا لَا تَفْعَلُونَ &#1757; كَبُرَ مَقْتًا عِنْدَ ٱللّٰهِ أَن تَقُولُوا مَا لَا تَفْعَلُونَ|t=O you who have believed! '''Why''' do you say what you do not do? Great is hatred in the sight of Allah that you say what you do not do.}}

===Etymology 3===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|لُمْ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb-form|لُمْ|I}}

# {{inflection of|ar|لَامَ||2|m|s|actv|impr}}

[[Category:Arabic jussive particles]]
[[Category:Arabic negatives]]

-------- end text --------
Page 16209 لما: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{univerbation|ar|لَم|مَا|t1=not|pos2=relative}}, the original thought being "but not have it that".

====Particle====
{{ar-particle|لَمَّا}}

# [[not yet]], [[but]] [[not]], [[yet]] not; {{qualifier|governs a [[jussive]] verb}}

====Adverb====
{{ar-adv|لِمَا}}

# for [[what]] {{gloss|[[relative]], not [[interrogative]]}}

===Etymology 2===
{{univerbation|ar|لِ|إِمَّا|t1=for|pos2=as for}}, the original thought being "for as for [when] this is so".

====Conjunction====
{{ar-con|لَمَّا}}

# [[when]]; {{qualifier|in the past only}}
# [[in view of]], the [[fact]] that; [[because]], [[since]]
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 1002|author=w:Ibn Jinni|title=w:ar:سر صناعة الإعراب|passage=فَلَمَّا لَمْ يَرْتَبِطْ أَوَّلُ الْكَلَامِ بِآخِرِهِ لِأَنَّ أَوَّلَهُ فِعْلٌ وَآخِرُهُ ٱسْمَانِ، وَٱلْأَسْمَاءُ لَا يُعَادَلُ بِهَا ٱلْأَفْعَال، أَدْخَلُوا هُنَاكَ حَرْفًا يَدُلُّ عَلَى أَنَّ مَا بَعْدَهُ مُسَبَّبٌ عَمَّا قَبْلَهُ لَا مَعْنَى لِلْعَطْفِ فِيهِ فَلَمْ يَجِدُوا هَٰذَا الْمَعْنَى إِلَّا فِي الْفَاءِ وَحْدَهَا.}}
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} {{synonym of|ar|إِلَّا|t=[[except]]}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|86|4|passage=إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ}}

====Proper noun====
{{ar-proper noun|لَمَا|f}}

# {{given name|ar|female}}

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|لَمَا|state=ind-def}}

[[Category:Arabic jussive particles]]
[[Category:Arabic negatives]]

-------- end text --------
