Page 16227 له كل المجد: -------- begin text --------

===Phrase===
{{head|ar|phrase|head=[[لَهُ]] [[كُلُّ]] [[ٱلْمَجْدِ]]}}

# {{lb|ar|Christianity}} all [[glory]] be to him; {{non-gloss definition|an expression of praise commonly used after mentioning Christ}}
#: {{ux|ar|اَلسَّيِّدُ ٱلْمَسِيحُ —'''لَهُ كُلُّ ٱلْمَجْدِ'''— أَمَرَنَا بِالسَّعْيِ وَراءَ ٱلْقَداسَةِ.|Christ, '''all glory be to him''', has commanded us to strive for holiness.}}

====Usage notes====
* The Christian phrase is similar to—and to some degree possibly mirrors—certain Islamic expressions (compare “see also” below). It is not used with the same automaticity, however.

====See also====
* {{l|ar|تَبارَكَ وَتَعالَى}}
* {{l|ar|صَلَّى ٱللهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ}}
