# [[pound]], a denomination of currency used in Syria and Lebanon
# [[lira]], a denomination of currency used in Turkey
# [[lira]], a defunct currency formerly used in Italy
# [[livre]], a defunct currency formerly used in France

====Usage notes====
For the meaning “[[pound]]”, {{m|ar|لَيْرَة}} refers only to the [[w:Lebanese pound|Lebanese pound]] and the [[w:Syrian pound|Syrian pound]]. Most currencies called “[[pound]]” in English, including the [[w:pound sterling|pound sterling]] and the [[w:Egyptian pound|Egyptian pound]], are known as {{m|ar|جُنَيْه}} in Arabic.

====Declension====
