Page 16330 م ء ق: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Prefixed from {{ar-root|و ق ي}} to obtain an anatomical noun, from which the rest is denominal. {{m|ar|مَأْقًى|t=inner corner of the eye}} can actually be directly according to the usual grammar rules from {{m|ar|وَقَى|t=to guard ~ to regard ~ to observe}}, as {{m|ar|مُؤَقَّت}} equals {{m|ar|مُوَقَّت}}.

