# [[subject]], [[theme]], [[topic]], subject [[matter]]
# school [[subject]], [[field]] of study, [[discipline]]
# {{lb|ar|legal}} [[article]], [[paragraph]]
# {{lb|ar|legal}} [[stipulation]], contractual [[term]]

