Page 16731 متى: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
Compare {{m|ar|مَا|gloss=[[what]]?}} and {{m|ar|مَن|gloss=[[who]]?}}. Cognate to {{cog|he|מתי|tr=matai}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|مَتَى}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-متى.ogg}}

====Adverb====
{{ar-adv|مَتَى}}

# [[when]] (at what time?)
# [[whenever]]
#* {{quote-book
|ar
|year=a. 965
|author=Al-Mutanabbi
|chapter=ar:أَجابَ دَمعي وَما الداعي سِوى طَلَلِ
|chapterurl=http://www.almotanabbi.com/poemPage.do?poemId=178
|chapter_number=182
|title=The Works of 'Abū al-Ṭayyib al-Mutanabbī
|volume=3
|page=75
|year_published=1978
|publisher=Dār Al-Ma‘rifah
|passage='''مَتَى''' تَزُرْ قْوْمَ مَنْ تَهْوَى زِيَارَتَهَا / لَا يُتْحِفُوكَ بِغَيْرِ الْبِيضِ وَٱلْأَسَلِ}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|whenever}} {{l|ar|مَتَى مَا}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|arz|امتى|tr=emta}}
* {{desc|mt|meta}}
* {{desc|ary|امتى|tr=imta}}
* {{desc|apc|ايمتى|tr=ʔēmta}}
* {{desc|ajp|ايمتى|tr=ʔēmta}}

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|مَتَى}}

# {{tlb|ar|obsolete|rare|dialectal}} [[from]]
#* [[w:ar:أبو ذؤيب الهذلي|Abu Dhu'ayb Al-Hudhali]]
#*: {{quote|ar|شَرِبْنَ بِمَاءِ ٱلْبَحْرِ ثُمَّ تَرَفَّعَتْ مَتَى لُجَجٍ خُضْرٍ لَهُنَّ نَئِيجُ}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|ar|he|מתי|tr=mattai}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|مَتَّى}}

====Proper noun====
{{ar-proper noun|مَتَّى|m}}

# {{lb|ar|Christianity}} [[Matthew]], one of the Twelve [[Disciple]]s of [[Jesus]] and one of the Four [[Evangelist]]s
# {{lb|ar|Christianity}} [[Matthew]], the first of the four canonical [[gospel]]s

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|مَتَّى|state=ind-def}}

[[Category:Arabic interrogative adverbs]]
[[Category:Arabic jussive particles]]
[[Category:Arabic relative adverbs]]

