# [[when]]; [[whenever]]; [[if]] [[ever]]
#: {{ux|ar|'''مَتَى مَا''' تَجِئْ عِنْدِي أَسْعَدْ كَثِيرًا|t='''Whenever''' you come by my place, I feel so happy.}}
#* {{quote-book
|ar
|year=7th century {{CE}}
|author={{w|Ka'b ibn Zuhayr|Kaʿb ibn Zuhayr}}
|title={{link|ar||أَعلَمُ أَنّي مَتى ما يَأتِني قَدَري}}
|trans-title=My Fate
|passage=أَعْلَمُ أَنِّي '''مَتَى مَا''' يَأْتِنِي قَدَرِي * فَلَيْسَ يَحْبِسُهُ شُحٌّ وَلَا شَفَقُ
|subst=شَفَقُ/شَفَقُو
|t=I know so well that '''when''' my fate<br>Comes by for me, neither grudging<br>Nor pitying can hold him back.}}

[[Category:Arabic jussive particles]]
