{{ar-verb|I/a~u.pass.vn:مُثُول}}

# to [[resemble]], to [[look like]]
# to [[imitate]], to [[copy]]
# to [[compare]], to [[liken]] {{+obj|ar|acc<someone> + :بِ<with>}}
# to [[represent]], to [[mean]], to [[signify]], to [[stand for]]
