Page 16842 مجهول: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{ar-passive participle}} of {{m|ar|جَهِلَ||to be [[ignorant]], to not [[know]]}}, from the root {{ar-root|ج ه ل}}: literally, “not known”. The word is used to describe the passive voice, because in the passive the agent of the verb is usually not mentioned and is therefore unknown.

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj|مَجْهُول|pl=مَجْهُولُونَ|f=مَجْهُولَة}}

