===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ح ر م}}
{{ar-passive participle}} of {{m|ar|حَرَّمَ||to [[forbid]]}}; compare {{m|ar|حَرَام||[[forbidden]]}}.

====Adjective====
