Page 17133 مذ: -------- begin text --------

===Preposition===
{{ar-prep|مُذْ}} {{+obj|ar|gen/nom}}

# {{alternative form of|ar|مُنْذُ}}
#* Di'bil Al-Khuza'i
#*: {{quote|ar|أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنِّي '''مُذْ''' ثَلَاثُونَ حِجَّةً / أَرُوحُ وَأَغْدُو دَائِمَ ٱلْحَسَرَاتِ|
t=Can you not see<br>That I, '''for''' thirty years,<br>Would rise and sleep<br>With sorrows deep.}}

===Conjunction===
{{ar-con|مُذْ}}

# {{alternative form of|ar|مُنْذُ}}
#* Al-A'sha
#*: {{quote|ar|وَمَا زِلْتُ أَبْغِي ٱلْمَالَ '''مُذْ''' أَنَا يَافِعٌ <br> وَلِيدًا وَكَهْلًا حِينَ شِبْتُ وَأَمْرَدَا
|t=I've long'd for wealth<br>'''Since''' I was young:<br>Newborn and adult,<br>Beardless and aged.}}
#* Al-Mutanabbi
#*: {{quote|ar|أَرَى ٱلْعِرَاقَ طَوِيلَ اللَّيْلِ '''مُذْ''' نُعِيَتْ <br> فَكَيْفَ لَيْلُ فَتَى الفِتْيَانِ فِي حَلَبِ}}

====Usage notes====
* The word acquires a vowel and becomes {{m|ar|مُذُ}} or {{m|ar|مُذِ}} whenever a syllabic consonant comes after it, as when a definite noun follows it.
-------- end text --------
