* {{R:arc:Levy|volume=2|page=569a–b}}, to {{R:arc:Levy|volume=2|page=71a}}
* {{R:akk:Jensen:1892c|page=217}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=2|page=286–287}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=1|page=465}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Pflanzen|pages=248–249}}
