Page 17307 مرند: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar|mul=مقاطعة مرند}}

===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}. The {{cog|grc|-}} name is transmitted as {{m|grc|Μοροῦνδα}} by {{w|Ptolemy}}, and the {{m|grc|Μαροῦνδαι}} are said to have occupied territories up to Lake [[Urmia]] in the same, while they have been identified with the {{m|sa|मुरुण्ड}}, {{m|sa|शकमुरुण्ड}} of Sanskrit sources. The {{w|Murunda dynasty}} was extirpated in the 3rd century {{CE}} by the {{w|Gupta Empire}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مَرَنْد}}

===Proper noun===
{{ar-proper noun|مَرَنْد|f}}

# {{place|ar|city|p/East Azerbaijan Province|c/Iran|t1=Marand}}
#* {{R:ar:Goeje|M|instead=1|lang=ar|page=374 ''m''–''u''|section=web [http://islamport.com/w/bld/Web/451/136.htm 1/136]|passage=وأما أرمينية فإنها كورة جليلة رسمها أرميني بن كنظر بن يافث بن نوح ومنها ترتفع الستور والزلاليُّ الرفيعة كثيرة الخصائص قصبتها دَبِيل ومن مدنها: بَدْلِيس، خِلَاط، أَرْجِيش، بَرْكَرِي، خُوَيُّ، سَلَمَاس، أُرْمِيَة، دَاخَرَّقَان، مَرَاغَة، أَهْرُ، '''مَرَنْد'''، سَِنْجَان، قالِيقَلَا، قندرية، قَلْعَة يُونِس، نورين.|t=As for Armenia, she is a majestic expanse, originally sketched and contoured by ʔArmīnī, the son of {{w|Ashkenaz#Armenian_tradition|Ashkenaz}}, himself a descendant of {{w|Japheth}}, one of the sons of {{w|Noah}}. In Armenia, curtains, draperies, and rugs multifarious and fine hang down, the {{w|Curtain rod|rod}} being {{w|Dwin|Dabīl}}. Among her localities are {{w|Bitlis|Badlīs}} [Baghesh], {{w|Ahlat|Ḵilāṭ}} [Xlat], {{w|Erciş|ʔArjīš}} [Arjesh], [the small town of] {{w|Muradiye|Barkarī}} [east of Ḵilāṭ], {{w|Khoy|Ḵuway}} [Xoy], {{w|Salmas|Salamās}} [Salamas], {{w|Urmia|ʔUrmiyah}} [Urmia], {{w|Azarshahr|Dāḵarraqān}}, {{w|Maragheh|Marāḡah}}, {{w|Ahar|ʔAhr}}, '''{{w|Marand|Marand}}''', Sinjān, {{w|Erzurum|Qālīqalā}}, {{w|Qandariyah|Qandariyyah}}, Qalʕat Yūnus, Nūrīn.}}
#* {{RQ:Yaqut|W4|page=503}}
# {{place|ar|county|p/East Azerbaijan Province|c/Iran|t1=Marand County}} {{gloss|{{l|ar|مُقَاطَعَة مَرَنْد|tr=muqāṭaʕa marand}}}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|مَرَنْد:di|state=ind-def}}

