Page 17530 مسكين: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Probably from {{der|ar|syc|[[ܡܶܣܟܸܐܢܳܐ]] / [[ܡܶܣܟܸܢܳܐ]] / [[ܡܶܣܟܸܝܢܳܐ]]|t=miserable, wretched|tr=meskēnā}}, from {{der|ar|akk|muškēnum|𒈦𒆕𒂗|tr=muškēnum|t=commoner, poor}}. Also passed into {{der|ar|he|מִסְכֵּן|t=miserable|tr=miskēn}} and via {{cog|arc|מִסְכֵּינָא}} / {{m|syc|ܡܶܣܟܸܝܢܳܐ|tr=meskēnā}} into {{cog|gez|ምስኪን}}, {{cog|am|ምስኪን}}, {{cog|ti|መስኪን}}, {{cog|har|ሚስኪን}}.

