Page 17785 مطب: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed in the twentieth century from dialects, where there exists a verb {{m|ajp|طَبَّ|t=to come down, to land, to arrive, to hit}} and the place noun also means “place, stead”.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مَطَبّ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|مَطَبّ|m|pl=مَطَبَّات}}

# [[bump]], [[hump]], [[pocket]], something that [[decelerate]]s
#: {{uxi|ar|مَطَبّ هَوَائِيّ|{{l|en|air pocket}}}}
#: {{uxi|ar|مَطَبّ السُّرْعَة|{{l|en|speed bump}}}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|مَطَبّ|pl=مَطَبَّات}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=763}}
-------- end text --------
