===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مَطْبَخ}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|مَطْبَخ|m|pl=مَطَابِخ}}

# [[kitchen]]
# [[cuisine]], [[style]] of [[cooking]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|مَطْبَخ|pl=مَطَابِخ}}

