Page 17829 مع: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|uga|𐎎𐎓}}. Compare {{cog|he|עם|tr=ím / ʕím}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مَعَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-مع.ogg}}

===Preposition===
{{ar-prep|مَعَ}}

# [[with]], [[together with]], [[accompanied by]], in the [[company]] of
#: {{syn|ar|وَ}}
#: {{ant|ar|بِدُونِ|بِلَا}}
# in the [[estimation]] of, in the [[eyes]] of, in the [[opinion]] of
# [[in spite of]], [[despite]], [[even]] [[with]]
#: {{syn|ar|بَيْدَ}}
#: {{ux|ar|مَعَ البَرْدْ، ذَهَبْتُ|tr=|t=Even with the cold, I [still] went}}
# [[toward]], [[in relation to]]
# [[pro]], [[for]], [[advocate]] of, [[support]]ing
# [[have]]
#: {{syn|ar|لَدَا|لَدَى|لَدُنْ|عِنْدَ|لِ}}

====Usage notes====
{{ar-prep|مَعَ}} is used to mean "to have" when the object possessed is small and on the possessor's person. The possessor is expressed as the object of the preposition.

====Inflection====
{{ar-prep-auto|مَعَ}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|مَعًا|t=together}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|afb|مع|tr=maʕa}}
* {{desc|acw|مع|tr=maʕ}}
* {{desc|mt|ma'}}
* {{desc|ary|مع|tr=mʕa}}
* {{desc|aeb|مع|tr=mʕa}}

-------- end text --------
