* {{desctree|ota|مقدس|tr=mukaddes|bor=1}}
* {{desctree|fa|مقدس|tr=moqaddas|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tt|мөкаддәс|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tk|mukaddes|bor=1}}

