{{ar-decl-noun|مَقْل}}

===Etymology 2===
Apparently a {{bor|ar|dra|-}} borrowing, compare {{cog|te|మొగలి}}, {{cog|ta|முசலி}} meaning apart from other things [[screw pine]]. Passed also into {{cog|tmr|מוקלא}} and {{cog|syc|ܡܘܩܠܐ|tr=muqlā}} already witnessed from the 5<sup>th</sup> century.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|مُقْل|m}}

# [[guggul]] ({{taxlink|Commiphora mukul|species}} syn. {{taxlink|Commiphora wightii|species}} syn. {{taxlink|Balsamodendron mukul|species}})
# [[gingerbread palm]] ({{taxlink|Hyphaene thebaica|species}} syn. {{taxlink|Palma thebaica|species}})

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|مُقْل}}

