===Etymology===
Of uncertain etymology. Variously explained as
* From a similar name {{m|ar|بَكَّة}} appearing in the Quran
* Possibly from {{bor|ar|gez|ምኵራብ|t=sanctuary, temple}}, {{doublet|ar|مِحْرَاب|nocap=1}}; compare {{cog|el|Μακοράβα}}.<ref>{{R:Etymonline|Mecca}}</ref>
{{etystub|ar}}

