{{ar-verb|I/a~i.pass.vn:مَلْك,مِلْك,مُلْك,مَلَكَة,مَمْلُكَة,مَمْلِكَة,مَمْلَكَة}}

# to take in [[possession]], to take over, to [[acquire]], to [[seize]]
# to [[possess]], to lay hold, to [[own]], to [[have]], to be the [[owner]]
#: {{ux|ar|الرَجُلُ يَمْلِكُ سَيَّارَةً جَديدَةً.|The man owns a new car.}}
