===Noun===
{{ar-noun|مَلَكُوت|m}}

# [[kingdom]], [[dominion]], [[reign]]
#: {{syn|ar|مَمْلَكَة|مُلْك}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|6|75|passage=وَكَذَٰلِكَ نُرِي إِبْرَٰهِيمَ '''مَلَكُوتَ''' ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَلِيَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُوقِنِينَ|t=And thus did We show Abraham the '''kingdom''' of the heavens and the earth so that he would be among the certain in faith}}
#* {{RQ:SVD|Matthew|8|11|passage=
وَأَقُولُ لَكُمْ أَنَّ كَثِيرِينَ سَيَأْتُونَ مِنَ الْمَشْرِقِ وَالْمَغْرِبِ وَيَتَّكِئُونَ مَعَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْحَٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ فِي '''مَلَكُوتِ''' السَّمَٰوَٰتِ|t=And I say to you that many will come from east and west, and will recline with Abraham and Isaac and Jacob in the '''kingdom''' of the heavens.}}
# {{lb|ar|Christianity}} [[kingdom]] (of God) {{gloss|those places and spheres where God’s will truly reigns}}
#* {{Q|ar||[[Lord's Prayer]]|3-4|quote=لِيَأْتِ '''مَلَكُوتُ'''كَ! لِتَكُنْ مَشِيئَتُكَ عَلَى الأَرْضِ كَمَا هِيَ فِي السَّمَاءِ!|trans=Thy '''kingdom''' come. Thy will be done on earth as it is in heaven.|transauthor=[[w:Douay-Rheims Bible|Douay-Rheims]]|transyear=1582}}

