* {{R:ar:Fraenkel|page=283}}
* {{R:ar:Fraenkel-V|page=18}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=351}}
* {{R:ar:Müller:1887|page=30}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|نور}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|page=1327}}

