Page 18751 ميكال: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Alteration of {{m|ar|مِيكَائِيل}}. This reading is unique to the tradition of {{w|Hafs|Ḥafṣ}}, where other traditions have {{m|ar|مِيكَائِل}} or {{m|ar|مِيكَائِيل}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مِيكَال}}

===Proper noun===
{{ar-proper noun|مِيكَال|m}}

# {{lb|ar|Islam}} the [[archangel]] [[Michael]]

====Usage notes====
{{m|ar|مِيكَال}} is the form used in the most popular reading tradition of the {{w|Qur'an}} and is usually used in Islamic contexts. Arabic-speaking Christians usually refer to Michael as {{m|ar|مِيخَائِيل}}.

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|مِيكَالُ|state=ind-def}}
