# to [[make]] (someone) [[inclined]] or [[sympathetic]] {{+obj|ar|acc<someone> + :نَحْوَ/:إِلَى<towards someone/something>}}
# to [[make]] (someone) [[disinclined]], to [[alienate]] {{+obj|ar|acc<someone> + :عَنْ<towards/from someone/something>}}

