===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|ࢽ||African form; undotted when final}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{ar-IPA|نُون}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{ar-IPA|نْ}}

===Letter===
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ن '''/''' ن‍ '''/''' ‍ن‍ '''/''' ‍ن'''|tr=nūn}}

# The twenty-fifth letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. It is preceded by {{l|ar|م}} and followed by {{l|ar|ه}}.

===Symbol===
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''ن '''/''' ن‍ '''/''' ‍ن‍ '''/''' ‍ن'''|tr=nūn}}

# The fourteenth letter in traditional [[abjad]] order, which is used in place of numerals for list numbering ([[abjad numerals]]). It is preceded by {{l|ar|م}} and followed by {{l|ar|س}}.

===Suffix===
{{head|ar|suffix|head=ـنَّ|head2=ـنْ}}

# {{ngd|Suffix marking the short or long energetic mood of a verb that is preceded by {{m|ar|لَ}}.}}
#: {{ux|ar|لَتَشْرَبَ'''نَّ''' ٱلْمَاءَ أَوْ تَمُوتَ!|'''Indeed''', you either drink water or you die.}}
#: {{ux|ar|لَأُسَاعِدَ'''نَّ'''كُمْ جَمِيعًا!|I'll '''definitely''' help all of you.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|12:32
|passage=وَلَئِن لَّمْ يَفْعَلْ مَا آمُرُهُ '''لَيُسْجَنَنَّ''' '''وَلَيَكُونًا''' مِّنَ الصَّاغِرِينَ
|translation=And if he does not do what I order him to, he '''will certainly be imprisoned and fully''' disgraced.}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ar|pronoun|head=نِ}}

# {{alternative form of|ar|نِي}}
#* {{RQ:Qur’an|26|80|passage=وَإِذَا مَرِضْتُ فَهُوَ يَشْفِينِ|t=and when I get sick it is He who cures me}}

