===Etymology===
Apparently the most primitive senses are related to striving into a well to get water, which is confirmed by comparative evidence, regard {{cog|he|נָסַע|t=to pull out, to set out|tr=nāsaʿ}}, {{cog|arc|נְסַע|tr=nsaʿ|t=to remove}}, {{cog|uga|𐎐𐎒𐎓|t=to pull out}}, {{cog|akk|𒍣|ts=nasāḫu|t=to pull out}}, {{cog|akk|𒁁|ts=nēsu|t=to remove; to depart}}, {{cog|tig|ነዝዓ|t=to pull out}}, {{cog|gez|ነዝዐ|t=to pull out}}, {{m|gez|ነዝሐ|t=to pull out}}, {{cog|sem-srb|𐩬𐩸𐩲|t=to withdraw}}, and meeting the meaning of the third stem in Arabic {{cog|sem-srb|𐩬𐩸𐩲|t=to come to grips; quarrel}}.

