===Etymology===
Variant ending to {{ar-root|ن و ي|nocat=1}}, like the opposite {{ar-root|ن و ل|nocat=1}}, and {{ar-root|ص د ء|nocat=1}} against {{ar-root|ص د و|nocat=1}}. ''Dictionnaire du faisceau dialectal arabe andalou'' dubiously claims the noun borrowed from {{der|ar|egy|nw|<hiero>n:U19-nw-W-hrw</hiero>|tr=nw|t=time, season}}, but such a meaning development from very abstract to very concrete sky movement is left without data.

