Page 19032 نبهرج: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ar|pal||*na bahrag}} equalling {{cog|fa-cls|نهبهره|tr=nabahra, nubahra}}, {{m|fa-cls|[[نه]] [[بهره]]|tr=na bahra|t=without profit or advantage, fruitless}}.

===Pronunciation===
