===Etymology 1===
<!-- Note that this word is missing in Wehr and all the classical dictionaries but is found in Dozy and is widespread on the internet -->
Seemingly a metathesis of {{m|ar|جُرْن}} – which is regionally also {{m|ar|جِرْن}} –, possibly motivated by the unrelated verb {{m|ar|نَجَرَ|t=to hew, to plane}} since in a broad sense this is what one does with a mortar.

