Page 19075 نجل: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ن|ج|ل}}. Connectable to {{cog|he|נָגַר|tr=nagar|t=to flow out}}, {{cog|arc|נְגַר|tr=nəgar|t=to flow out}}, {{cog|syc|ܢܓܰܪ|tr=nəgar|t=to last}}, {{cog|gez|ነገድ|t=kin; progeny}}, {{cog|he|נֶכֶד|tr=neḵeḏ|t=progeny}}, {{cog|gez|ነገደ|t=to travel}}, {{cog|arc|נְגַד}} / {{m|syc|ܢܓܰܕ|tr=nəgad|t=to flow; to draw, to pull; to stretch out}}, {{cog|gez|ሞገድ|t=wave}}, {{cog|gez|ነገለ|t=to be uprooted; to roll up}}, {{cog|syc|ܢܓܰܠ|tr=nəgal|t=to clear away}}. From here developing ideas of begetting, offspring creeping out of plants and animals, so also in {{cog|tig|ነገል|tr=näggäl|t=young goat, kid}}.

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/a~i,u.vn:نَجْل}}

# to be covered with vegetation
# to have offspring, to [[beget]], to [[sire]]
# to [[kick]]
# to [[mistreat]]
# to lead out, to draw out
# to remove the skin of
# to cut with the sickle

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i,u.vn:نَجْل}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I/i~a.nopass.vn:نَجَل}}

# to have large or widely open eyes, to be widely open {{q|of an eye}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.nopass.vn:نَجَل}}

===Noun===
