# [[warning]], [[admonition]], [[threat]], ''irregular'' {{ar-verbal noun of|أَنْذَرَ|form=IV}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|54:41-42
|passage=وَلَقَدْ جَاءَ آلَ فِرْعَوْنَ النُّذُرُ كَذَّبُوا بِآيَاتِنَا
|translation=And warning came to the house of the Pharaoh that they reproved.}}

=====Declension=====
