Page 19189 نسخ: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=ar}}

===Etymology 1===
Of the root {{ar-root|ن|س|خ}}, from {{bor|ar|arc|𐡍𐡎𐡇}} / {{m|arc|נְסַח|tr=nsaḥ|t=to take away, to draw off, to eliminate}} related to the Arabic root {{ar-root|ن ز ع|nocat=1}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{sense|verb}} {{ar-IPA|نَسَخَ}}
** {{audio|ar|Ar-نسخ.ogg}}
* {{sense|noun}} {{ar-IPA|نَسْخ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~a.pass.vn:نَسْخ}}

# to [[transcribe]], to [[copy]]
# {{lb|ar|computing}} to [[copy]]
# to [[abolish]]
# to [[delete]]
# to [[abrogate]], to [[invalidate]]
# to [[repeal]], to [[revoke]], to [[withdraw]]
# to [[cancel]]
# to [[substitute]], to [[replace]]

