* {{l|ar|اَلنَّسْر اَلْوَاقِع}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i,u.pass.vn:نَسْر}}

# to [[cut]], [[pierce]], or [[slit]], especially like a vulture or another bird of prey
#: {{syn|ar|قَطَعَ}}
## to [[pluck]]
##: {{syn|ar|نَتَفَ}}
# {{lb|ar|figurative}} to [[bad-mouth]], to [[malign]], to [[abuse]] verbally, to [[slander]], to [[slur]]

=====Conjugation=====
