* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=674}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|pages=283–284}}
* {{cite-book|year=2023|authorlink=James K. Hoffmeier|last=Hoffmeier|first=James K.|title=Linguistic and Philological Studies of the Hebrew Bible and its Manuscripts in Honor of Gary A. Rendsburg|publisher=Brill|location=Leiden|isbn=978-90-04-54484-0|url=https://brill.com/display/book/9789004544840/BP000012.xml|series=Studia Semitica Neerlandica|seriesvolume=75|chapter=Further Reflections on Egyptian Influences on the Early Hebrews—Priestly Matters|page=187}}
* {{cite-web|last=Souag|first=Lameen|work=Jabal al-Lughat|url=https://lughat.blogspot.com/2016/07/darja-notes-elms-and-kids-morphology.html|title=Darja notes: Elms and kids' morphology|date=2016-07-25|accessdate=2 February 2019|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20180215092159/http://lughat.blogspot.com/2016/07/darja-notes-elms-and-kids-morphology.html|archivedate=15 February 2018}}

