Page 19240 نصاب: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|نَصَّاب}}

===Etymology 1===
{{ar-characteristic adjective}} from the verb {{m|ar|نَصَبَ}}.

====Adjective====
{{ar-adj-sound|نَصَّاب}}

# {{lb|ar|colloquial}} [[swindler]], [[deceiver]], [[liar]]
