===Etymology 1===
{{ar-rootbox|ن ص ب}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~u,i.vn:نَصْب}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[set up]], to [[lay]], to [[erect]], to [[raise]], to [[build]]
#: {{ux|ar|‫نَصَبَ نَفْسَهُ لِشَيْءٍ‬
|translation=to dedicate oneself to sth}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive|grammar}} to raise the vowel to ''/a/''
## {{lb|ar|grammar}} to put into the [[accusative]] case
## {{lb|ar|grammar}} to put into the subjunctive mood
# {{lb|ar|ditransitive}} to [[proclaim]], to [[declare]], to [[arrogate]] to oneself {{qualifier|king, war, sovereignty …}}
#: {{syn|ar|أَعْلَنَ|دَعَا|نَادَىٰ|alt3=نَدَىٰ بِ}}
# {{lb|ar|transitive|_|with {{l|ar|عَلَىٰ|tr=-}}|formal}} to [[concern]], to be [[directed]] at, to [[focus]] on, to [[concentrate]] on
# {{lb|ar|transitive|informal}} to [[swindle]], to [[scam]], to [[ambush]]
# to [[appoint]], to [[assign]]
#: {{ux|ar|‫نَصَبَ نَفْسَهُ مَلِكًا‬
|translation=he proclaimed himself king}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~u,i.vn:نَصْب}}

