|passage=فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ '''فَٱنْصَبْ'''؛ وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب
|translation=So when thou art free [from thy tasks], '''then strive''' [in worship]. And toward thy Lord and Master turn [thy] attention.}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/i~a.vn:نَصَب}}

====Verb====
