# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[install]], to [[establish]]
#: {{ux|ar|سَيَأْتِيْ اَلْعُمَّالُ اَلْيَوْمَ لِتَرْكِيبِ اَلْأَلْوَاحِ اَلْشَمْسِيَّة.
|translation=Workers are coming to install the solar panels today.}}
#: {{ux|ar|عِنْدَمَا نَصَّبْتَ اَلْبَرْنَامَجَ، هَلْ أَنْشَأْتَ لَهُ كَلِمَة سِرّ؟
|translation=When you installed the program did you set up a password?}}
# to [[appoint]], to [[assign]]

