Page 19254 نصيبين: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|syc|ܢܨܝܒܝܢ|tr=nəṣībīn}}, an {{der|ar|arc-old|-}} plural formation dating to the 2nd millennium BCE from {{m|arc|ܢܨܝܒ|tr=nəṣīb|pos=adjective|t=erected, planted}} from the root {{syc-root-entry|ܢ|ܨ|ܒ}} cognate to the Arabic {{ar-root|ن ص ب|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|نُصَيْبِين|نَصِيبِين}}

{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Proper noun===
{{ar-proper noun|نُصَيْبِين|f|head2=نَصِيبِين}}

