===Etymology 1===
Apparently from {{bor|ar|sem-srb|-}}, perhaps mediated and distorted in local {{bor|ar|arc|-}}, compare {{cog|xsa|𐩬𐩦𐩱|t=to build up, to raise (buildings, terraces etc.); to take out (water); to levy (taxes); to expel}}, {{m|xsa|𐩬𐩦𐩱𐩬|t=a social class, [[stratum]]}}, {{m|xsa|𐩣𐩬𐩦𐩱|t=a gathering, assembly; (military) campaign, offensive}}, figurative developments of the cognate to the {{cog|ar|-}} root {{ar-root|ن ش ء|nocat=1}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|نِطْع|head2=نَطْع|head3=نَطَع|head4=نِطَع|pl=نُطُوع|pl2=أَنْطَاع|m}}

