# {{lb|ar|dated}} any [[covering]] for [[human]] or [[animal]] [[foot|feet]], a [[shoe]] (such as [[human]] [[footwear]] or a [[horseshoe]])
#: {{syn|ar|حِذَاء}}
# {{lb|ar|modern}} a [[light]] [[shoe]] for [[human]] [[foot|feet]] (such as a [[slipper]])

