Page 19329 نغت: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
{{unk|ar}}, the local word of the narrow strip of {{w|Greater Syria}} where the [[c:File:Alnus distribution.svg|genus is common]] along banks of streams to 1500 m. The ancient Hebrew and Aramaic (or even Arabic) terms are unknown. Later Hebrew designates {{m|he|לִבְנֶה|tr=lib̄né}} for this tree.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|نَغْت}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|نَغْت|m}}

# [[alder]] ({{taxfmt|Alnus|genus}} gen. et spp.)
#: {{syn|ar|جَار الْمَاء}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|نَغْت}}

{{C|ar|Birch family plants|Woods}}
