===Etymology===
{{ar-characteristic adjective}} from the root {{ar-root|ن ف ج}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|نَفَّاج}}

===Adjective===
{{ar-adj-sound|نَفَّاج}}

# {{lb|ar|elevated}} [[arrogant]], [[snobbish]], [[flaunting]]
#* {{quote-web|ar|url=http://www.iraqiwriters.com/inp/view.asp?ID=3603|title=ar: فاضل العزاوي: ما بقي من (جماعة كركوك) هو إبداع شعرائها|work=IraqWriters.com|author=ar:حسام السراي|date=27-07-2015|passage=تِلْكَ ٱلْخُصْلَةُ ٱلَّتِي يَكَادُ يَنْفَرِدُ بِهَا ٱلْعِرَاقِيُّونَ. وَكَانَ ثَمَّةَ أَيْضًا '''نَفَّاجُونَ''' أَدْعِيَاءُ وَفَاشِلُونَ يُحَرِّضُونَ هَٰذَا ضِدَّ ذَاكَ،|t=This bunch from which the Iraqis almost isolated themselves. And there were also pretentious '''snob'''s and losers who instigates this against that.}}

