Page 19437 نمام: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Two nouns formed with the form of a {{ar-characteristic adjective|lc=1}} from the root {{ar-root|ن م م}}. The choice of root pattern for plant-name is like that of {{m|ar|شَمَّام|t=melon}}. Its variation is found reversely in {{m|ar|نُعَاع}} for {{m|ar|لُعَاع|t=tender or fresh greenery; endive}} related to {{m|ar|لَاعِيَة|t=green spurge or sun spurge}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|نَمَّام|m|pl=نَمَّامُون|f=نَمَّامَة}}

# [[tale-bearer]], [[tattletale]]
# [[denouncer]], [[informant]]
# [[slanderer]], [[calumniator]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-gendered-noun|نَمَّام|pl=نَمَّامُون}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|نَمَّام|m}}

# [[wild thyme]], {{taxfmt|Thymus serpyllum|species}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|نَمَّام}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ar|لَمَّام}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Almaany}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=337}}

{{C|ar|Mint family plants}}
