# {{inflection of|ar|هَالَ||active|participle}}.
## [[tremendous]]
### {{lb|ar|dated}} [[awe-inspiring]], [[terrifying]]
### [[enormous]], [[gigantic]]
###* {{quote-journal|1=ar|url=http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509544945664889000/|date=Nov 2 2017|work=Al-Quds|title=ar:مع قرب موعد أول عملية زراعة رأس لإنسان...المخاطر والعواقب|accessdate=3 November 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20171102214534/http://www.alquds.com/articles/1509544945664889000/|archivedate=2 November 2017
|passage=لَا يَسَعْنِي إِلَّا أَنْ أَفْصَحَ عَنْ حُدُوثِ تَقَدُّمٍ هَائِلٍ فِي ٱلتَّجَارِبِ ٱلطِّبِّيَّةِ، كَانَ يَبْدُو مُسْتَحِيلًا حَتَى أَخِيرًا مُنْذُ بِضْعَةِ أَشْهُرٍ. وَمِنَ ٱلْمُؤَكَّدِ أَنَّ ٱلْمَعَالِمَ ٱلَّتِي تَمَّ ٱلتَّوَصُّلُ إِلَيْهَا سَتُحْدِثُ ثَوْرَةً فِي ٱلطِّبِّ.
|translation=I can only express that there has come forth a tremendous progress in the medical trials which used to seem untransactable until lately some months ago. And it is certain that the reached milestones will spawn a revolution in medicine.}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-adj|هَائِل}}

