* [http://lisaan.net/%d9%87%d9%8e%d8%a7%d8%a6%d9%90%d9%84/#a9e75d3237a94f0215fdda714119d85a Mu`jam al-Sawaab al-Lughawi by Ahmad Mukhtar Umar (d. 2003 CE) معجم الصواب اللغوي لأحمد مختار عمر]

