From {{bor|ar|he|הֲדַס|tr=hăḏás|t=myrtle}}. {{cog|jpa|-}}, {{cog|arc-jla|הֲדַסַא|tr=hăḏasā|t=myrtle}} is likely itself a Hebraism.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|هَدَس}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|هَدَس|m}}

# {{tlb|ar|Yemen|Oman}} [[myrtle]] ({{taxfmt|Myrtus|genus}} gen. et spp.)
#: {{syn|ar|آس|رَيْحَان|مَرْسِين|قُمَام}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|هَدَس}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bor=1|am|ኣደስ|አደስ}}
* {{desc|gez|አደስ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|mhadasi|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ti|ኣደስ|bor=1}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ar:Schönig|pages=84–85}}

{{C|ar|Myrtle family plants}}
