Page 20059 وجنة: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|ar|إجانة|مِيجَنَة|t=fuller's beetle}}, as the three [[apophysis|apophyses]] of this bone, consisting of a medial and lateral surface continued by an orbital process, can be likened to the pan and handle of a battledore.

