* {{desc|ota|ورد|tr=verd|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|ورد|tr=vard|bor=1}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:ar:Asbaghi|page=271}}
* {{R:xcl:Bläsing:2019|page=33}}

