Page 20113 ورس: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Flemingia macrophylla Sensu Walker at Makutta (7).jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|ورس}}|upright=1.15]]

===Etymology===
Cognate to {{cog|syc|ܘܐܪܫܐ|tr=wʾršʾ}}, {{m|syc|ܘܪܘܫ|tr=wrwš}}, {{m|syc|ܘܪܝܫܐ|tr=wryšʾ}}, {{m|syc|ܘܪܫܐ|tr=wršʾ}}, which shows by its initial {{IPAchar|/w/}}, as this in inherited {{cog|sem-nwe}} words becomes {{IPAchar|/j/}}, that it is a foreign word. The varying vocalization of the Arabic may indicate an {{bor|ar|ira}} borrowing akin to {{cog|fa|وش|tr=vaš|t=flax or [[boll]] thereof; uncleaned cotton; a kind of rich satin or other textile}}, {{cog|xcl|վուշ|t=flax; tows thereof}}, as {{IPAchar|/a/}} regularly switches to {{IPAchar|/u/}} after initial labial during the transition from {{cog|pal|-}} to {{cog|fa|-}} in most of its regiolects.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|وَرْس|وَرَس|وُرْس|وُرُس}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|وَرْس|head2=وَرَس|head3=وُرْس|head4=وُرُس|m}}

# {{taxlink|Flemingia macrophylla|species}} syns. {{taxlink|Flemingia rhodocarpa|species}}, {{taxlink|Flemingia grahamiana|species}}, a [[perennial]] [[shrub]] native to [[Yemen]] cultivated because the [[red]] [[gland]]s of it secrete a [[yellow]] [[powder]] used as a [[pigment]] and medicinally, but also for a red pigment from the ground hairs of the red fruits, as well as for medicinal purposes
#: {{syn|ar|غُمْرَة}}
#* {{RQ:Mafatih-Vloten|pages=169 line 12–170 line 2|footer=<small>commented in {{R:ar:Seidel:1915|page=37 Anm. 89}}</small>|passage=الَوْرْس يجلب من اليمن أحمر قانٍ يوجد على قشور شجر ينحت منها ويجمع وهو شبيه بالزعفران المسحوق|t=''Wars'' is imported from Yemen, blood-red, produces a tree-rind hewn out and collected and it is similar to brayed saffron.}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|وَرْس|head2=وَرَس|head3=وُرْس|head4=وُرُس}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[dye]] with {{taxlink|Flemingia macrophylla|species}}

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|وَرِيس|t=garment dyed with ''wars''}}
* {{l|ar|وَرَّسَ|t=to dye with ''wars''}}
* {{l|ar|أَوْرَسَ|t=to put forth ''wars''}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|har|ወርሲ|bor=1|tr=wärsi}}
* {{desc|so|waris|bor=1}}

