Page 20147 وسادة: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Pillow MET DP275232.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|وِسَادَة}}]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|وِسَاد|وُسَاد|وَسَاد}}

===Etymology===
Originally, a thing placed under the base of the head to sleep upon, hence a cushion, a seat or place to rest something upon. Cognate to {{cog|he|יְסוֹד|tr=yǝsṓḏ|t=base, foundation}}, {{cog|arc|אִיסָדָא|tr=ʾĕsāḏā|t=thing placed beneath, at the base or bottom; pillow}}, {{cog|syc|ܒܣܕܝܐ|tr=bessāḏyā|lit=at the base or pillow|t=pillow, couch, place to rest upon}}, {{cog|uga|𐎊𐎒𐎄|t=base, foundation}}, {{cog|akk|𒅖𒁲|ts=išdu|t=base, foundation}}, ultimately {{der|ar|sem-pro|-}} in origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|ar|Ar-وسادة.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|وِسَادَة|head2=وَسَادَة|head3=وُسَادَة|f|pl=وَسَائِد|pl2=وِسَادَات|pl3=وَسَادَات|pl4=وُسَادَات}}

# [[pillow]], [[cushion]], [[bolster]]
# [[throne]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|وِسَادَة|head2=وَسَادَة|head3=وُسَادَة|f|pl=وَسَائِد|pl2=وِسَادَات|pl3=وَسَادَات|pl4=وُسَادَات}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ar|وَسَّدَ|t=to put a pillow under; to put to a pillow, to lay, to rest}}
* {{l|ar|تَوَسَّدَ|t=to employ a pillow; to occupy oneself without cease with, to neglect other things for something}}

{{C|ar|Bedding}}

