** {{IPA|arz|/waʔt/|a=Egyptian}}
** {{IPA|afb|/wakt/|a=Gulf}}
** {{IPA|acw|/waɡt/|a=Hijazi}}
** {{IPA|ary|/waqt/|a=Moroccan}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-وقت.ogg}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I/a~i.pass.vn:وَقْت}}<ref>{{R:ar:Wehr-4|وقت}}</ref>

# to [[determine]], [[define]], or [[place]] a [[limit]] on a [[thing]] especially [[time]]
# to [[fix]] [[boundary|boundaries]] of [[duration]], to [[set]] or [[appoint]] a time for [[something]] to [[occur]] especially the [[fall]]ing [[due]] of an [[obligation]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I/a~i.pass.vn:وَقْت}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|وَقْت|m|pl=أَوْقَات}}

# {{ar-verbal noun of|وَقَتَ|form=I}}
# [[time]] (as an abstract concept)
# [[period]] of time, time span
# [[moment]], [[instant]]

