Page 20272 ولا: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Morphologically {{compound|ar|وَ|لَا|t1=and|t2=not}}.

===Conjunction===
{{ar-con|وَلَا|tr=wa-lā}}

# {{non-gloss definition|For non-idiomatic uses, see {{m|ar|وَ}} and {{m|ar|لَا}}.}}
#: {{ux|ar|أَقْرَأُ ٱلْكِتَابَ '''وَلَا''' أَفْهَمُ شَيْئًا مِنْهُ|I’m reading the book, '''and''' I do '''not''' understand anything in it.|subst=وَلَا/وَ-لَا}}
# [[nor]]; {{q|with a preceding negative}} [[or]]
#: {{ux|ar|لَمْ أَشْعُرْ بِٱلْحُزْنِ '''وَلَا''' بِٱلْفَرَحِ|I did not feel sadness '''nor''' joy.|subst=وَلَا/وَ-لَا}}
# {{lb|ar|idiomatic|used to emphasize a negative}} (not) [[even]]; (not) [[at all]]
#: {{ux|ar|لَنْ تَجِدَ خَيْرًا مِن هٰذَا '''وَلَا''' فِي أَمْرِيكَا|You won’t '''even''' find anything better than this in America.|lit=You won’t find anything better than this, '''and not''' in America.|subst=وَلَا/وَ-لَا}}

[[Category:Arabic phrasebook]]

-------- end text --------
Page 20273 ولا سيما: -------- begin text --------
