{{ar-verb|I/a~i.pass.vn:وِلَادَة,لِدَة,مَوْلِد}}

# to [[bear]], to [[beget]]
#: {{uxi|ar|وُلِدْتُ فِي مَدِينَةٍ كَبِيرَةٍ.|t=I '''was born''' in a big city.}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|112|3|passage=لَمْ '''يَلِدْ''' وَلَمْ '''يُولَدْ'''|t=He neither '''begets''' nor '''is born''',}}
# to [[produce]], to bring forth

