Page 20370 يتيم: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From the root {{ar-root|ي ت م}}, from {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*yatam-|t=to be fatherless or without a guardian, to be without support of family or tribe, to be disenfranchised or alone}}. Compare {{cog|arc|יַתְמָא|tr=yaṯmā}}, {{cog|syc|ܝܲܬ݂ܡܵܐ|tr=yaṯmā}}, {{cog|phn|𐤉‬𐤕‬𐤌‬|tr=}}, {{cog|myz|ࡉࡀࡕࡉࡌࡀ|tr=yatima}}, {{cog|he|יָתוֹם|tr=yatóm}}, {{cog|tig|ያፓም|tr=yattam}}, and {{cog|uga|𐎊𐎚𐎎|tr=}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|يَتِيم}}

