===Noun===
{{ar-noun|يَد|f|d=يَدَان|pl=أَيْدٍ|pl2=أَيَادٍ}} {{tlb|ar|countable}}

# an [[appendage]] of a [[body]] (as of an [[animal]])
#: {{uxi|ar|لِلْأُخْطُبُوطِ ثَمَانِي أَيْدٍ.|t=Octopuses have eight arms.}}
#: {{syn|ar|ذِرَاع|طَرَف}}
## {{lb|ar|of quadrupeds|literary}} a [[foreleg]]
##: {{cot|ar|رِجْل|t=hind leg}}
## {{lb|ar|of primates|obsolete}} the [[upper]] [[limb]], the [[arm]]
##: {{syn|ar|ذِرَاع}}
## {{lb|ar|of birds|literary}} a [[wing]]
## {{lb|ar|of a garment}} the [[covering]] of the [[arm]], the [[arm]] of a [[garment]], the [[sleeve]]
##: {{syn|ar|كُمّ}}
## {{lb|ar|by extension}} something [[resemble|resembling]], [[liken]]ed to, or [[relate]]d to an [[appendage]]; including various technical elements perceived as an [[appendage]]:
### [[pestle]] for a [[mortar]] {{q|this is the normal term for it in Arabic}}
###: {{syn|ar|مِدَقّ|دَسْتَج|q2=also normal in al-Andalus|}}
### [[tiller]] of a [[rudder]]
### [[armrest]] of an [[armchair]]
### [[handle]] of an [[axe]] or [[hatchet]]
### handle of a [[quernstone]]
### tip of an [[archery]] [[bow]]
# {{lb|ar|of primates}} the [[part]] of the [[upper]] [[limb]] between the [[wrist]] and the [[fingertip]]s, the [[terminal]] [[portion]] of the [[arm]], the [[hand]]
#: {{syn|ar|كَفّ}}
## {{lb|ar|by extension}} the [[capacity]] to [[handle]] a thing, [[ability]], [[power]], [[kingship]], [[ownership]], [[help]], [[grip]], [[control]], [[hand]], [[dexterity]], [[métier]] and so on
# {{lb|ar|al-Andalus|Morocco|_|in|_|the Middle Ages}} {{n-g|a unit of measure}}
## [[flock]] of [[sheep]]
## a [[portion]] of a [[meadow]] [[snithe|snithen]] by two to three [[grasscutter]]s or [[harvestman|harvestmen]] in a row
## a vine [[row]] of 30, 40 or 60 [[cubit]]s depending on the terrain worked by four [[vigneron]]s one after the other
##* {{R:ar:Lévi-Provençal:1934|page=247 (٥٥) line 4}}
##* {{RQ:Awwam|volume=1|page=530 line 16}}
##*: the edition is bad and has been corrected here by {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=849a}}
## a [[quire]] of [[paper]]
##: {{syn|ar|رِزْمَة|حُزْمَة|كُرَّاسَة}}

