===Etymology===
{{rfv-etym|ar}} From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʕakbar-|t=[[mouse]]}} mingled with {{m|ar|عُرْقُوب|t=[[hamstring]], [[Achilles tendon]]}} from {{m|sem-pro|*ʿarqūb-|t=[[hamstring]], [[Achilles tendon]]}} in specialization to the fauna of the Arabian desert where the jerboa is marked by its jumping muscles. Compare {{cog|syc|ܥܽܘܩܒܪܳܐ|tr=ʾuqbarā|t=[[mouse]]}}, {{cog|he|עַכְבָּר|tr=ʾaḵbār|t=[[mouse]]}}.

