===Etymology===
Perhaps {{blend|ar|يَمّ|حَمَام|t1=sea|t2=dove|nocap=1}}, particularly listed to mean the {{vern|blue rock pigeon}} ({{taxfmt|Columba livia|species}}) and the [[stock dove]] ({{taxfmt|Columba oenas|species}}), or of {{m|ar|حَمَام}} with the {{bor|ar|arc|-}} designation of the dove {{m|arc|יוון|tr=yawōn}} / {{m|arc|יבן|tr=yaḇōn}} ({{cog|jpa|-}} as well as {{cog|arc-cpa|-}}, in {{cog|syc|ܝܘܢܐ|tr=yawnā}}). However most close to {{cog|sem-amo|𒅀𒈠𒀀𒈠|tr=ia-ma-a-ma|g=f|ts=yamāma|pos=''a female given name''|lit=pigeon}}.

