# {{n-g|names for [[dove]]s or [[pigeon]]s, especially}} {{taxfmt|Streptopelia|genus}} of which especially {{taxfmt|Streptopelia risoria|species}}, {{taxfmt|Columba oenas|species}} and {{taxfmt|Columba livia|species}}

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-coll-noun|يَمَام}}

