===Conjunction===
{{ar-con|يَوْمَ}}

# at the day when
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|79|46
|passage=كَأَنَّهُمْ '''يَوْمَ''' يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوا إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَاهَا
|translation=It will be, '''on the Day''' they see it, as though they had not remained except for an afternoon or a morning thereof.}}

